<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="NUM" style="id">num.txt Māori macronized text, extracted 16-05-06</book>
  <para style="h">Tauanga</para>
  <para style="toc3">Taua</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Pukapuka Tuawhā a Mohi e Kīia nei ko te</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tauanga</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="NUM 1" />
  <para style="s">Te Tauanga Tuatahi o Īharaira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 1:1" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi i te i koraha o Hinai i roto i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i te rā tuatahi o te rua o ngā marama, i te rua o ngā tau o tō rātou haerenga mai i te whenua o Īhipa, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 1:2" />“Tirohia te tokomaha o te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa i ngā ingoa o ngā tāne katoa, tēnei pane, tēnei pane ō rātou. <verse eid="NUM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 1:3" />Ko ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ngā tau, ko ngā mea hoki e kaha ana i roto i a Īharaira ki te haere ki te whawhai, mā kōrua ko Ārona rātou e tatau, tēnei ope, tēnei ope. <verse eid="NUM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 1:4" />Kia kotahi hoki te tangata o tēnei iwi, o tēnei iwi, hei hoa mō kōrua; arā ko ngā upoko o tēnei whare, o tēnei whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="NUM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 1:5" />Ko ngā ingoa hoki ēnei o ngā tāngata e tū tahi me kōrua:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:5">Nō Reupena; ko Erituru, tama a Hereuru.<verse eid="NUM 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 1:6" />Nō Himiona; ko Herumiere, tama a Turiharai.<verse eid="NUM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 1:7" />Nō Hūrā; ko Nāhahona, tama a Aminarapa.<verse eid="NUM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 1:8" />Nō Ihākara; ko Netanēre, tama a Tuara.<verse eid="NUM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 1:9" />Nō Hepurona; ko Eriapa, tama a Herona.<verse eid="NUM 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 1:10" />Nō ngā tama a Hōhepa:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:10">nō Ēparaima; ko Erihama, tama a Amihuru;</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 1:10">nō Mānahi; ko Kamariere, tama a Peraturu.<verse eid="NUM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 1:11" />Nō Pineamine; ko Apirana, tama a Kirioni.<verse eid="NUM 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 1:12" />Nō Rāna; ko Ahiētere, tama a Amiharai.<verse eid="NUM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 1:13" />Nō Āhera; ko Pakiere, tama a Okorana.<verse eid="NUM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 1:14" />Nō Kara; ko Eriāhapa, tama a Teuere.<verse eid="NUM 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 1:15" />Nō Napatari; ko Ahira, tama a Enana.”<verse eid="NUM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 1:16" />Ko ngā mea whai ingoa ēnei o te whakaminenga, ko ngā ariki o ngā iwi o ō rātou mātua; ko rātou ngā upoko o ngā mano i roto i a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 1:17" />Nā, ka tīkina e Mohi rāua ko Ārona ēnei tāngata nō rātou ngā ingoa kua whakahuatia nei, <verse eid="NUM 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 1:18" />ā, huihuia ana e rātou te whakaminenga katoa i te rā tuatahi o te rua o ngā marama. Ā, ka whakaaturia e rātou ō rātou whakapapa, tēnei hapū, tēnei hapū, me ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa, he pane, he pane, ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau. <verse eid="NUM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 1:19" />Rite tonu ki tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi tāna tauanga i a rātou i te koraha o Hinai.<verse eid="NUM 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 1:20" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Reupena, mātāmua a Īharaira: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa, he pane, he pane, o ngā tāne katoa e rua tekau. He maha atu rānei ngā tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 1:21" />Ko ngā mea o rātou, o te iwi o Reupena, i taua, e whā tekau mā ono mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 1:22" />Nō ngā tama a Himiona: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa, he pane, he pane, o ngā tāne katoa e rua tekau he maha atu rānei ngā tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 1:23" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Himiona, e rima tekau mā iwa mano e toru rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 1:24" />Nō ngā tama a Kara: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ngā tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 1:25" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Kara, e whā tekau mā rima mano e ono rau e rima tekau.<verse eid="NUM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 1:26" />Nō ngā tama a Hūrā: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 1:27" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Hūrā, e whitu tekau mā whā mano e ono rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 1:28" />Nō ngā tama a Ihākara: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 1:29" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Ihākara, e rima tekau mā whā mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 1:30" />Nō ngā tama a Hepurona: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 1:31" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Hepurona, e rima tekau mā whitu mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 1:32" />Nō ngā tama a Hōhepa: arā nō ngā tama a Ēparaima: i ō rātou torōna, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou Matua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 1:33" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Ēparaima, e whā tekau mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 1:34" />Nō ngā tama a Mānahi: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 1:35" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Mānahi, e toru tekau mā rua mano e rua rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 1:36" />Nō ngā tama a Pineamine: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 1:37" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Pineamine, e toru tekau mā rima mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 1:38" />Nō ngā tama a Rāna: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 1:39" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Rāna, e ono tekau mā rua mano e whitu rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 1:40" />Nō ngā tama a Āhera: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 1:41" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Āhera, e whā tekau mā tahi mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 1:42" />Nō ngā tama a Napatari: i ō rātou toronga, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, tatau rawa ngā ingoa o ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, o ngā mea katoa i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 1:43" />Ko ngā mea i taua o rātou, o te iwi o Napatari, e rima tekau mā toru mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 1:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 1:44" />Ko ngā mea ēnei i taua nei e Mohi, e Ārona rātou ko ngā ariki kotahi tekau mā rua o Īharaira; takikotahi te tangata o rātou ki te whare o ōna mātua. <verse eid="NUM 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 1:45" />Ā, ko aua tāngata i taua o ngā tama a Īharaira, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau i roto i a Īharaira i kaha ki te haere ki te whawhai – <verse eid="NUM 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 1:46" />ko aua tāngata katoa i taua e ono rau e toru mano e rima rau e rima tekau.<verse eid="NUM 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 1:47" />Ko ngā Rīwaiti ia, i te iwi o ō rātou mātua, kīhai i taua i roto i a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 1:48" />Nā Ihowā hoki i kōrero ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 1:49" />“Otiia kaua e taua te iwi o Rīwai, kaua anō e tirohia tō rātou tokomaha i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 1:50" />Engari me whakarite ngā Rīwaiti mō te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga, mō ōna oko katoa, mō ōna mea katoa hoki. Mā rātou te tapenākara e amo, me ōna oko katoa; ā, me mahi ki reira, me noho hoki ki tētahi taha, ki tētahi taha o te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 1:51" />Ā, ka maunu atu te tapenākara, mā ngā Rīwaiti e wāhi iho; ka whakatūria anō hoki te tapenākara, mā ngā Rīwaiti e whakatū; ā, ko te tangata kē e whakatata atu, ka whakamatea. <verse eid="NUM 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 1:52" />Me whakatū anō ō rātou tēneti e ngā tama a Īharaira ki tōna puni, ki tōna puni, ki tōna kara, ki tōna kara, puta noa i ō rātou ope. <verse eid="NUM 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 1:53" />Ko ngā Rīwaiti ia, me whakatū o rātou ki tētahi taha, ki tētahi taha o te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga, kei puta he riri ki te whakaminenga o ngā tama a Īharaira; ā, mā ngā Rīwaiti e tiaki te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga.”<verse eid="NUM 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 1:54" />Nā, i pērā ngā tama a Īharaira; rite tonu ki tā Ihowā katoa i whakahau ai ki a Mohi tā rātou mahi.<verse eid="NUM 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="NUM 2" />
  <para style="s">Te Whakaritenga o ngā Puni ā-Iwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 2:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 2:2" />“Me whakatū tōna tēneti e ngā tama a Īharaira, ki te taha o tōna kara, o tōna kara, ki ngā tohu o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; hei te takiwā atu ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga te tūranga o ō rātou tēneti ā tawhio noa.”<verse eid="NUM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 2:3" />Ki te taha ki te rāwhiti, arā ki te putanga mai o te rā, whakatū ai ngā tāngata o te kara o te puni o Hūrā, me ō rātou ope. Ko Nāhahona tama a Aminarapa hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Hūrā. <verse eid="NUM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 2:4" />Ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whitu tekau mā whā mano e ono rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 2:5" />Nā, ko ngā mea e whakatū tēneti ki tua atu i a ia ko te iwi o Ihākara; ā, ko Netanēre tama a Tuara hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Ihākara; <verse eid="NUM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 2:6" />ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā whā mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 2:7" />Ā, ko te iwi o Hepurona: ā, ko Eriapa tama a Herona, hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Hepurona; <verse eid="NUM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 2:8" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā whitu mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 2:9" />Ko ngā tāngata katoa i taua o te puni o Hūrā kotahi rau e waru tekau mā ono mano e whā rau, i ō rātou ope. Ko ēnei e haere wawe.<verse eid="NUM 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 2:10" />Hei te taha ki te tonga te kara o te puni o Reupena, me ō rātou ope. Ā, ko Erituru tama a Hereuru, hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Reupena; <verse eid="NUM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 2:11" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whā tekau mā ono mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 2:12" />Ā, me whakatū ki tōna taha ko te iwi o Himiona; ā, ko Herumiere tama a Turiharai, hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Himiona. <verse eid="NUM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 2:13" />Ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā iwa mano e toru rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 2:14" />Ko reira te iwi o Kara; ā, ko Eriāhapa tama a Reuere, hei rangatira mō ngā tama a Kara; <verse eid="NUM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 2:15" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whā tekau mā rima mano e ono rau e rima tekau.<verse eid="NUM 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 2:16" />Ko ngā tāngata katoa i taua o te puni o Reupena kotahi rau e rima tekau mā tahi mano e whā rau e rima tekau, i ō rātou ope. Me haere rātou hei tuarua mō ngā matua.<verse eid="NUM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 2:17" />Ko reira maunu atu ai te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ko te puni o ngā Rīwaiti ki waenganui o ngā puni; kia rite tō rātou haerenga ki tō rātou nohoanga iho, ia tangata ki tōna wāhi, i te taha anō o ō rātou kara.<verse eid="NUM 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 2:18" />Hei te taha ki te hauāuru te kara o te puni o Ēparaima, me ō rātou ope. Ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Ēparaima, ko Erihama, tama a Amihuru; <verse eid="NUM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 2:19" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whā tekau mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 2:20" />Ā, ki tōna taha ko te iwi o Mānahi; ā, ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Mānahi ko Kamariere, tama a Peraturu; <verse eid="NUM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 2:21" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e toru tekau mā rua mano e rua rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 2:22" />Ko reira te iwi o Pineamine; ā, ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Pineamine ko Apirana tama a Kirioni; <verse eid="NUM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 2:23" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e toru tekau mā rima mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 2:24" />Ko ngā tāngata katoa i taua o te puni o Ēparaima kotahi rau e waru mano, kotahi rau, i ō rātou ope. Ā, ka hāpainga rātou hei tuatoru mō ngā matua.<verse eid="NUM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 2:25" />Hei te taha ki te raki te kara o te puni o Rāna, me ō rātou ope; ā, ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Rāna ko Ahiētere tama a Amiharai; <verse eid="NUM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 2:26" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e ono tekau mā rua mano e whitu rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 2:27" />Nā, me whakatū ki tōna taha ko te iwi o Āhera; ā, ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Āhera ko Pakiere tama a Okorana; <verse eid="NUM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 2:28" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whā tekau mā tahi mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 2:29" />Ko reira te iwi o Napatari; ā, ko te rangatira mō ngā tama a Napatari ko Ahira tama a Enana; <verse eid="NUM 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 2:30" />ā, ko tōna ope, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā toru mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 2:31" />Ko ngā mea katoa i taua o te puni o Rāna kotahi rau e rima tekau mā whitu mano e ono rau. Hei muri rawa rātou haere ai, me ō rātou kara.<verse eid="NUM 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 2:32" />Ko ēnei o ngā tama a Īharaira i taua, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; taua ake o ngā puni, i ō rātou ope, e ono rau e toru mano e rima rau e rima tekau. <verse eid="NUM 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 2:33" />Ko ngā Rīwaiti ia, kīhai i taua i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira; ko tā Ihowā hoki tēnā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 2:34" />Nā, ka pērātia e ngā tama a Īharaira; ka pērātia katoatia i tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi: Tā rātou whakanoho ki te taha o ā rātou kara, tō rātou hāpainga atu, tēnei, tēnei, i roto i tōna hapū anō, rite tonu ki ngā whare o ō rātou mātua.<verse eid="NUM 2:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="NUM 3" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Tama a Ārona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 3:1" />Nā, ko ngā whakatupuranga anō hoki ēnei o Ārona rāua ko Mohi i te rā i kōrero ai a Ihowā ki a Mohi i Maunga Hinai. <verse eid="NUM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 3:2" />Ko ngā ingoa hoki ēnei o ngā tama a Ārona: ko Nātapa, ko te mātāmua, rātou ko Apihu, ko Ereātara, ko Itamara. <verse eid="NUM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 3:3" />Nō ngā ingoa ēnei Ārona, o ngā tohunga i whakawahia, i whakatohungatia nei e ia hei tohunga. <verse eid="NUM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 3:4" />I mate hoki a Nātapa rāua ko Apihu ki te aroaro o Ihowā, i tā rāua whakaherenga i te ahi kē ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ki te koraha o Hinai, kāhore anō hoki ā rāua tamariki; ā, i mahi a Ereātara rāua ko Itamara i ngā mahi a te tohunga i te tirohanga mai a tō rāua pāpā, a Ārona.<verse eid="NUM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Mahi a ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 3:5" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 3:6" />“Whakatātaia mai te iwi o Rīwai, whakatūria hoki ki te aroaro o Ārona tohunga, kia mahi ai rātou ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 3:7" />Ā, mā rātou e tiaki ngā mea hei tiakanga māna, hei tiakanga hoki mā te whakaminenga katoa, ki mua i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, e mahi hoki ngā mahi o te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 3:8" />Mā rātou anō e tiaki ngā mea katoa o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, me ngā mea hei tiakanga mā ngā tama a Īharaira, kia mahi ai hoki ngā mahi o te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 3:9" />Ā, me hoatu e koe ngā Rīwaiti ki a Ārona rātou ko āna tama e hoatutia katoatia ana rātou ki a ia mō ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 3:10" />Me whakarite anō e koe a Ārona rātou ko āna tama, ā, ka ū rātou ki tā rātou mahi tohunga; ko te tangata kē e whakatata mai ka whakamatea.”<verse eid="NUM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 3:11" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 3:12" />“Ko ahau nei, nanā, kua tango ahau i ngā Rīwaiti i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira hei utu mō ngā mātāmua katoa e oroko puta mai ana i te kōpū i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira. Māku hoki ngā Rīwaiti, <verse eid="NUM 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 3:13" />nō te mea, nāku ngā mātāmua katoa; nō te rā anō i patu ai ahau i ngā mātāmua katoa o te whenua o Īhipa tāku whakatapunga i ngā mātāmua katoa a Īharaira māku, i ā te tangata, i ā te kararehe; māku ērā. Ko Ihowā ahau.”<verse eid="NUM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Tatauranga o ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 3:14" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i te koraha o Hinai, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 3:15" />Taua ngā tama a Rīwai, tēnei whare, tēnei whare o ō rātou mātua, tēnei hapū, tēnei hapū o rātou; me tatau rātou e koe, ngā tāne katoa kotahi nei te marama, ahu atu. <verse eid="NUM 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 3:16" />Nā, ka taua rātou e Mohi ka pērātia me tā Ihowā i kī ai, i whakahau ai.<verse eid="NUM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 3:17" />Ā, ko ngā tama ēnei a Rīwai me ō rātou ingoa: ko Kerehona, ko Kohata, ko Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 3:18" />Ā, ko ngā ingoa ēnei o ngā tama a Kerehona, o tēnei hapū, o tēnei hapū o rātou: ko Ripini rāua ko Himei. <verse eid="NUM 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 3:19" />Me ngā tama a Kohata, o tēnei hapū, o tēnei hapū o rātou: ko Āmarama, ko Itihara, ko Heperona, ko Utiere. <verse eid="NUM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 3:20" />Me ngā tama a Merari, o tēnei hapū, o tēnei hapū o rātou: ko Māhari, ko Muhi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 3:20">Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Rīwaiti, o tēnei whare, o tēnei whare o ō rātou mātua.<verse eid="NUM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 3:21" />Nā, Kerehona te hapū o ngā Ripini, me te hapū o ngā Himei; ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Kerehoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 3:22" />Ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, ko te tokomaha o ngā tāne katoa, kotahi nei te marama ahu atu, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua e whitu mano e rima rau. <verse eid="NUM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 3:23" />Hei muri i te tapenākara, hei te taha ki te hauāuru, te puni o ngā Kerehoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 3:24" />Ko Eriāhapa hoki, ko te tama a Raere, hei ariki mō te whare o te matua o ngā Kerehoni. <verse eid="NUM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 3:25" />Ā, ko tā ngā tama a Kerehona e tiaki ai i roto i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ko te tapenākara, ko te tēneti, me tōna hīpoki, ko te pā o te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, <verse eid="NUM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 3:26" />me ngā pā o te marae, me te pā o te whatitoka o te marae, o tērā i te tapenākara, i te āta hoki ā tawhio noa, me ōna aho hoki mō ōna meatanga katoa.<verse eid="NUM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 3:27" />Nā, Kohata hoki te hapū o ngā Amarami, me te hapū o ngā Itihari, me te hapū o ngā Heperoni, me te hapū o ngā Utieri; ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Kohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 3:28" />Ko te tokomaha o ngā tāne katoa, kotahi nei te marama, ahu atu, e waru mano e ono rau, ko rātou ngā kaitiaki o te wāhi tapu. <verse eid="NUM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 3:29" />Hei te taha whaka te tonga o te tapenākara he puni mō ngā hapū o ngā tama a Kohata. <verse eid="NUM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 3:30" />Ā, ko Eritapana, tama a Utiere, hei ariki mō te whare o te matua o ngā hapū o ngā Kohati. <verse eid="NUM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 3:31" />Ā, ko tā rātou e tiaki ai ko te āka, ko te tēpu, ko te tūranga rama, ko ngā āta, ko ngā oko o te wāhi tapu, arā ko ngā mea e minita ai rātou, me te pā ārai, me ngā mea katoa o ēnā mahinga. <verse eid="NUM 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 3:32" />Ā, ko Ereātara tama a Ārona tohunga hei ariki mō ngā ariki o ngā Rīwaiti, māna hoki e tirotiro ngā kaitiaki e tiaki ana i te wāhi tapu.<verse eid="NUM 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 3:33" />Nā Merari te hapū o ngā Māhari, me te hapū o ngā Muhi: ko ngā hapū ēnei o Merari. <verse eid="NUM 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 3:34" />Ā, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, ko te tokomaha o ngā tāne katoa, kotahi nei te marama ahu atu, e ono mano e rua rau. <verse eid="NUM 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 3:35" />Ā, ko Turiere, ko te tama a Apihaira hei ariki mō te whare o te matua o ngā hapū o Merari; hei te taha ki te raki o te tapenākara he puni mō ēnei. <verse eid="NUM 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 3:36" />Ko tā ngā tama hoki a Merari e tūpato ai, e tiaki ai, ko ngā papa o te tapenākara, me ōna kaho, me ōna pou, me ngā tūranga pou, me ngā mea katoa o aua mea, me ngā mea katoa o ēnā mahinga; <verse eid="NUM 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 3:37" />me ngā pou o te marae ā tawhio noa, me ngā tūranga, me ngā titi, me ngā aho.<verse eid="NUM 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 3:38" />Ā, ko ēnei e noho ki mua i te tapenākara, ki te rāwhiti, ki mua i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ki te putanga mai o te rā, ko Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko āna tama, hei tiaki i te wāhi tapu, i ngā mea hei tiakanga mā ngā tama a Īharaira; ā, ko te tangata kē e whakatata mai, ka whakamatea.<verse eid="NUM 3:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 3:39" />Ko ngā Rīwaiti katoa i taua, ko ērā i taua rā e Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i tā Ihowā whakahau, i ō rātou hapū, ko ngā tāne katoa kotahi nei te marama ahu atu, e rua tekau mā rua mano.<verse eid="NUM 3:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Utunga mō ngā Mātāmua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 3:40" />Ā, i mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Taua ngā tāne mātāmua katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ngā mea kotahi nei te marama, me ngā mea i maha atu, tuhituhia hoki te maha o ō rātou ingoa. <verse eid="NUM 3:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 3:41" />Ā, me tango ngā Rīwaiti māku – ko Ihowā ahau – hei utu mō ngā mātāmua katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira; me ngā kararehe a ngā Rīwaiti hei utu mō ngā mātāmua katoa i roto i ngā kararehe a ngā tama a Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 3:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 3:42" />Nā, ka taua e Mohi, ka pērātia me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a ia, ngā mātāmua katoa i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 3:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 3:43" />Ā, ko ngā tāne mātāmua katoa, ko te maha o ngā ingoa, kotahi nei te marama ā ahu atu, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rua tekau mā rua mano e rua rau e whitu tekau mā toru.<verse eid="NUM 3:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 3:44" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 3:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 3:45" />“Tangohia ngā Rīwaiti hei utu mō ngā tāne mātāmua katoa i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira, me ngā kararehe a ngā Rīwaiti hei utu mō ā rātou kararehe; ā, māku ngā Rīwaiti. Ko Ihowā ahau. <verse eid="NUM 3:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 3:46" />Nā, hei whakahoki atu, hei utu mō te rua rau e whitu tekau mā toru, mō ngā mātāmua o ngā tama a Īharaira i hira ake i te tokomaha o ngā Rīwaiti; <verse eid="NUM 3:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 3:47" />me tango e koe kia rima hekere mō tēnei pane, mō tēnei pane; kia rite ki te hekere o te wāhi tapu āu e tango ai; e rua tekau ngā kera o te hekere kotahi. <verse eid="NUM 3:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 3:48" />Me hoatu te moni e utua ai ngā tuhene o rātou ki a Ārona rātou ko āna tama.”<verse eid="NUM 3:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 3:49" />Nā, ka tango a Mohi i te moni whakahoki i ngā tāngata i hira ake i ērā i utua ki ngā Rīwaiti; <verse eid="NUM 3:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 3:50" />i tangohia e ia te moni i ngā mātāmua a ngā tama a Īharaira; kotahi mano e toru rau e ono tekau mā rima hekere; he pērā me te hekere o te wāhi tapu; <verse eid="NUM 3:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 3:51" />ā, i hoatu e Mohi te moni a te hunga i utua ki a Ārona rātou ko āna tama, i pērā me tā Ihowā i kī ai, me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 3:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="NUM 4" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Mahi a ngā Tama o Kohata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 4:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 4:2" />“Taua ngā tama a Kohata, i roto i ngā tama a Rīwai, tēnei hapū, tēnei hapū o rātou, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, <verse eid="NUM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 4:3" />ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, ngā mea katoa e uru ana ki te mahi, ki te mea i ngā mea o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga.<verse eid="NUM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 4:4" />“Ko te mahi tēnei mā ngā tama a Kohata i roto i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ko ngā mea tino tapu. <verse eid="NUM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 4:5" />Ā, ka maunu te puni, me haere a Ārona ki roto, rātou ko āna tama, ka tuku i te ārai hīpoki ki raro, ā, ka hīpoki iho ki te āka o te whakaaturanga. <verse eid="NUM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 4:6" />Nā, ka makā iho te hīpoki ki runga, arā ngā hiako pateri, ā, ka uhi iho i tētahi kākahu ki runga, he mea purū katoa, ka kuhu i ngā amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 4:7" />“Me uhi anō ki te kākahu purū te tēpu taro aroaro, ka whakatakoto ai i ngā rīhi ki runga, me ngā koko, me ngā peihana, me ngā kapu hei ringihanga; hei runga anō hoki te taro pūmau takoto ai. <verse eid="NUM 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 4:8" />Ka uhi ki te kākahu ngangana, ka hīpoki ai ki te hiako pateri hei hīpoki mō runga, ka kuhu i ōna amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 4:9" />“Nā, ka mau rātou ki tētahi kākahu purū, ka hīpoki ai i te tūranga whakamārama, i ōna rama hoki, i ōna kuku, i ōna oko ngārahu, i ōna oko hinu katoa, i ngā mea e minita ai rātou ki reira. <verse eid="NUM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 4:10" />Ka hoatu ai me ōna mea katoa ki roto ki te tākai, hei te mea hiako pateri, ka whakaeke ai ki runga ki te amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 4:11" />“Ā, me uhi iho e rātou he kākahu purū ki runga ki te āta kōura, ka hīpoki ai ki tētahi hīpoki hiako pateri, ka kuhu ai i ōna amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 4:12" />“Nā, ka mau ki ngā mea e minita ai rātou i te wāhi tapu, ka hoatu ki roto ki te kākahu purū, ka hīpoki ki tētahi hīpoki hiako pateri, ka whakaeke ki te amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 4:13" />“Nā, ka tahi atu rātou i ngā pungarehu o te āta, ka hīpoki ai ki te kākahu pāpura. <verse eid="NUM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 4:14" />Me whakatakoto anō ki runga ōna oko katoa e minita ai rātou ki reira, ngā tahu kakara, ngā mārau kikokiko, ngā koko pungarehu, ngā peihana, ngā mea katoa o te āta; ka hīpoki ai ki te hīpoki hiako pateri, ka kuhu ai i ōna amo.<verse eid="NUM 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 4:15" />“Ā, ka oti i a Ārona rātou ko āna tama te hīpoki te wāhi tapu, me ngā mea katoa o te wāhi tapu, ina tata te puni te maunu; ka mutu, nā, ka haere mai ngā tama a Kohata ki te kauhoa. Otiia, kaua rātou e pā ki tētahi mea tapu kei mate rātou. Ko ēnei ngā mea a ngā tama a Kohata e mau ai o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga.<verse eid="NUM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 4:16" />“Ā, ko tā Ereātara, ko tā te tama a te tohunga, a Ārona, e whakaaro ai, ko te hinu mō te whakamārama, ko te whakakakara reka, ko te whakahere totokore o tēnei rā, o tēnei rā, ko te hinu whakawahi, me te tirotiro i te tapenākara katoa, i ngā mea katoa hoki o reira, i te wāhi tapu, i ōna mea hoki.<verse eid="NUM 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 4:17" />“I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 4:18" />Kei hātepea atu e koutou te iwi o ngā hapū o ngā Kohati i roto i ngā Rīwaiti. <verse eid="NUM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 4:19" />Engari, ko tēnei tā koutou e mea ai ki a rātou, kia ora ai rātou, kei mate, ina whakatata ki ngā mea tino tapu: me haere a Ārona rātou ko āna tama ki roto, ka whakarite ai i a rātou ki tāna mahi, ki tāna mahi, ki tāna amohanga, ki tāna amohanga. <verse eid="NUM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 4:20" />Otiia, kaua rātou e haere ki roto ki te mātakitaki i te wāhi tapu ahakoa he wā poto, kei mate rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Mahi a ngā Tama o Kerehona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 4:21" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 4:22" />“Taua hoki ngā tama a Kerehona, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, i ō rātou hapū. <verse eid="NUM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 4:23" />Ko ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ngā tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, āu e tatau ai; ko ngā mea katoa hoki e uru ana ki te mahi i ngā mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga.<verse eid="NUM 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 4:24" />“Ko te mahi tēnei mā ngā hapū o ngā Kerehoni, ko te mahi, ko te amo. <verse eid="NUM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 4:25" />Mā rātou hoki e amo ngā pā o te tapenākara, te tapenākara hoki o te whakaminenga, tōna hīpoki, me te hīpoki hiako pateri i waho ake, me te pā o te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; <verse eid="NUM 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 4:26" />me ngā pā o te marae, me te pā mō te whatitoka o te kūwaha o te marae, o tērā i te tapenākara, i te āta ā tawhio noa, me ngā aho, me ngā mea katoa mō te mahinga o aua mea, me ngā mea katoa i hangā mō aua mea; ko tā rātou mahi tēnā. <verse eid="NUM 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 4:27" />Kei a Ārona rātou ko āna tama te tikanga mō ngā mahi katoa a ngā tama a ngā Kerehoni, mō ā rātou amohanga katoa, mō ā rātou mahi katoa; mā koutou hoki e whakarite ki a rātou te tikanga mō ngā mea katoa e amo ai rātou. <verse eid="NUM 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 4:28" />Ko te mahi tēnei mā ngā hapū o ngā tama a Kerehona i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; ā, ko ngā tikanga mā rātou kei a Itamara tama a te tohunga, a Ārona.”<verse eid="NUM 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Mahi a ngā Tama o Merari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 4:29" />“Ko ngā tama a Merari, me tatau rātou e koe i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; <verse eid="NUM 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 4:30" />ko ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, āu e tatau ai, ko ngā tāngata katoa e uru ana ki te mahi, ki te mahi i te mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 4:31" />Ā, ko te tikanga anō tēnei mō tā rātou e amo ai, i ā rātou mahinga katoa i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; ko ngā papa o te tapenākara, me ōna kaho, me ōna pou, me ōna tūranga pou; <verse eid="NUM 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 4:32" />me ngā pou o te marae ā tawhio noa, me ngā tūranga pou, me ngā titi, me ngā aho, me ngā mea katoa o aua mea, me ngā mea katoa o ēnā mahinga: me tatau ā-ingoa ngā mea kei a rātou nei te tikanga mō te amo. <verse eid="NUM 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 4:33" />Ko te mahi tēnei a ngā hapū o ngā tama a Merari, i ā rātou mahinga katoa i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i raro i te ringa o Itamara tama a te tohunga, a Ārona.”<verse eid="NUM 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Tauanga o ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 4:34" />Nā, ka taua e Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko ngā ariki o te whakaminenga, ngā tama a ngā Kohati, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare anō o ō rātou mātua, <verse eid="NUM 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 4:35" />ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, ngā tāngata katoa i uru ki te mahi, ki te mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 4:36" />Ā, taua ake o rātou, i ō rātou hapū, e rua mano e whitu rau e rima tekau. <verse eid="NUM 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 4:37" />Ko ēnei i taua o ngā hapū o ngā Kohati, ko ngā tāngata hei mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i taua nei e Mohi rāua ko Ārona, pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai, nā te ringa o Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 4:38" />Ā, taua ake o ngā tama a Kerehona i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, <verse eid="NUM 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 4:39" />ngā mea e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, ngā mea katoa i uru ki te mahi, ki te mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, <verse eid="NUM 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 4:40" />taua ake o rātou i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, e rua mano e ono rau e toru tekau. <verse eid="NUM 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 4:41" />Ko ēnei i taua o ngā hapū o ngā tama a Kerehona, o ngā tāngata katoa hei mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i taua nei e Mohi rāua ko Ārona, pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai.<verse eid="NUM 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 4:42" />Ā, taua ake o ngā hapū o ngā tama a Merari, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, <verse eid="NUM 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 4:43" />ngā mea hoki e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, ngā tāngata katoa i uru ki te mahi, hei mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, <verse eid="NUM 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 4:44" />taua ake o rātou i ō rātou hapū, e toru mano e rua rau. <verse eid="NUM 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 4:45" />Ko ēnei i taua o ngā hapū o ngā tama a Merari, i taua nei e Mohi rāua ko Ārona, pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai, nā te ringa o Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 4:46" />Ko ngā tāngata katoa o ngā Rīwaiti i taua, a Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko ngā ariki o Īharaira i tatau ai, i ō rātou hapū, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, <verse eid="NUM 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 4:47" />ko ngā mea hoki e toru tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, ā tae noa ki ngā mea e rima tekau ō rātou tau, ko ngā tāngata katoa i uru ki te mahi i ngā mahi e mahia ana, ki te mahi hoki, ki te amoamo i roto i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; <verse eid="NUM 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 4:48" />taua ake o rātou e waru mano e rima rau e waru tekau. <verse eid="NUM 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 4:49" />Rite tonu ki tā Ihowā i whakahau ai te tauanga o rātou e te ringa o Mohi, tēnei, tēnei, me tāna mahi, me tāna amo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 4:49">Nā, poto ake rātou te tatau e ia, te pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="NUM 5" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Tāngata Poke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 5:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 5:2" />“Whakahaua ngā tama a Īharaira kia motuhia kētia atu ngā repera katoa i roto i te puni, ngā tāngata katoa e rere ana te pirau, me ngā tāngata katoa e poke ana i te tūpāpaku. <verse eid="NUM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 5:3" />Ko te tāne, ko te wahine, me ngare atu, me ngare e koutou ki waho o te puni; kei poke i a rātou ō rātou puni e nohoia nei e ahau.” <verse eid="NUM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 5:4" />Nā, pērātia ana e ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, motuhia kētia ana rātou i roto i te puni; rite tonu ki tā Ihowā i kōrero ai ki a Mohi tā ngā tama a Īharaira i mea ai.<verse eid="NUM 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whāki me te Utunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 5:5" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 5:6" />“Mea atu ki ngā tama a Īharaira: Ki te mahia e te tangata, e te wahine rānei, tētahi mea e hara ai te tangata, hei mahi i te kino ki a Ihowā, ā, ka hē taua wairua; <verse eid="NUM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 5:7" />nā, me whāki tō rātou hara i hara ai. Me whakahoki e ia te mea i hē ai ia, te tino mea, me tāpiri anō ki tōna whakarima, ka hoatu ai ki te tangata i hara nei ia ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 5:8" />Otiia ki te kāhore he whanaunga o taua tangata hei hoatutanga mō te utu, me hoatu te utu mō te hara ki a Ihowā, arā ki te tohunga; hei tāpiri mō te hipi whakamārie hei whakamārie mōna. <verse eid="NUM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 5:9" />Nā, ko ngā whakahere hapahapai katoa o ngā mea tapu katoa a ngā tama a Īharaira, e kawea ana ki te tohunga, māna ērā. <verse eid="NUM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 5:10" />Māna ake ngā mea tapu a te tangata; ko tā te tangata e hoatu ai ki te tohunga, māna tēnā.”<verse eid="NUM 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">E Pā ana ki te Wahine Pūremu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 5:11" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 5:12" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: Ki te peka kē te wahine a tētahi tangata, ā, ka hara ki a ia, <verse eid="NUM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 5:13" />ā, ka takoto, ka pūremu tētahi ki a ia, ā, ka ngaro i ngā kanohi o tāna tahu, ka huna, ā, ka poke te wahine, kāhore anō hoki he kaiwhakaatu mō tōna hē, kāhore anō ia i mau rawa. <verse eid="NUM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 5:14" />Ā, ka tau ki a ia te wairua hae, ā, ka hae ia ki tāna wahine, ā, ka poke te wahine. Ki te tau rānei ki a ia te wairua hae, ā, ka hae ia ki tāna wahine kīhai nei i poke; <verse eid="NUM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 5:15" />kātahi ka kawe taua tangata i tāna wahine ki te tohunga, me kawe anō e ia tā te wahine whakahere hei mea mōna, te whakatekau epa parāoa pārei. Kaua he hinu e ringihia ki runga, kaua anō he parakihe e hoatu ki runga; he whakahere totokore hoki mō te hae, he whakahere whakamahara, hei whakamahara ki te kino.<verse eid="NUM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 5:16" />“Nā, ka nekehia mai ia e te tohunga, ā, ka whakatūria ki te aroaro o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 5:17" />Ā, ka mau te tohunga ki te wai tapu i te oko oneone; ka mau anō te tohunga ki tētahi wāhi o te puehu o te papa o te tapenākara, ka maka ai ki te wai. <verse eid="NUM 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 5:18" />Nā, ka whakatūria e te tohunga te wahine ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ā, ka tuku ngā makawe o te wahine kia mahora noa, ka hoatu ai i te whakahere whakamahara ki ōna ringa, arā i te whakahere totokore mō te hae. Hei te ringa ia o te tohunga te wai kawa e tau ai te kanga. <verse eid="NUM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 5:19" />Nā, ka whakaoati te tohunga i a ia, ā, ka mea ki te wahine, ‘Ki te mea kāhore anō tētahi tangata i takoto ki a koe, ki te kāhore anō hoki koe i peka atu, i poke, i te mea i raro koe i tāu tāne, kia ora koe i tēnei wai kawa e tau ai te kanga. <verse eid="NUM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 5:20" />Ki te mea ia kua peka kē koe, i te mea i raro koe i tāu tāne, ā, kua poke koe, ā, kua takoto ki a koe tētahi tangata ehara nei i te tāne nāu,’ <verse eid="NUM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 5:21" />– kātahi ka whakaoati te tohunga i te wahine ki te oati kanga, ā, ka mea te tohunga ki te wahine – ‘mā Ihowā koe e mea hei kanga, hei oati i roto i tōu iwi, ina mea a Ihowā kia pirau tōu hūhā, kia pupuhi hoki tōu puku; <verse eid="NUM 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 5:22" />ā, ka tae ki roto ki ōu whēkau tēnei wai e tau ai te kanga, e pupuhi ai tōu puku, e pirau ai tōu hūhā.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 5:22">“Me kī te wahine, ‘Āmine, Āmine.’<verse eid="NUM 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 5:23" />“Ā, me tuhituhi ēnei kanga e te tohunga ki te pukapuka, ka horoi atu anō e ia ki roto ki te wai kawa. <verse eid="NUM 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 5:24" />Nā, ka whakainumia e ia te wahine ki te wai kawa e tau ai te kanga, ā, ka tae te wai e tau ai te kanga ki roto ki a ia, ka kawa.<verse eid="NUM 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 5:25" />“Me tango hoki e te tohunga te whakahere mō te hae i te ringa o te wahine, ā, ka poipoia te whakahere ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ka whakaherea ki runga ki te āta. <verse eid="NUM 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 5:26" />Nā, ka aohia e te tohunga tētahi wāhi o te whakahere, kia kī te ringa, ko tōna whakamaharatanga hoki, ā, ka tahuna ki runga ki te āta, ā muri iho ka whakainumia te wahine ki te wai. <verse eid="NUM 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 5:27" />Ā, ka oti ia te whakainu ki te wai, nā, ki te mea kua poke ia, kua hara ki tāna tahu, nā, ka tae ki roto ki a ia te wai e tau ai te kanga, ka kawa, ā, ka pupuhi tōna puku, ka pirau hoki tōna hūhā. Ā, hei mea kanga tēnā wahine i roto i tōna iwi. <verse eid="NUM 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 5:28" />Ā, ki te mea kīhai i poke te wahine, ā, e mā ana; nā, ka ora, ā, ka whai tamariki.<verse eid="NUM 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 5:29" />“Ko te ture tēnei mō ngā hae, mehemea te wahine, kei raro nei ia i tāna tāne, ka peka kē, ā, ka poke; <verse eid="NUM 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 5:30" />ina tau iho rānei te wairua hae ki tētahi, ā, ka hae ia ki tāna wahine. Nā, me whakatū taua wahine e ia ki te aroaro o Ihowā; nā, ka mahia e te tohunga tēnei ture katoa ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 5:31" />Nā, ka kore he hē mō te tangata, ā, ka waha e taua wahine tōna kino.”<verse eid="NUM 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="NUM 6" />
  <para style="s">He Ture mō ngā Natari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 6:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 6:2" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: E momotu te tangata, te wahine rānei i a ia, he kī taurangi nā te Natari, mōna kia wehea mā Ihowā; <verse eid="NUM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 6:3" />me wehe ia i a ia kei tata ki te wāina, ki te wai whakahaurangi rānei, kaua hoki ia e inu i te winika wāina, i te winika whakahaurangi, kaua hoki e inu i te wai karepe, ā, kaua e kai i te karepe hou, maroke rānei. <verse eid="NUM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 6:4" />I ngā rā katoa e wehea ai ia kaua ia e kai i tētahi mea nō te wāina te mea i hangā ai, ahakoa nganga, ahakoa peha.<verse eid="NUM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 6:5" />“I ngā rā katoa o tāna kī taurangi wehe i a ia, kaua te heu e pā ki tōna mātenga; kia tutuki rā anō ngā rā e wehea ai ia ki a Ihowā, ka tapu ia, ā, me tuku e ia ngā makawe o tōna mātenga kia tupu, kia roroa. <verse eid="NUM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 6:6" />I ngā rā katoa e wehe ai ia i a ia ki a Ihowā kaua ia e whakatata ki te tūpāpaku. <verse eid="NUM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 6:7" />Kaua ia e whakapoke i a ia mō tōna pāpā, mō tōna whaea, mō tōna tuakana, teina rānei, mō tōna tuahine, ina mate rātou; nō te mea kei runga i tōna mātenga te wehenga a tōna Atua. <verse eid="NUM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 6:8" />Ka tapu ia ki a Ihowā i ngā rā katoa e wehea ai ia.<verse eid="NUM 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 6:9" />“Ā, ki te mate tētahi tangata ki tōna taha, he mea pā whakarere, ā, kua poke i a ia tōna mātenga i wehea nei; nā, me heu e ia tōna mātenga i te rā e purea ai ia, me heu e ia i te whitu o ngā rā. <verse eid="NUM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 6:10" />Ā, i te waru o ngā rā me kawe mai e ia he kūkupa kia rua, he pī kūkupa rānei kia rua, ki te tohunga, ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 6:11" />Ā, me whakahere tētahi e te tohunga hei whakahere hara, me tētahi hei tahunga tinana, ā, ka whakamārie mōna, nōna hoki i whai hara i te tūpāpaku, ka whakatapua anō tōna mātenga i taua rā anō. <verse eid="NUM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 6:12" />Ā, me whakatapu e ia ki a Ihowā ngā rā o tōna wehenga, me kawe mai anō he reme toa, he tau tahi, hei whakahere mō te hē. Ko ngā rā ia ō mua ka whakatakā, nō te mea kua poke tōna wehenga.<verse eid="NUM 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 6:13" />“Ā, ko te ture tēnei mō te Natari, ina rite ngā rā e wehea ai ia: me kawe ia ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; <verse eid="NUM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 6:14" />ā, me whakahere e ia tāna whakahere ki a Ihowā, kia kotahi te reme toa tau tahi, hei te mea kohakore, hei tahunga tinana, me tētahi reme uha tau tahi, hei te mea kohakore, hei whakahere hara, me tētahi hipi toa kohakore, hei whakahere mō te pai, <verse eid="NUM 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 6:15" />me tētahi kete taro rēwenakore, me ngā keke parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, me ētahi me angiangi anō hoki, hei ngā mea rēwenakore i pania ki te hinu, me te whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga o aua mea.<verse eid="NUM 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 6:16" />“Ā, me kawe aua mea e te tohunga ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ā, ka whakaherea tāna whakahere hara, me tāna tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 6:17" />me whakahere anō e ia te hipi toa, hei patunga mō te pai ki a Ihowā, me te kete taro rēwenakore; me whakahere anō e te tohunga tāna whakahere totokore, me tāna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 6:18" />“Ā, me heu e te Natari tōna mātenga, i wehea nei, ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ka tango ai i ngā makawe o tōna mātenga i wehea nei, ā, ka maka ki te ahi, ki tērā i raro i te patunga mō te pai.<verse eid="NUM 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 6:19" />“Ā, me tango e te tohunga te peke o te hipi toa, ina oti te kōhua, me tētahi o ngā keke rēwenakore i te kete, me tētahi o ngā keke angiangi, o ngā mea rēwenakore, ā, ka hoatu e ia ki ngā ringa o te Natari, i muri i te heunga o ōna makawe i wehea nei. <verse eid="NUM 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 6:20" />Nā, ka poipoia e te tohunga hei whakahere poipoi ki te aroaro o Ihowā. Ka tapu tēnei mā te tohunga, me te uma poipoi, me te hūhā hapahapai; ā muri iho ka inu wāina te Natari.<verse eid="NUM 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 6:21" />“Ko te ture tēnei mō te Natari, nāna te kī wehe, mō tāna whakahere hoki ki a Ihowā ina wehea, hei tāpiri mō tā tōna ringa i whiwhi ai. Kia rite ki tāna kī i kī ai; kei te ture o tōna wehenga te tikanga mō tāna e mea ai.”<verse eid="NUM 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Manaaki Tohunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 6:22" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 6:23" />“Kōrero ki a Ārona rātou ko āna tama, mea atu: Kia pēnei tā koutou manaaki i ngā tama a Īharaira; mea atu ki a rātou,<verse eid="NUM 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 6:24" />‘Mā Ihowā koe e manaaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:24">māna koe e tiaki;<verse eid="NUM 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 6:25" />Mā Ihowā e mea kia tīaho tōna mata ki a koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:25">māna anō hoki koe e atawhai;<verse eid="NUM 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 6:26" />Mā Ihowā tōna kanohi e whakaara ki a koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 6:26">māna anō e tuku te rangimārie ki a koe.’<verse eid="NUM 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 6:27" />“Ā, ka karangatia e rātou tōku ingoa ki runga ki ngā tama a Īharaira; ā, māku rātou e manaaki.”<verse eid="NUM 6:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="NUM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Whakahere a ngā Ariki o ngā Iwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 7:1" />Ā, i te rā i oti ai i a Mohi te tapenākara te whakaara, i whakawahia ai, i whakatapua ai hoki te tapenākara me ōna mea katoa, te āta, me ōna mea katoa, ā, ka oti te whakawahi, te whakatapu. <verse eid="NUM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 7:2" />Nā, ka whakahere ngā ariki o Īharaira, ngā upoko o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; ko rātou ngā ariki o ngā iwi, i a rātou hoki ngā tikanga mō te hunga i taua. <verse eid="NUM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 7:3" />Ā, ka kawea mai e rātou tā rātou whakahere ki te aroaro o Ihowā, e ono ngā kāta whai taupoki, kotahi tekau mā rua ngā kau; tokorua ngā ariki kotahi anō te kāta, kotahi anō hoki te pūru a tētahi, a tētahi; ā, whakatūtūria ana e rātou ki te aronga o te tapenākara.<verse eid="NUM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 7:4" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 7:5" />“Tangohia tā rātou, hei mea mō te mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; ā, me hoatu e koe ki ngā Rīwaiti, kia rite ki te mahi a tēnei, a tēnei.”<verse eid="NUM 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 7:6" />Nā, tangohia ana e Mohi ngā kāta me ngā kau, ā, hoatu ana e ia ki ngā Rīwaiti. <verse eid="NUM 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 7:7" />E rua ngā kāta, e whā ngā kau i hoatu e ia ki ngā tama a Kerehona, he mea whakarite ki tā rātou mahi. <verse eid="NUM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 7:8" />E whā ngā kāta, e waru ngā kau i hoatu e ia ki ngā tama a Merari, he mea whakarite ki tā rātou mahi, i te ringa o Itamara tama a te tohunga, a Ārona. <verse eid="NUM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 7:9" />Ki ngā tama ia a Kohata, kīhai i hoatu e ia; nō te mea ko te mahi o te wāhi tapu mā rātou ko te kauhoa i runga i ō rātou pokohiwi.<verse eid="NUM 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 7:10" />Ā, i whakahere anō ngā ariki hei tāinga kawa mō te āta i te rā i whakawahia ai, i whakahere ngā ariki i ā rātou whakahere ki mua i te āta. <verse eid="NUM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 7:11" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Me hoatu e rātou ā rātou whakahere, tēnā ariki i tōna rā, tēnā ariki i tōna rā, hei tāinga kawa mō te āta.”<verse eid="NUM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 7:12" />Nā, ko te tangata nāna te whakahere i te rā tuatahi, ko Nāhahona tama a Aminarapa, nō te iwi o Hūrā.<verse eid="NUM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 7:13" />Ā, ko tāna whakahere, he rīhi hiriwa, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana, hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 7:14" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 7:15" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 7:16" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 7:17" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi; ko te whakahere tēnei a Nāhahona tama a Aminarapa.<verse eid="NUM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 7:18" />I te rā tuarua nā Netanēre te whakahere; he tama ia nā Tuara, he ariki nō Ihākara.<verse eid="NUM 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 7:19" />Ko tāna whakahere i whakahere ai, he rīhi hiriwa, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu aua mea e rua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 7:20" />he koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 7:21" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 7:22" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 7:23" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Netanēre tama a Tuara.<verse eid="NUM 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 7:24" />I te rā tuatoru nā Eriapa, nā te tama a Herona, he ariki nō ngā tama a Hepurona.<verse eid="NUM 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 7:25" />Ko tāna whakahere he rīhi hiriwa, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana, hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 7:26" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 7:27" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 7:28" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 7:29" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Eriapa tama a Herona.<verse eid="NUM 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 7:30" />I te rā tuawhā nā Erituru, nā te tama a Hereuru, he ariki nō ngā tama a Reupena.<verse eid="NUM 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 7:31" />Ko tāna whakahere he rīhi hiriwa, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 7:32" />he koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara. <verse eid="NUM 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 7:33" />Kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 7:34" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 7:35" />e rua ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi; ko te whakahere tēnei a Erituru tama a Hereuru.<verse eid="NUM 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 7:36" />I te rā tuarima, nā Herumiere, nā te tama a Turiharai, he ariki nō ngā tama a Himiona.<verse eid="NUM 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 7:37" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere tōna taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 7:38" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 7:39" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 7:40" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 7:41" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Herumiere tama a Turiharai.<verse eid="NUM 7:41" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 7:42" />I te rā tuaono nā Eriāhapa, tama a Teuere, he ariki nō ngā tama a Kara.<verse eid="NUM 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 7:43" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 7:44" />he koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 7:45" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 7:46" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 7:47" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Eriāhapa tama a Teuere.<verse eid="NUM 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 7:48" />I te rā tuawhitu nā Erihama; tama a Amihuru, he ariki nō ngā tama a Ēparaima.<verse eid="NUM 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 7:49" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 7:50" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 7:51" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 7:52" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 7:53" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Erihama tama a Amihuru.<verse eid="NUM 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 7:54" />I te rā tuawaru nā Kamariere, tama a Peraturu, he ariki nō ngā tama a Mānahi.<verse eid="NUM 7:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 7:55" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 7:56" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 7:57" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 7:58" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 7:59" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Kamariere tama a Peraturu.<verse eid="NUM 7:59" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 7:60" />I te rā tuaiwa nā Apirana, tama a Kirioni, he ariki nō ngā tama a Pineamine.<verse eid="NUM 7:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 7:61" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 7:62" />he koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 7:63" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 7:64" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 7:65" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Apirana tama a Kirioni.<verse eid="NUM 7:65" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="NUM 7:66" />I te tekau o ngā rā nā Ahiētere, tama a Amiharai, he ariki nō ngā tama a Rāna.<verse eid="NUM 7:66" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="NUM 7:67" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana, hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="NUM 7:68" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="NUM 7:69" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="NUM 7:70" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="NUM 7:71" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Ahiētere tama a Amiharai.<verse eid="NUM 7:71" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="NUM 7:72" />I te tekau mā tahi o ngā rā nā Pakiere, tama a Okorana, he ariki nō ngā tama a Āhera.<verse eid="NUM 7:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="NUM 7:73" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="NUM 7:74" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="NUM 7:75" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="NUM 7:76" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:76" /><verse number="77" style="v" sid="NUM 7:77" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Pakiere tama a Okorana.<verse eid="NUM 7:77" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="NUM 7:78" />I te tekau mā rua o ngā rā nā Ahira, tama a Enana, he ariki nō ngā tama a Napatari.<verse eid="NUM 7:78" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="NUM 7:79" />He rīhi hiriwa tāna whakahere, kotahi rau e toru tekau hekere te taimaha, he peihana hiriwa, e whitu tekau ōna hekere, he hekere wāhi tapu; kī tonu rāua i te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu hei whakahere totokore; <verse eid="NUM 7:79" /><verse number="80" style="v" sid="NUM 7:80" />kotahi koko kōura, tekau ōna hekere, kī tonu i te whakakakara; <verse eid="NUM 7:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="NUM 7:81" />kotahi pūru, he kūao, kotahi hipi toa, kotahi reme toa, he tau tahi, hei tahunga tinana; <verse eid="NUM 7:81" /><verse number="82" style="v" sid="NUM 7:82" />kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; <verse eid="NUM 7:82" /><verse number="83" style="v" sid="NUM 7:83" />e rua hoki ngā pūru hei patunga mō te pai, e rima ngā hipi toa, e rima koati toa, e rima reme toa, he tau tahi. Ko te whakahere tēnei a Ahira tama a Enana.<verse eid="NUM 7:83" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="NUM 7:84" />Ko tā ngā ariki a Īharaira tāinga kawa tēnei mō te āta, i te rā i whakawahia ai: tekau mā rua ngā rīhi hiriwa, tekau mā rua ngā peihana hiriwa, tekau mā rua ngā koko kōura; <verse eid="NUM 7:84" /><verse number="85" style="v" sid="NUM 7:85" />kotahi rau e toru tekau ngā hekere o te rīhi hiriwa kotahi, e whitu tekau hoki o te peihana kotahi; e rua mano e whā rau ngā hekere o ngā oko hiriwa katoa, he hekere wāhi tapu. <verse eid="NUM 7:85" /><verse number="86" style="v" sid="NUM 7:86" />Tekau mā rua ngā koko kōura, kī tonu i te whakakakara, tekau ngā hekere o tētahi, o tētahi, he hekere wāhi tapu; kotahi rau e rua tekau hekere te kōura katoa o ngā koko. <verse eid="NUM 7:86" /><verse number="87" style="v" sid="NUM 7:87" />Ko ngā kau katoa mō te tahunga tinana tekau mā rua ngā pūru, kotahi tekau mā rua ngā hipi toa, tekau mā rua ngā reme toa tau tahi, me ō rātou whakahere totokore; tekau mā rua anō ngā kūao koati hei whakahere hara. <verse eid="NUM 7:87" /><verse number="88" style="v" sid="NUM 7:88" />Ko ngā kau katoa hoki mō te patunga mō te pai, e rua tekau mā whā ngā pūru, e ono tekau ngā hipi toa, e ono tekau hoki ngā koati toa, e ono tekau ngā reme toa tau tahi. Ko te tāinga kawa tēnei o te āta i muri i tōna whakawahinga.<verse eid="NUM 7:88" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="NUM 7:89" />Ā, i te haerenga o Mohi ki roto ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga ki te kōrero ki a ia, nā, ka rongo ia ki te reo o tētahi e kōrero ana ki a ia i runga i te taupoki, i tērā i runga i te āka o te whakaaturanga, i waenganui i ngā kerupima e rua; ā, ka kōrero ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 7:89" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="NUM 8" />
  <para style="s">Te Tahuna o ngā Rama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 8:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 8:2" />“Kōrero ki a Ārona, mea atu ki a ia: Ka tahuna e koe ngā rama, kia mārama i ngā rama e whitu te wāhi i mua o taua tūranga rama.”<verse eid="NUM 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 8:3" />I pērā anō a Ārona; i meinga e ia kia kā ngā rama ki te wāhi i mua o te tūranga rama; i pērā ia me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi. <verse eid="NUM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 8:4" />Ā, ko te mahinga tēnei o te tūranga rama, he mea patu te kōura; ko tōna take, ko ōna puāwai, he mea patu; ko tāna hanga i te tūranga rama rite tonu ki te tauira i whakakitea e Ihowā ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Pure me te Whakawahinga o ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 8:5" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 8:6" />“Tangohia ngā Rīwaiti i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira, ka pure i a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 8:7" />Ko tēnei tāu e mea ai ki a rātou, hei pure i a rātou: tāuhiuhia ki a rātou he wai hei pure, kia heua ō rātou tinana katoa, ā, me horoi e rātou ō rātou kākahu, kia mā ai. <verse eid="NUM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 8:8" />Kātahi rātou ka mau ki tētahi pūru kūao, me tōna whakahere totokore, arā, te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu; me tango anō e koe tētahi atu pūru kūao hei whakahere hara. <verse eid="NUM 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 8:9" />Nā, ka kawe koe i ngā Rīwaiti ki mua i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ka tāwhiu mai ai i te huihui katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 8:10" />Nā, ka kawe koe i ngā Rīwaiti ki te aroaro o Ihowā; ā, ka popoki ngā ringa o ngā tama a Īharaira ki ngā Rīwaiti; <verse eid="NUM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 8:11" />ā, me whakahere e Ārona ngā Rīwaiti ki te aroaro o Ihowā, hei whakahere poipoi mā ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, ka waiho rātou hei mahi i te mahi a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 8:12" />“Nā, ka popoki ngā ringa o ngā Rīwaiti ki runga ki ngā mātenga o ngā pūru; ā, me tuku tētahi e koe hei whakahere hara, tētahi hoki hei tahunga tinana ki a Ihowā, hei whakamārie mō ngā Rīwaiti. <verse eid="NUM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 8:13" />Nā, ka whakatū koe i ngā Rīwaiti ki te aroaro o Ārona, ki te aroaro anō o āna tama, ka whakahere ai hei whakahere poipoi ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 8:14" />Nā, me momotu e koe ngā Rīwaiti i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, māku ngā Rīwaiti.<verse eid="NUM 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 8:15" />“Ā muri iho, ka haere ngā Rīwaiti ki roto, ki te mahi i te mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; ā, me pure rātou e koe, me whakahere hoki hei whakahere poipoi. <verse eid="NUM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 8:16" />Ka tukua rawatia mai hoki rātou ki ahau i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira; hei utu mō ngā mea katoa e oroko puta mai ana i te kōpū, arā mō ngā mātāmua o ngā tama katoa a Īharaira i tangohia ai rātou e ahau māku. <verse eid="NUM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 8:17" />Nāku hoki ngā mātāmua katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ngā tāngata me ngā kararehe; nō te rā i patua ai e ahau ngā mātāmua katoa o te whenua o Īhipa tāku whakatapunga i a rātou māku. <verse eid="NUM 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 8:18" />Nā, ka tangohia nei e ahau ngā Rīwaiti hei utu mō ngā mātāmua katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 8:19" />He mea hoatu nāku ngā Rīwaiti i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Ārona rātou ko āna tama, hei mahi i ngā mahi a ngā tama a Īharaira, i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, hei whakamārie mō ngā tama a Īharaira; kei pā te whiu ki ngā tama a Īharaira, ina whakatata ngā tama a Īharaira ki te wāhi tapu.”<verse eid="NUM 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 8:20" />Nā, ko tā Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira i mea ai ki ngā Rīwaiti, pērā tonu me ngā mea katoa i whakahau ai a Ihowā ki a Mohi mō ngā Rīwaiti; i pērā tonu ngā tama a Īharaira ki a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 8:21" />Nā, ka horohoroa ngā Rīwaiti, ā, ka horoia ō rātou kākahu; ā, whakaherea ana rātou e Ārona hei whakahere poipoi ki te aroaro o Ihowā; ā, ka whakamārie a Ārona mō rātou hei pure mō rātou. <verse eid="NUM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 8:22" />Ā, ka mutu tērā, ka tomo ngā Rīwaiti ki te mahi i ā rātou mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, i te aroaro o Ārona, i te aroaro anō hoki o āna tama; pērā tonu me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi mō ngā Rīwaiti tā rātou i mea ai ki a rātou.<verse eid="NUM 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 8:23" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 8:24" />“Ko te mea tēnei mā ngā Rīwaiti; ka rua tekau mā rima ō rātou tau, ka maha ake rānei, me tomo rātou ki te mahi i ngā mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; <verse eid="NUM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 8:25" />ka maha ake ō rātou tau i te rima tekau, me whakamutu tā rātou mahi i ngā mahi o reira, kaua anō hoki he mahi mā rātou i muri iho. <verse eid="NUM 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 8:26" />Engari, me minita tahi me ō rātou tuākana i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, me tiaki i ngā mea e tiakina ana, kaua hoki e mahi i tētahi mahi. Ko tēnei tāu e mea ai ki ngā Rīwaiti, ina tiaki rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 8:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="NUM 9" />
  <para style="s">Te Kapenga Tuarua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 9:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi i te koraha o Hinai, i te rua o ngā tau o tō rātou haerenga mai i te whenua o Īhipa, i te tahi o ngā marama, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 9:2" />“Me mahi anō te Kapenga e ngā tama a Īharaira i tōna wā anō. <verse eid="NUM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 9:3" />Me mahi i te tekau mā whā o ngā rā o tēnei marama, i te ahiahi, i tōna wā anō; kia rite ki ōna tikanga katoa, ki ōna ritenga katoa, tā koutou meatanga.”<verse eid="NUM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 9:4" />Nā, ka kōrero a Mohi ki ngā tama a Īharaira kia mahia te Kapenga. <verse eid="NUM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 9:5" />Ā, ka mahia e rātou te Kapenga i te tekau mā whā o ngā rā o te marama tuatahi, i te ahiahi, i te koraha o Hinai; rite tonu ki ngā mea katoa i whakahau ai a Ihowā ki a Mohi tā ngā tama a Īharaira i mea ai.<verse eid="NUM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 9:6" />Nā, tērā ētahi tāngata i poke i te tūpāpaku, i kore ai e āhei te mahi i te Kapenga i taua rā. Nā, ka haere rātou ki te aroaro o Mohi rāua ko Ārona i taua rā; <verse eid="NUM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 9:7" />ā, ka mea aua tāngata ki a ia, “Kua poke mātou i te tūpāpaku; he aha mātou tē tukua ai ki te whakahere i te whakahere mā Ihowā i tōna wā i rite ai, i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira?”<verse eid="NUM 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 9:8" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a rātou, “E tū koutou, ā, me whakarongo atu ahau ki tā Ihowā e whakahau ai mō koutou.”<verse eid="NUM 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 9:9" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 9:10" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu: Ki te poke i te tūpāpaku tētahi o koutou, o ō koutou uri rānei, ki te mea rānei kei tawhiti e haere ana, me mahi anō e ia te Kapenga ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 9:11" />Me mahi e rātou i te rua o ngā marama, i te tekau mā whā o ngā rā, i te ahiahi, me kīnaki ki te taro rēwenakore, ki ngā pūwhā kawa. <verse eid="NUM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 9:12" />Kaua tētahi wāhi o tēnā mea e whakatoea e rātou mō te ata, kaua anō hoki e whatia tētahi o ōna wheua; kia rite ki ngā tikanga katoa o te Kapenga tā rātou mahinga i tēnā mahi.<verse eid="NUM 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 9:13" />“Ko te tangata ia kāhore ōna poke, ā, kāhore anō i te haere, ā, e māngere ana ki te mahi i te Kapenga, inā, ka hātepea atu taua wairua i roto i tōna iwi; kāhore nei hoki i kawea e ia te whakahere mā Ihowā i tōna wā i rite ai, ka waha e taua tangata tōna hara.<verse eid="NUM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 9:14" />“Ā, ki te noho he manene i roto i a koutou, ā, ka mea ki te mahi i te Kapenga ki a Ihowā; kia rite ki ngā tikanga o te Kapenga, ki ngā ritenga anō o taua mahi, tāna e mea ai. Kia kotahi anō tā koutou tikanga mō te manene rāua ko te tangata whenua.”<verse eid="NUM 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Kapua me te Ahi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 40:34-38">Ekoruhe 40.34-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 9:15" />Ā, i te rā i whakaarahia ai te tapenākara, ka taupokina te tapenākara e te kapua, arā te tēneti o te whakaaturanga; ā, i te ahiahi i rite a runga o te tapenākara ki te āhua ahi, taea noatia te ata. <verse eid="NUM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 9:16" />I pērā tonu: i taupokina e te kapua i te awatea, e te āhua ahi hoki i te pō. <verse eid="NUM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 9:17" />Ka riro ake hoki te kapua i runga i te tapenākara, nā, muri iho, ka haere ngā tama a Īharaira; ā, i te wāhi i tau ai te kapua ka whakatūria e ngā tama a Īharaira ō rātou tēneti ki reira. <verse eid="NUM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 9:18" />Nā, ko ngā haerenga o ngā tama a Īharaira nā te whakahau a Ihowā, ā, ko ō rātou nohoanga iho nā te whakahau anō a Ihowā. I noho anō rātou i ngā rā katoa i tau ai te kapua ki runga ki te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 9:19" />Ā, ka maha ngā rā i roa ai te kapua ki runga ki te tapenākara, nā, ka rite i ngā tama a Īharaira tā Ihowā i whakarite ai, ā, kīhai i haere. <verse eid="NUM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 9:20" />Ā, he wā anō i torutoru ngā rā o te kapua ki runga ki te tapenākara; heoi nā te whakahau a Ihowā ka noho rātou i ō rātou tēneti, ā, nā te whakahau anō a Ihowā ka haere rātou. <verse eid="NUM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 9:21" />Ā, i ētahi wā i tūturu te kapua i te ahiahi taea noatia te ata; ā, ka riro ake te kapua i te ata, nā, ka haere rātou. Ahakoa he ao, he pō rānei, i riro ake ai te kapua, i haere anō rātou. <verse eid="NUM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 9:22" />Ahakoa e rua ngā rā, kotahi marama rānei, kotahi tau rānei, i roa ai te kapua ki runga ki te tapenākara, i mau ai ki reira, nā, noho ā-puni tonu iho ngā tama a Īharaira, kāhore hoki i haere; tōna rironga ake ki runga, nā, ka haere rātou. <verse eid="NUM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 9:23" />Nā te whakahau a Ihowā tā rātou noho, nā te whakahau hoki a Ihowā tā rātou haere. I rite i a rātou tā Ihowā i whakarite ai, tā Ihowā i whakahau ai, i kōrerotia ai e Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 9:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="NUM 10" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Tētere Hiriwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 10:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 10:2" />“Hangā ētahi tētere hiriwa māu, kia rua; me patupatu tō rāua hanganga, ina hangā e koe; hei tāwhiunga māu i te hui, mō ngā maunutanga anō hoki o ngā puni. <verse eid="NUM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 10:3" />Ā, ka whakatangihia aua mea, me huihui te whakaminenga katoa ki a koe, ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 10:4" />Ā, ki te mea kotahi anō e whakatangihia, nā, me huihui ki a koe ngā ariki, ngā upoko o ngā mano o Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 10:5" />Ka whakatangihia he whakaoho e koutou, nā, ka hāpainga ngā puni e noho ana ki te taha ki te rāwhiti. <verse eid="NUM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 10:6" />Ā, i te rua o ā koutou whakatangihanga o te whakaoho, nā, ka hāpainga ngā puni e noho ana ki te taha ki te tonga. Me whakatangi he whakaoho e rātou mō ō rātou maunutanga. <verse eid="NUM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 10:7" />Otiia, ka meatia kia huihuia te whakaminenga, me whakatangi e koutou, engari kaua e whakatangihia he whakaoho.<verse eid="NUM 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 10:8" />“Ā, mā ngā tama a Ārona, mā ngā tohunga, e whakatangi ngā tētere, ā, hei tikanga tēnā ki a koutou ake ake, i ō koutou whakatupuranga. <verse eid="NUM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 10:9" />Ā, ki te anga koutou ki te whawhai i tō koutou whenua ki te hoariri e whakatupu kino ana i a koutou, nā, me whakatangi he whakaoho ki ngā tētere; ā, ka maharatia koutou e Ihowā, e tō koutou Atua, ka whakaorangia hoki i ō koutou hoariri. <verse eid="NUM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 10:10" />I te rā anō e hari ai, i ō koutou rā nunui hoki, i ngā tīmatanga o ō koutou marama, me whakatangi ngā tētere ki ā koutou tahunga tinana, ki ā koutou patunga mō te pai; ā, hei whakamahara ēnā ki a koutou ki te aroaro o tō koutou Atua. Ko Ihowā ahau, ko tō koutou Atua.”<verse eid="NUM 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Haere atu i Hinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 10:11" />Ā, i te rua tekau o te rua o ngā marama, i te rua o ngā tau, kua riro ake te kapua i runga i te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga. <verse eid="NUM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 10:12" />Nā, ka hāpainga e ngā tama a Īharaira i te koraha o Hinai; ā, ka tau te kapua ki te koraha o Parana. <verse eid="NUM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 10:13" />Ā, rite tonu tā rātou hāpainga mataati ki te kupu a Ihowā i kōrerotia e Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 10:14" />Ko te tuatahi i maunu, ko te kara o te puni o ngā tama a Hūrā, me ō rātou rōpū; ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o tāna ope ko Nāhahona tama a Aminarapa. <verse eid="NUM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 10:15" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Ihākara ko Netanēre tama a Tuara. <verse eid="NUM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 10:16" />Ko te kaiwhakahaere hoki o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Hepurona ko Eriapa tama a Herona.<verse eid="NUM 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 10:17" />Nā, ka wāhia te tapenākara; ā, ka tūria atu e ngā tama a Kerehona, rātou ko ngā tama a Merari, ko rātou ki te amo i te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 10:18" />Nā, ka maunu ko te kara o te puni o Reupena, me ō rātou rōpū. Ko te kaiwhakahaere o tāna ope ko Erituru tama a Hereuru. <verse eid="NUM 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 10:19" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Himiona ko Herumiere tama a Turiharai. <verse eid="NUM 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 10:20" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Kara ko Eriāhapa tama a Teuere. <verse eid="NUM 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 10:21" />Nā, ka tūria atu e ngā Kohati me te amo i te nohoanga tapu; ā tae rawa atu rātou kua tū te tapenākara i ētahi.<verse eid="NUM 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 10:22" />Nā, ka maunu atu ko te kara o te puni o ngā tama a Ēparaima, me ō rātou rōpū; ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o tāna ope ko Erihama tama a Amihuru. <verse eid="NUM 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 10:23" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Mānahi ko Kamariere tama a Peraturu. <verse eid="NUM 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 10:24" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Pineamine ko Apirana tama a Kirioni.<verse eid="NUM 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 10:25" />Nā, ka maunu ko te kara o te puni o ngā tama a Rāna, ko te hiku tēnā o ngā puni katoa, puta noa i ō rātou ope. Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o tāna ope ko Ahiētere tama a Amiharai. <verse eid="NUM 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 10:26" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Āhera ko Pakiere tama a Okorana. <verse eid="NUM 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 10:27" />Ā, ko te kaiwhakahaere o te ope o te iwi o ngā tama a Napatari ko Ahira tama a Enana. <verse eid="NUM 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 10:28" />Ko ngā maunutanga ēnei o ngā tama a Īharaira, me ō rātou ope, i ō rātou whakatikanga atu.<verse eid="NUM 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 10:29" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a Hōpapa, tama a Reuere Miriani, a te hungawai o Mohi, “E haere ana mātou ki te wāhi mea nei a Ihowā, ‘Ka hoatu a reira e ahau ki a koutou’; haere mai tātou, ka pai tā mātou mahi ki a koe; he pai hoki te kōrero a Ihowā mō Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 10:30" />Ā, ka mea tērā ki a ia, “E kore ahau e haere; engari me haere ahau ki tōku whenua, ki ōku whanaunga.”<verse eid="NUM 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 10:31" />Ā, ka mea ia, “Kaua rā mātou e whakarērea; e mōhio ana hoki koe ki ngā puni mō mātou i te koraha, ā, ka ai koe hei kanohi mō mātou. <verse eid="NUM 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 10:32" />Nā, tēnei ake, ki te haere koe i a mātou, inā, tēnei ake ko te pai e meatia mai e Ihowā ki a mātou ka meatia hoki e mātou ki a koe.”<verse eid="NUM 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 10:33" />Nā, ka tūria atu e rātou i te maunga o Ihowā, e toru ngā rā i haere ai; ā, i haere te āka o te kawenata o Ihowā i mua i a rātou, i ngā rā e toru i haere ai, ki te titiro okiokinga mō rātou. <verse eid="NUM 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 10:34" />Ā, i runga i a rātou te kapua o Ihowā i te awatea, i tō rātou whakatikanga atu i te puni.<verse eid="NUM 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 10:35" />Ā, ka maunu te āka, nā, ka mea a Mohi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:35">“Whakatika, e Ihowā, ā, kia marara ōu hoariri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">kia rere hoki i tōu aroaro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:35">te hunga e kino ana ki a koe.”<verse eid="NUM 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 10:36" />Ā, ka tū te āka, nā, ka mea ia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 10:36">“Hoki mai, e Ihowā,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 10:36">ki ngā mano tini o Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="NUM 11" />
  <para style="s">Te Amuamu i roto i te Koraha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 11:1" />Ā, ka tāki amuamu te iwi, ka kōrero kino ki ngā taringa o Ihowā; ā, nō te rongonga o Ihowā, ka mura tōna riri. Ā, ka kā te ahi a Ihowā i roto i a rātou, ā, pau ake te hunga i ngā pito ki waho o te puni. <verse eid="NUM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 11:2" />Nā, ka tangi te iwi ki a Mohi; ā, ka īnoi a Mohi ki a Ihowā, nā, ka mate te ahi. <verse eid="NUM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 11:3" />Ā, huaina iho te ingoa o tēnā wāhi ko Tapera; nō te kānga hoki o te ahi a Ihowā i roto i a rātou.<verse eid="NUM 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 11:4" />Nā, ka minamina ngā whakauru i roto i a rātou; me ngā tama hoki a Īharaira i tangi anō, i mea, “Mā wai e hōmai he kikokiko hei kai mā tātou? <verse eid="NUM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 11:5" />E mahara ana tātou ki ngā ika i kainga noatia e tātou ki Īhipa; ki ngā kūkamo, ki ngā merengi, ki ngā rīki, ki ngā aniana, me te karika. <verse eid="NUM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 11:6" />Ko tēnei ia, kua maroke ō tātou wairua; kāhore rawa nei tētahi mea; kāhore he mea kē hei tirohanga mā tātou ko tēnei mana anake.”<verse eid="NUM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 11:7" />Nā, ko te rite o te mana kei te pua korianara; ko tōna kara kei te kara teriuma. <verse eid="NUM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 11:8" />I kōpikopiko te iwi ki te kohi, ā, hurihia ana e rātou ki ngā mira, i tukia rānei ki te kumete, ā, tunua ana e rātou ki te kōhua, hangā ana hoki hei keke; ko tōna reka kei tō te hinu hou. <verse eid="NUM 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 11:9" />Ā, i te taunga iho o te haunui ki te puni i te pō, i tau anō te mana ki runga.<verse eid="NUM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 11:10" />Ā, i rongo a Mohi i te iwi e tangi ana, puta noa i ō rātou hapū, tēnei, tēnei, i te whatitoka o tōna tēneti; ā, he nui te muranga o te riri o Ihowā; ā, i kino hoki ki tā Mohi. <verse eid="NUM 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 11:11" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a Ihowā, “He aha koe i whakatupu kino ai i tāu pononga? He aha ahau tē manakohia ai e koe, i whakawahā ai e koe tēnei iwi katoa ki ahau? <verse eid="NUM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 11:12" />He uri ianei nōku tēnei iwi katoa? I whānau rānei rātou i ahau, i mea ai koe ki ahau, ‘Hikitia ki tōu uma, kia rite ki tā te matua atawhai, ki tāna hiki i te pōtiki,’ ki te whenua i oatitia e koe ki ō rātou mātua? <verse eid="NUM 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 11:13" />Nō hea aku kikokiko hei hoatutanga māku ki tēnei iwi katoa? E tangi mai ana hoki rātou ki ahau, e mea mai ana, ‘Hōmai he kikokiko ki a mātou hei kai mā mātou.’ <verse eid="NUM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 11:14" />E kore tēnei iwi katoa e taea e ahau anake te waha, he taimaha rawa māku. <verse eid="NUM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 11:15" />Ā, ki te pēnei tāu mahi ki ahau, tēnā, whakamatea rawatia ahau, ki te mea kua manakohia mai ahau e koe; kaua hoki ahau e kite i te hē mōku.”<verse eid="NUM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaumātua Tokowhitu Tekau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 11:16" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi: “Huihuia mai ki ahau kia whitu tekau o ngā kaumātua o Īharaira, āu i mōhio ai he kaumātua nō te iwi, he rangatira nō rātou; me kawe mai rātou ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, me tū tahi koutou ki reira. <verse eid="NUM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 11:17" />Ā, māku e haere iho, e kōrero ki a koe ki reira; me tango anō e ahau tētahi wāhi o te wairua i runga i a koe, ka hoatu ki runga ki a rātou; ā, ko rātou hei hoa mōu ki te waha i te pīkaunga, arā i te iwi; kei waha e koe anake.<verse eid="NUM 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 11:18" />“Me kī atu hoki e koe ki te iwi: ‘Whakatapu i a koutou mō āpōpō, ā, ka kai kikokiko koutou. Kua tangi nā hoki koutou ki ngā taringa o Ihowā, kua mea, “Mā wai e hōmai he kikokiko hei kai mā mātou? He pai hoki ngā mea i a mātou i Īhipa.” Mō reira ka hōmai e Ihowā he kikokiko ki a koutou, ā, ka kai koutou. <verse eid="NUM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 11:19" />E kore e kotahi te rā e kai ai koutou, e kore anō hoki e rua ngā rā, e kore e rima ngā rā, e kore e tekau ngā rā, e kore e rua tekau ngā rā; <verse eid="NUM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 11:20" />engari, kia pau te marama, ā, puta noa i ō koutou ihu, ā, ngaruru iho koutou. Mō koutou i whakahāwea ki a Ihowā e noho nei i waenganui i a koutou, i tangi hoki ki tōna aroaro, i mea, “He aha tātou i haere mai ai i Īhipa?” ’<verse eid="NUM 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 11:21" />“Ko te iwi kei roto nei ahau i a rātou e ono rau mano, he hunga haere raro, ā, kua mea mai nei koe, ‘Ka hoatu e ahau he kikokiko ki a rātou, ā, kia kotahi tino marama e kai ai rātou.’ <verse eid="NUM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 11:22" />Me patu rānei ngā hipi me ngā kau mā rātou, kia rato ai rātou? Me kohi mai rānei ngā ika katoa o te moana mā rātou, kia rato ai rātou?”<verse eid="NUM 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 11:23" />Anō rā ko Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Kua mutua rānei te ringa o Ihowā? Ka kite koe āianei he pono rānei tāku kupu ki a koe, kāhore rānei.”<verse eid="NUM 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 11:24" />Nā, ka puta a Mohi ki waho, ā, kōrerotia ana e ia ngā kupu a Ihowā ki te iwi, ā, huihuia ana e ia e whitu tekau o ngā kaumātua o te iwi, ā, whakatūria ana ki tētahi taha, ki tētahi taha o te tapenākara. <verse eid="NUM 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 11:25" />Nā, ko te hekenga iho o Ihowā i roto i te kapua, ko te kōrerotanga hoki ki a ia, nā, ka tangohia e ia tētahi wāhi o te wairua i runga i a ia, ā, hoatu ana ki ngā kaumātua e whitu tekau. Ā, i te taunga iho o te wairua ki a rātou, ka poropiti rātou, ā, kore ake i pērā i muri.<verse eid="NUM 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 11:26" />Ā, tokorua i mahue ki te puni, ko Ererara te ingoa o tētahi, ko Merara te ingoa o tētahi. Nā, ko te taunga iho o te wairua ki runga ki a rāua; nō te hunga hoki rāua i tuhituhia, otiia kīhai i haere ki te tapenākara; nā, ka poropiti rāua i roto i te puni. <verse eid="NUM 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 11:27" />Nā, ka oma tētahi taitama ki te kōrero ki a Mohi, ā, ka mea, “Kei te poropiti a Ererara rāua ko Merara i roto i te puni.”<verse eid="NUM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 11:28" />Nā, ko te ohonga o te tangata a Mohi, o Hohua tama a Nunu, ko tētahi hoki ia o āna taitamariki, ka mea, “E tōku ariki, e Mohi, rīria rāua.”<verse eid="NUM 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 11:29" />Anō rā ko Mohi ki a ia, “He whakaaro ki ahau i hae ai koe? He oranga ngākau rā me i poropiti katoa te iwi o Ihowā, me i tukua iho hoki e Ihowā tōna wairua ki a rātou.” <verse eid="NUM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 11:30" />Nā, ka haere a Mohi ki roto ki te puni, ā, ia me ngā kaumātua o Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Koitareke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 11:31" />Nā, ka puta he hau i a Ihowā, ā, kawea ana mai ngā koitareke i te moana, kua makā ki te taha o te puni, kia kotahi pea te rā e haere ai i tētahi taha, kia kotahi pea hoki te rā e haere ai i tērā taha, ā tawhio noa te puni, me te mea ānō e rua whatīanga te teitei i runga i te mata o te whenua. <verse eid="NUM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 11:32" />Nā, ka tū te iwi ā pau katoa taua rā, taua pō katoa hoki, me te rā katoa hoki i te aonga ake, ki te kohikohi i ngā koitareke; kotahi tekau ngā homa a te tangata nāna te kohinga iti. Ā, horahorangia noatia atu ana e rātou hei kai mā rātou, ā tawhio noa te puni. <verse eid="NUM 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 11:33" />Ā, i te mea kei ō rātou niho anō te kikokiko, i te mea kāhore anō i ngaua noatia, nā, ka mura te riri o Ihowā ki te iwi, ā, whiua ana te iwi e Ihowā ki tētahi whiu nui rawa atu. <verse eid="NUM 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 11:34" />Nā, huaina iho e ia te ingoa o taua wāhi ko Kipiroto Hataawa; nō te mea i tanumia e rātou ki reira te hunga i minamina.<verse eid="NUM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 11:35" />Nā, ka tūria atu e te iwi i Kipiroto Hataawa ki Hateroto; ā, noho ana i Hateroto.<verse eid="NUM 11:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="NUM 12" />
  <para style="s">Ka Whakahē a Ārona rāua ko Miriama ki a Mohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 12:1" />Nā, ka whakahē a Miriama rāua ko Ārona ki a Mohi mō te wahine Kuhi i mārenatia e ia (he wahine Kuhi hoki tāna i mārena ai); <verse eid="NUM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 12:2" />ā, ka mea rāua, “Koia rānei i a Mohi anake ngā kōrero a Ihowā? Kāhore rānei ana kōrero hoki i a māua?” Ā, ka rongo a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 12:3" />Nā, he tangata māhaki rawa a Mohi i ngā tāngata katoa o te mata o te whenua.<verse eid="NUM 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 12:4" />Nā, i ohorere tonu te kōrerotanga a i Ihowā ki a Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko Miriama, “Puta mai koutou tokotoru ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga.” Ā, ka puta atu rātou tokotoru. <verse eid="NUM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 12:5" />Nā, ka heke iho a Ihowā i roto i te pou kapua, ā, ka tū ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara, ka karanga hoki ki a Ārona rāua ko Miriama; ā, ka puta rāua. <verse eid="NUM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 12:6" />Ā, ka mea ia, “Tēnā, whakarongo ki āku kōrero:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:6">Ki te mea he poropiti kei a koutou,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">ka whakaatu atu ahau, a Ihowā i ahau ki a ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:6">he mea whakakite, he kōrero moemoeā ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 12:7" />Ehara tāku pononga, a Mohi i te pērā;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:7">he pono ia i tōku whare katoa.<verse eid="NUM 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 12:8" />Ka kōrero ahau ki a ia, he māngai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">he māngai, he kōrero mata nui, kāhore hoki he kupu ngaro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">ā, e kite anō ia i te āhua o Ihowā.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 12:8">He aha rā kōrua tē wehi ai ki te whakahē</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 12:8">mō tāku pononga, mō Mohi?”<verse eid="NUM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 12:9" />Nā, ka mura te riri o Ihowā ki a rāua, ā, haere ana ia.<verse eid="NUM 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 12:10" />Nā, ka riro atu te kapua i runga i te tapenākara; nā! He repera a Miriama, kua rite ki te hukarere; ā, ka titiro a Ārona ki a Miriama, e! He repera. <verse eid="NUM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 12:11" />Nā, ka mea a Ārona ki a Mohi, “Auē, e tōku ariki, kaua e utaina ki a māua tēnei hara i pōauau nei, i hara nei māua. <verse eid="NUM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 12:12" />Kei rite ia ki te mea kua mate, ki te mea kua pau tētahi wāhi o ōna kikokiko i te putanga mai i te kōpū o tōna whaea.”<verse eid="NUM 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 12:13" />Nā, ka karanga atu a Mohi ki a Ihowā, ka mea, “E te Atua, tēnā rā, whakaorangia ia.”<verse eid="NUM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 12:14" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā, ki a Mohi, “Me i tuwha kau tōna pāpā ki tōna mata e kore ianei ia e whakamā, ā, whitu noa ngā rā? Kia whitu ngā rā e tūtakina atu ai ia ki waho o te puni, ā muri iho ka mauria mai anō.” <verse eid="NUM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 12:15" />Nā, tūtakina atu ana a Miriama ki waho o te puni, e whitu ngā rā; kīhai anō hoki te iwi i haere, kia whakahokia mai rā anō a Miriama.<verse eid="NUM 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 12:16" />Ā muri iho ka tūria e te iwi i Hateroto, ā, noho ana i te koraha o Parana.<verse eid="NUM 12:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="NUM 13" />
  <para style="s">Ka Unga a Mohi he Tūtei ki Kanaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 1:19-33">Tiuteronomi 1.19-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 13:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 13:2" />“Me unga e koe ētahi tāngata hei tūtei mō te whenua o Kanaana, mō tērā e hoatu nei e ahau ki ngā tama a Īharaira. Kia kotahi o tēnei iwi, o tēnei iwi o ō rātou mātua e tonoa e koutou, hei te rangatira anake.”<verse eid="NUM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 13:3" />Nā, ka unga a Mohi i a rātou i te koraha o Parana, ka pērā me tā Ihowā i kī ai; he upoko katoa ēnei tāngata nō ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 13:4" />Ko ō rātou ingoa ēnei:</para>
  <para style="li" vid="NUM 13:4">nō te iwi o Reupena, ko Hāmua tama a Tākuru;<verse eid="NUM 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 13:5" />nō te iwi o Himiona, ko Hāpata tama a Hori;<verse eid="NUM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 13:6" />nō te iwi o Hūrā, ko Karepe tama a Iepune;<verse eid="NUM 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 13:7" />nō te iwi o Ihākara, ko Ikara tama a Hōhepa;<verse eid="NUM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 13:8" />nō te iwi o Ēparaima, ko Hohea tama a Nunu;<verse eid="NUM 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 13:9" />nō te iwi o Pineamine, ko Parati tama a Rapu;<verse eid="NUM 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 13:10" />nō te iwi o Hepurona, ko Kariere tama a Hori;<verse eid="NUM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 13:11" />nō te iwi o Hōhepa, arā nō te iwi o Mānahi, ko Kari tama a Huhi;<verse eid="NUM 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 13:12" />nō te iwi o Rāna, ko Amiere tama a Kemari;<verse eid="NUM 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 13:13" />nō te iwi o Āhera, ko Heturu tama a Mikaere;<verse eid="NUM 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 13:14" />nō te iwi o Napatari, ko Nahapi tama a Wopohi;<verse eid="NUM 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="li">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 13:15" />nō te iwi o Kara, ko Keuere tama a Maki.<verse eid="NUM 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 13:16" />Ko ngā ingoa ēnei o ngā tāngata i ungā nei e Mohi hei tūtei mō te whenua. Ā, huaina iho e Mohi a Hohea tama a Nunu ko Hohua.<verse eid="NUM 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 13:17" />Nā, ka ungā rātou e Mohi hei tūtei mō te whenua o Kanaana, ka mea ia ki a rātou, “Haere atu ki runga nā konei, nā te tonga, ka kake ki te maunga; <verse eid="NUM 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 13:18" />ka titiro ai i te whenua, he aha rānei; i te iwi anō hoki e noho ana i reira, he kaha rānei, he kahakore rānei, he tokoouou rānei, he tokomaha rānei. <verse eid="NUM 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 13:19" />He pēhea te whenua e nohoia ana e rātou, he pai rānei, he kino rānei; he pēhea hoki ngā pā e nohoia ana e rātou, he tēneti rānei, he mea taiepa rānei; <verse eid="NUM 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 13:20" />he pēhea hoki te whenua, he mōmona rānei, he kikokore rānei, he rākau rānei tō reira, kāhore rānei. Kia māia hoki, maua mai anō ētahi o ngā hua o te whenua.” Nā, ko taua wā ko te wā o ngā karepe mātāmua.<verse eid="NUM 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 13:21" />Nā, ko tō rātou haerenga ki runga, tūteia ana e rātou te whenua i te koraha o Hini, ā tae noa ki Rehopo, ki te haerenga atu ki Hāmata. <verse eid="NUM 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 13:22" />Ā, i haere rātou nā te tonga, ka tae ki Heperona; ā, i reira a Ahimana, a Hehai, a Tāramai, ngā tama a Anaka. (Nā, ko Heperona, ko tōna hanganga, e whitu ngā tau i mua i tō Toana i Īhipa.) <verse eid="NUM 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 13:23" />Ā, ka tae iho rātou ki te awaawa ki Ehekora, ka tapahia i reira he manga karepe, kotahi te tautau, ka amohia e te tokorua i runga i te tokotoko; i mauria mai anō ētahi pamekaranete, me ētahi piki. <verse eid="NUM 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 13:24" />Ā, huaina iho taua wāhi ko te raorao o Ehekora, nō te tautau karepe i tapahia e ngā tama a Īharaira i reira.<verse eid="NUM 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Kōrero o ngā Tūtei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 13:25" />Nō te paunga o ngā rā e whā tekau ka hoki mai rātou i te tūtei i te whenua. <verse eid="NUM 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 13:26" />Nā, haere ana, ā, ka tae ki a Mohi rātou ko Ārona, ko te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ki te koraha o Parana, ki Karehe; ki te whakahoki i te kōrero ki a rātou ko te whakaminenga katoa, ā, whakakitea ana e rātou ngā hua o te whenua ki a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 13:27" />Ā, ka kōrero ki a ia, ka mea, “I tae mātou ki te whenua i ungā nei mātou e koe, nā, he pono e rerengia ana e te waiū, e te honi; ko ōna hua tēnei. <verse eid="NUM 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 13:28" />Otiia he kaha te iwi e noho ana i taua whenua, he mea taiepa hoki ngā pā, he nunui rawa; i kite anō mātou i ngā tama a Anaka ki reira. <verse eid="NUM 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 13:29" />E noho ana ngā Amareki i te whenua ki te tonga; ko ngā Hiti, ko ngā Iepuhi, ko ngā Amori, e noho ana i ngā maunga; kei te taha o te moana ngā Kanaani e noho ana, kei te taha anō o Horano.”<verse eid="NUM 13:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 13:30" />Nā, ka whakamārietia te iwi e Karepe i te aroaro o Mohi, ā, ka mea ia, “Kia hohoro tā tātou haere ki te tango i reira; e taea hoki e tātou.”<verse eid="NUM 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 13:31" />Ko ngā tāngata ia i haere tahi me ia ki runga, i mea, “E kore e āhei i a tātou te haere ki runga, ki taua iwi; he kaha ake hoki rātou i a tātou.” <verse eid="NUM 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 13:32" />Nā, ka kawea e rātou he kōrero kino mō te whenua i tūteia e rātou ki ngā tama a Īharaira, i mea rātou, “Ko taua whenua i haerea rā e mātou, i tūteia, he whenua e ngau ana i ōna tāngata; he tangata nunui rawa hoki te hunga katoa i kitea e mātou ki reira. <verse eid="NUM 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 13:33" />He nunui rawa hoki ngā tāngata i kitea e mātou ki reira, he tama nā Anaka, he uri nō ngā tāngata roroa; ā, ki tā mātou titiro, me he māwhitiwhiti mātou; he pērā anō mātou ki tā rātou titiro.”<verse eid="NUM 13:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="NUM 14" />
  <para style="s">Ka Amuamu te Iwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 14:1" />Nā, ka hāmama te reo o te whakaminenga katoa; ā, ka tangi te iwi i taua pō. <verse eid="NUM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 14:2" />Ā, amuamu ana ngā tama katoa a Īharaira ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona; ā, ka mea te whakaminenga katoa ki a rāua, “Auē, me i mate tātou ki te whenua o Īhipa! Auē, me i mate rānei tātou ki tēnei koraha! <verse eid="NUM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 14:3" />He aha tātou i kawea mai ai e Ihowā ki tēnei whenua, kia hinga i te hoari? Ka waiho ā tātou wāhine, ā tātou tamariki hei taonga pārau; ehara ianei te hoki ki Īhipa i te mea pai mō tātou?” <verse eid="NUM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 14:4" />Ā, ka mea rātou tētahi ki tētahi, “Me whakatū he upoko mō tātou, ka hoki ki Īhipa.”<verse eid="NUM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 14:5" />Nā, ka tāpapa a Mohi rāua ko Ārona ki te aroaro o te huihui katoa o te whakaminenga o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 14:6" />Ā, ka haehae a Hohua, tama a Nunu, rāua ko Karepe, tama a Iepune, i ō rāua kākahu; ko rāua hoki ētahi o ngā kaitūtei o te whenua; <verse eid="NUM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 14:7" />ā, ka kōrero rāua ki te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ka mea, “He whenua pai rawa te whenua i haerea nei, i tūteia nei e mātou. <verse eid="NUM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 14:8" />Ki te aro mai a Ihowā ki a tātou, ka kawea tātou e ia ki taua whenua, ka hōmai anō e ia ki a tātou; he whenua e rerengia ana e te waiū, e te honi. <verse eid="NUM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 14:9" />Kaua rāia koutou e tutū ki a Ihowā, kaua hoki e wehi i ngā tāngata o taua whenua, he taro hoki rātou mā tātou. Kua mahue rātou i tō rātou whakamarumaru, ā, kei a tātou a Ihowā; kaua e wehi i a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 14:10" />Heoi, ko tā te whakaminenga katoa kī, “Me āki rāua ki te kōhatu.” Nā, ko te putanga mai o te korōria o Ihowā i runga i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga ki te aroaro o ngā tama katoa a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 14:11" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Kia pēhea ake te roa o te whakahāwea a tēnei iwi ki ahau? Āhea rānei rātou whakapono ai ki ahau, he maha nei hoki āku tohu i whakakitea i roto i a rātou? <verse eid="NUM 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 14:12" />Ka patua rātou e ahau ki te mate urutā, ka peia atu, ā, ka meinga koe hei iwi nui atu, kaha atu, i a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Īnoi a Mohi mō te Iwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 14:13" />Anō rā ko Mohi ki a Ihowā, “Ākuanei ka rongo ngā Īhipiana; nāu hoki tēnei iwi i whakaputa mai i runga i tōu kaha i roto i a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 14:14" />Nā, ka kōrero rātou ki ngā tāngata o tēnei whenua. Kua rongo hoki rātou kei roto koe, e Ihowā, i tēnei iwi; e kitea ana anō koe e Ihowā, titiro atu, titiro mai, e tū ana hoki tōu kapua i runga i a rātou, e haere ana hoki koe i mua i a rātou i roto i te pou kapua i te awatea, i roto hoki i te pou ahi i te pō. <verse eid="NUM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 14:15" />Nā, ki te whakamatea e koe tēnei iwi, ānō he tangata kotahi, kātahi ngā iwi i rongo nei ki tōu rongo ka whai kupu, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 14:16" />‘Nō te mea kīhai i kaha a Ihowā ki te kawe i tēnei iwi ki te whenua i oati ai ia ki a rātou, koia i whakamatea ai rātou e ia ki te koraha.’<verse eid="NUM 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 14:17" />“Nā, kia nui rā te kaha o tōku Ariki, kia rite ki tāu i kōrero ai, i mea ai, <verse eid="NUM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 14:18" />‘He pūhoi a Ihowā ki te riri, he nui tōna atawhai, e muru ana i te kino, i te tutū, e kore rawa anō e tuku noa i te hunga hē; e mea ana i te kino o ngā mātua kia tau ki ngā tamariki, ā te toru, te whā rā anō, o ngā whakatupuranga.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 14:19" />Tēnā, murua te kino o tēnei iwi, kia rite ki te nui o tōu atawhai, ki tāu muru hoki i ngā hara o tēnei iwi, o Īhipa mai anō, ā taea noatia a konei.”<verse eid="NUM 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 14:20" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā, “Kua murua e ahau, kua pērātia me tāu i kī mai nā. <verse eid="NUM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 14:21" />Otiia – e ora nei ahau, ā, ka kapi te whenua katoa i te korōria o Ihowā – <verse eid="NUM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 14:22" />nā, i te mea ko ēnei tāngata katoa, i kite nei i tōku korōria, i āku merekara hoki i meinga ki Īhipa, ki te koraha, ā, ka tekau nei ā rātou whakamātautauranga i ahau, kāhore anō i whakarongo ki tōku reo; <verse eid="NUM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 14:23" />inā, e kore rawa rātou e kite i te whenua i oati ai ahau ki ō rātou mātua, e kore anō tētahi o te hunga i whakahāwea nei ki ahau e kite i reira.<verse eid="NUM 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 14:24" />“Engari tāku pononga a Karepe, he wairua kē hoki tōna, ā, kua tino whai ia i ahau; e kawea ia e ahau ki te whenua i haere atu nā ia; ā, ka riro a reira i ōna uri.<verse eid="NUM 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 14:25" />“Nā, kei te raorao ngā Amareki me ngā Kanaani e noho ana. Tahuri atu koutou āpōpō, haere atu ki te koraha, nā te huarahi ki te Moana Whero.”<verse eid="NUM 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Whiua te Iwi e Ihowā</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 14:26" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 14:27" />“Kia pēhea ake te roa o tāku whakamanawanui ki tēnei whakaminenga kino, e amuamu nei ki ahau? Kua rangona e ahau ngā amuamu a ngā tama a Īharaira, e amuamu nei rātou ki ahau. <verse eid="NUM 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 14:28" />Mea atu ki a rātou, ‘E ora ana ahau,’ e ai tā Ihowā, ‘ko tā koutou i kōrero mai ai ki ōku taringa, he pono, ko tāku tēnā e mea ai ki a koutou: <verse eid="NUM 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 14:29" />ka hinga ō koutou tinana ki tēnei koraha; ā, ko koutou katoa i taua, puta noa atu i tō koutou tokomaha, ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha ake hoki, ō rātou tau, te hunga hoki i amuamu nei ki ahau, <verse eid="NUM 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 14:30" />e kore koutou e tae ki te whenua i oati ai ahau ka whakanohoia koutou ki reira, heoi anō ko Karepe tama a Iepune, rāua ko Hohua tama a Nunu. <verse eid="NUM 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 14:31" />Otiia, ko ā koutou pōtiki, i mea nā koutou ka waiho hei taonga pārau, ka kawea e ahau ki reira, ā, ka mōhio rātou ki te whenua i whakahāweatia nei e koutou. <verse eid="NUM 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 14:32" />Ko koutou ia, ka hinga ō koutou tinana ki tēnei koraha. <verse eid="NUM 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 14:33" />Ā, ka kōpikopiko noa ā koutou tamariki i te koraha, e whā tekau ngā tau, mā rātou hoki e waha ā koutou pūremutanga, kia poto rā anō ō koutou tinana ki te koraha. <verse eid="NUM 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 14:34" />Kia rite rā anō ki te maha o ngā rā, ki ngā rā e whā tekau, i tūteia ai e koutou te whenua, he tau he rā, he tau he rā; e whā tekau ngā tau e waha ai e koutou ō koutou kino, ā, ka mōhio koutou ki te takanga o tāku kupu.’ <verse eid="NUM 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 14:35" />Nāku, nā Ihowā te kupu, inā, ka meatia tēnei e ahau ki tēnei whakaminenga kino katoa, kua huihui nei ki te whakahē ki ahau. Ka poto rātou ki tēnei koraha, ka mate anō hoki ki konei.”<verse eid="NUM 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 14:36" />Nā, ko ngā tāngata i ungā e Mohi hei tūtei mō te whenua, i hoki mai nei, i mea nei kia amuamutia ia e te whakaminenga katoa, i tā rātou kawenga mai i te kōrero kino mō te whenua, <verse eid="NUM 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 14:37" />ko aua tāngata, nā rātou nei i kawe mai te kōrero kino mō te whenua, i mate rātou i te whiu ki te aroaro o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 14:38" />Ko Hohua ia, tama a Nunu, rāua ko Karepe, tama a Iepune, ko rāua i ora o ngā tāngata i haere ki te tūtei i te whenua.<verse eid="NUM 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 14:39" />Nā, kōrerotia ana e Mohi ēnei kupu katoa ki ngā tama katoa a Īharaira; ā, ka pōuri rawa te iwi. <verse eid="NUM 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 14:40" />Nā, ka maranga wawe rātou i te ata, ā, ka haere ki te tihi o te maunga, me te kī anō, “Tēnei mātou, ā, ka haere mātou ki runga, ki te wāhi i kōrerotia mai e Ihowā; kua hara hoki mātou.”<verse eid="NUM 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 14:41" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi, “He aha koutou i takahi ai i te kupu a Ihowā, i te mea kāhore e whai wāhi? <verse eid="NUM 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 14:42" />Kaua e haere, kāhore nā hoki a Ihowā i a koutou, kei patua koutou ki te aroaro o ō koutou hoariri. <verse eid="NUM 14:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 14:43" />Kei reira hoki ngā Amareki rātou ko ngā Kanaani, kei mua i a koutou, ā, ka hinga koutou i te hoari; mō koutou kua tahuri atu i te whai i a Ihowā, koia a Ihowā tē piri ai ki a koutou.”<verse eid="NUM 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 14:44" />Heoi, ka pokanoa rātou ki te piki ki te tihi o te maunga; otiia kīhai te āka o te kawenata a Ihowā, me Mohi hoki, i hiki atu i te puni. <verse eid="NUM 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 14:45" />Nā, ka heke iho ngā Amareki rātou ko ngā Kanaani e noho ana i taua maunga, ā, patua ana rātou, tukituki rawa, ā taea noatia a Horema.<verse eid="NUM 14:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="NUM 15" />
  <para style="s">Te Tikanga mō ngā Whakahere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 15:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā, ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 15:2" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: E tae koutou ki te whenua e noho ai koutou, ki tāku e hoatu ai ki a koutou, <verse eid="NUM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 15:3" />ā, ka mea i te whakahere ahi ki a Ihowā – i te tahunga tinana, i te patunga tapu rānei hei whakamana mō te kī taurangi, i te whakahere tuku noa rānei, i ā koutou hākari nunui rānei – hei whakakakara reka ki a Ihowā, he mea nō ngā kau, nō ngā hipi rānei. <verse eid="NUM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 15:4" />Nā, me kawe mai tāna whakahere e te kaiwhakahere ki a Ihowā he whakahere totokore, ko te whakatekau o te epa o te parāoa pai, he mea kōnatunatu ki te whakawhā o te hine hinu. <verse eid="NUM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 15:5" />Kia rite mai anō i a koe te whakawhā o te hine wāina, hei ringihanga, hei kīnaki mō te tahunga tinana, mō te patunga tapu rānei, mō te reme kotahi.<verse eid="NUM 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 15:6" />“Ki te mea he hipi toa, kia rite i a koe hei whakahere totokore ngā whakatekau e rua o te epa o te parāoa pai, he mea kōnatunatu ki te whakatoru o te hine hinu. <verse eid="NUM 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 15:7" />Me whakahere anō e koe te whakatoru o te hine wāina hei ringihanga, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 15:8" />“Ā, ka mea koe i te pūru hei tahunga tinana, hei patunga tapu rānei, hei whakamana i te kupu taurangi, hei whakahere rānei mō te pai ki a Ihowā; <verse eid="NUM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 15:9" />nā, me kawe tahi anō e ia me te pūru, hei whakahere totokore, kia toru ngā whakatekau o te epa o te parāoa pai, he mea kōnatunatu ki te hāwhe o te hine hinu. <verse eid="NUM 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 15:10" />Me kawe anō e koe te hāwhe o te hine wāina hei ringihanga, hei whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 15:11" />“Kia pēnei te meatanga mō te pūru kotahi, mō te hipi toa kotahi, mō te reme toa, mō te kūao koati. <verse eid="NUM 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 15:12" />Kia rite ki te maha o ā koutou e tuku ai tā koutou e mea ai ki tētahi, ki tētahi, kia rite tonu ki te maha o rātou. <verse eid="NUM 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 15:13" />Kia pēnei te meatanga a ngā tāngata whenua katoa i ēnei mea, ina whakahere i te whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 15:14" />Ā, ki te noho i a koe tētahi manene, tētahi noa atu rānei, i roto i a koutou i ō koutou whakatupuranga, ā, ka mea kia whakahere i te whakahere ahi, i te kakara reka ki a Ihowā; kia rite tāna e mea ai ki tā koutou e mea ai. <verse eid="NUM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 15:15" />Mō te whakaminenga kia kotahi te tikanga mō koutou, mō te manene hoki e noho tahi ana me koutou, hei tikanga pūmau i ō koutou whakatupuranga; kia pērā anō me koutou te manene i te aroaro o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 15:16" />Kia kotahi anō te ture, kia kotahi anō te ritenga mō koutou, mō te manene hoki e noho ana i a koutou.<verse eid="NUM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 15:17" />“I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 15:18" />Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: E tae koutou ki te whenua e kawea nei koutou e ahau ki reira, <verse eid="NUM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 15:19" />nā, e kai koutou i te taro o te whenua, me whakahere he whakahere hapahapai ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 15:20" />Me whakahere he keke nō tā koutou parāoa pokepoke mataati hei whakahere hapahapai; kia rite ki te whakahere hapahapai o te patunga wīti tā koutou hapahapai. <verse eid="NUM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 15:21" />Me hoatu tētahi wāhi o tā koutou pokepokenga mataati ki a Ihowā, hei whakahere hapahapai, puta noa i ō koutou whakatupuranga.<verse eid="NUM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 15:22" />“Ā, ki te mea kua pōhēhē koutou, ā, kīhai i rite ēnei whakahau katoa i kōrerotia nei e Ihowā ki a Mohi – <verse eid="NUM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 15:23" />arā ngā mea katoa i whakahaua ai koutou e Ihowā, i kōrerotia e Mohi, o te rā anō i whakahau ai a Ihowā ā tuku iho ki ō koutou whakatupuranga – <verse eid="NUM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 15:24" />ko reira, ki te meatia tētahi mea, he pōhēhē hoki, e ngaro ana i ngā kanohi o te whakaminenga, nā, me whakahere e te whakaminenga katoa tētahi pūru kūao hei tahunga tinana, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga; kia rite ki te tikanga, kia kotahi hoki koati toa hei whakahere hara. <verse eid="NUM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 15:25" />Ā, ka whakamārie te tohunga mō te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, ka murua tō rātou hē; he pōhēhē hoki; ā, me kawe tā rātou whakahere, hei whakahere ahi ki a Ihowā, me tā rātou whakahere hara ki te aroaro o Ihowā, mō tō rātou pōhēhē. <verse eid="NUM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 15:26" />Ā, ka murua taua hē o te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, o te manene anō e noho ana i a rātou; nō te mea i pōhēhē katoa te iwi.<verse eid="NUM 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 15:27" />“Ki te pōhēhē anō tētahi wairua, ā, ka hara, nā, me kawe mai e ia he koati uha, hei te tau tahi, hei whakahere hara. <verse eid="NUM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 15:28" />Ā, me whakamārie te tohunga mō te wairua i hara pōhēhē, ina hara pōhēhē ia, ki te aroaro o Ihowā, hei whakamārie mōna; ā, ka murua tāna.<verse eid="NUM 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 15:29" />“Kia kotahi anō tā koutou ture mō te tangata i hara pōhēhē, mō te tangata whenua o ngā tama a Īharaira rāua ko te manene e noho ana i a rātou.<verse eid="NUM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 15:30" />“Ko te wairua ia i whakakake, ahakoa tangata whenua, manene rānei, he kohukohu tāna i a Ihowā; ā, ka hātepea atu taua wairua i roto i tōna iwi. <verse eid="NUM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 15:31" />I whakahāwea ia ki te kupu a Ihowā, i whakataka hoki i tāna whakahau; ka tino hātepea atu taua wairua; ka mau tōna kino ki a ia.”<verse eid="NUM 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Tangata i Whati i te Hāpati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 15:32" />Ā, i ngā tama a Īharaira i te koraha, ka kitea tētahi tangata e kohikohi rākau ana i te rā hāpati. <verse eid="NUM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 15:33" />Nā, ka kawea ia e ngā tāngata, i kite rā i a ia e kohikohi ana i ngā rākau, ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, ā, ki te whakaminenga katoa. <verse eid="NUM 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 15:34" />Nā, hoatu ana ia e rātou kia tiakina, nō te mea kāhore anō i whakaaturia me aha ia.<verse eid="NUM 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 15:35" />Ā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Me whakamate rawa tēnā tangata; mā te whakaminenga katoa ia e āki ki te kōhatu ki waho o te puni.” <verse eid="NUM 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 15:36" />Nā, kawea ana ia e te whakaminenga katoa ki waho o te puni, ā, ākina ana ki te kōhatu, ā, ka mate; pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Tikanga mō ngā Tāniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 15:37" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 15:38" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou kia hangā ētahi tāniko mō rātou, mō ngā taha o ō rātou kākahu, puta noa i ō rātou whakatupuranga, kia karapitia hoki te tāniko o te pito ki te miro purū; <verse eid="NUM 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 15:39" />ā, hei tāniko tēnā mō koutou, hei titiro iho mā koutou, nā, ka mahara ki ngā whakahau katoa a Ihowā, ā, ka mahi; kei rapu koutou i tā ō koutou ngākau, i tā ō koutou kanohi, arā i ngā mea e whāia atu nei, e pūremutia atu nei e koutou. <verse eid="NUM 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 15:40" />Kia mahara ai koutou ki te mahi i āku whakahau katoa, kia tapu ai hoki ki tō koutou Atua. <verse eid="NUM 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 15:41" />Ko Ihowā ahau, ko tō koutou Atua i kawe mai nei i a koutou i te whenua o Īhipa, kia waiho ai ahau hei Atua mō koutou: Ko Ihowā ahau, ko tō koutou Atua.”<verse eid="NUM 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="NUM 16" />
  <para style="s">Te Whawhai a Koraha mā</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 16:1" />Nā, ka tango tāngata a Koraha tama a Itihara, tama a Kohata, tama a Rīwai, rātou ko Ratana, ko Āpirama, tama a Eriapa, ko Ono hoki, tama a Perete, he tama nā Reupena; <verse eid="NUM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 16:2" />ā, ka whakatika rātou ki te aroaro o Mohi, me ētahi o ngā tama a Īharaira, e rua rau e rima tekau, he rangatira nō te whakaminenga, e rangona ana i roto i te huihui, he hunga whai ingoa. <verse eid="NUM 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 16:3" />Ka whakahuihui rātou i a rātou ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, ka mea ki a rāua, “He kaha rawa tā kōrua tango tikanga, he tapu kau nei te whakaminenga katoa, kei waenganui anō hoki a Ihowā i a rātou. He aha rā kōrua i whakanui ai i a kōrua ki runga ake i te whakaminenga a Ihowā?”<verse eid="NUM 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 16:4" />Ā, nō te rongonga o Mohi, ka hinga tāpapa iho ia; <verse eid="NUM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 16:5" />ā, ka kōrero ki a Koraha rātou ko tāna hui katoa, ka mea: “Ā te ata ka whakaaturia mai e Ihowā ko wai tāna, ko wai te mea tapu; ka meinga anō e ia kia whakatata ki a ia. Ko tāna i whiriwhiri ai, ko ia tāna e mea ai kia whakatata ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 16:6" />Ko tēnei tā koutou e mea ai: Tīkina ētahi tahu kakara mā koutou, e Koraha rātou ko tāna hui katoa; <verse eid="NUM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 16:7" />ka makā hoki he ahi ki roto, ka mea ai i te whakakakara ki runga, ki te aroaro o Ihowā āpōpō, ā, ko te tangata e whiriwhiri ai a Ihowā, ko ia te mea tapu; kāti tā koutou, e ngā tama a Rīwai.”<verse eid="NUM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 16:8" />I mea anō a Mohi ki a Koraha, “Nā, whakarongo mai, e ngā tama a Rīwai! <verse eid="NUM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 16:9" />He mea iti ianei ki tā koutou kia wehea koutou e te Atua o Īharaira i roto i te huihui o Īharaira, kia meinga kia whakatata ki a ia, kia mahi i te mahi o te tapenākara o Ihowā, kia tū hoki ki te aroaro o te hui, hei minita mā rātou? <verse eid="NUM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 16:10" />Kua meinga anō koe e ia kia tata, koutou tahi ko ōu tēina katoa, ko ngā tama a Rīwai; nā, me whai anō hoki e koutou te tohungatanga? <verse eid="NUM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 16:11" />Koia koutou ko tāu hui katoa ka huihui nei ki a Ihowā; ko Ārona hoki, he aha ia, i amuamu ai koutou ki a ia?”<verse eid="NUM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 16:12" />Nā, ka tono tāngata a Mohi hei karanga i a Ratana rāua ko Āpirama, i ngā tama a Eriapa; ā, ka mea rāua, “E kore māua e haere atu. <verse eid="NUM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 16:13" />He mea iti ianei tāu kawe mai i a mātou i te whenua e rerengia ana e te waiū, e te honi, kia mate ai mātou ki te koraha, ā, ka mea rawa hoki koe i a koe hei rangatira ki runga i a mātou? <verse eid="NUM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 16:14" />Kāhore anō hoki koe i kawe i a mātou ki te whenua e rerengia ana e te waiū, e te honi, i hōmai rānei i ngā māra, i ngā kāri, hei kāinga. Ka pokaia rānei e koe ngā kanohi o ngā tāngata nei? E kore mātou e haere atu!”<verse eid="NUM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 16:15" />Nā, ko te tino riringa o Mohi, ka mea ki a Ihowā, “Kaua e tahuri ki tā rātou whakahere. Kāhore anō kia kotahi te kāihe i tangohia e ahau i a rātou, kāhore anō ahau i kino noa ki tētahi o rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 16:16" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a Koraha, “Puta mai koutou ko tāu hui katoa ki te aroaro o Ihowā āpōpō, a koe, me rātou ko Ārona, āpōpō. <verse eid="NUM 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 16:17" />Ā, me mau e tēnei, e tēnei o koutou tāna tahu kakara, ka mea he whakakakara ki runga, ka kawe ai tēnā i tāna tahu kakara, i tāna ki te aroaro o Ihowā, kia rua rau kia rima tekau ngā tahu kakara; ā, koe me tāu tahu kakara, a Ārona hoki me tāna.”<verse eid="NUM 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 16:18" />Nā, ka mau rātou ki tāna tahu kakara, ki tāna tahu kakara, ā, hoatu ana he ahi ki roto, meatia ana hoki he whakakakara ki runga, ā, ka tū tahi me Mohi rāua ko Ārona ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 16:19" />Nā, ka tāwhiua e Koraha te whakaminenga katoa ki a rāua ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga; ā, ka puta mai te korōria o Ihowā ki te whakaminenga katoa. <verse eid="NUM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 16:20" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 16:21" />“Wehea atu kōrua i roto i tēnei whakaminenga, e kore hoki e aha ka pau rātou i ahau.”<verse eid="NUM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 16:22" />Nā, ka tāpapa rāua, ka mea, “E te Atua, e te Atua o ngā wairua o ngā kikokiko katoa, kia hara rānei te tangata kotahi, ā, ka riri koe ki te whakaminenga katoa?”<verse eid="NUM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 16:23" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 16:24" />“Kōrero ki te whakaminenga, mea atu: ‘Whakatika i te tapenākara o Koraha, o Ratana, o Āpirama.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 16:25" />Nā, ka whakatika a Mohi, ka haere ki a Ratana rāua ko Āpirama; me te whai tahi anō ngā kaumātua o Īharaira i a ia. <verse eid="NUM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 16:26" />Nā, ka kōrero ia ki te whakaminenga, ka mea, “Tēnā, mawehe mai i ngā tēneti o ēnei tāngata kikino, kaua hoki e pā ki tētahi mea a rātou, kei ngaro koutou i roto i ō rātou hara katoa.” <verse eid="NUM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 16:27" />Nā, ka whakatika rātou i ngā taha katoa o te tapenākara o Koraha, o Ratana, o Āpirama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 16:27">Ā, ka puta a Ratana rāua ko Āpirama, ka tū ki ngā whatitoka o ō rāua tēneti, rātou ko ā rātou wāhine, ko ā rātou tama, ko ā rātou kōhungahunga hoki.<verse eid="NUM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 16:28" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi, “Mā tēnei e mōhio ai koutou nā Ihowā ahau i unga mai ki te mahi i ēnei mahi katoa; ā, ehara i te mea whakaaro noa ake nāku. <verse eid="NUM 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 16:29" />Ki te mea ko te mate o ngā tāngata katoa te mate mō ēnei, ko te whiu rānei o ngā tāngata katoa te whiu mō rātou, kāhore ahau i ungā mai e Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 16:30" />Tēnā ko tēnei, ka pokaia houtia e Ihowā he mahi hou, ā, ka hāmama te waha o te oneone, ā, ka horomia rātou me ā rātou mea katoa, ā, ka heke ora rātou ki te rua; kātahi koutou ka mōhio i whakahāwea ēnei tāngata ki a Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 16:31" />Ā mutu kau tāna kōrero i ēnei kōrero katoa, ko te tino kowheratanga o te oneone i raro i a rātou; <verse eid="NUM 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 16:32" />nā, hāmama ana te waha o te whenua, horomia ake hoki rātou me ō rātou whare, me ngā tāngata katoa o Koraha, me ō rātou rawa katoa. <verse eid="NUM 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 16:33" />Ā, heke ora ana rātou me ā rātou mea katoa ki te rua, nā, ka taupokina iho rātou e te whenua; ā, ngaro iho rātou i roto i te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 16:34" />Nā, rere ana a Īharaira katoa i ngā taha katoa o rātou i tō rātou auē; i mea hoki, “Kei horomia hoki tātou e te whenua.”<verse eid="NUM 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 16:35" />Nā, ka puta mai he ahi i a Ihowā, ā, pau ake ngā tāngata e rua rau e rima tekau i whakahere nei i te whakakakara.<verse eid="NUM 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 16:36" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 16:37" />“Mea atu ki a Ereātara tama a te tohunga, a Ārona, kia tangohia ake e ia ngā tahu kakara i roto i te tahunga, ā, rukerukea atu hoki e koe te ahi ki kō; he tapu hoki ēnā; <verse eid="NUM 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 16:38" />ko ngā tahu kakara anō a taua hunga i hara rā ki ō rātou wairua, me hangā hei papa pāraharaha, hei kōpaki mō te āta. I tāpaea hoki ki te aroaro o Ihowā, koia i tapu ai; ā, ka waiho hei tohu ki ngā tama a Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 16:39" />Nā, tīkina atu ana e te tohunga, e Ereātara, ngā tahu kakara parāhi i tāpaea e te hunga i tahuna rā, ā, ka hangā hei papa pāraharaha, hei kōpaki mō te āta. <verse eid="NUM 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 16:40" />Hei whakamahara mō ngā tama a Īharaira, kei whakatata he tangata kē, ehara nei i te uri nō Ārona, ki te tahu whakakakara ki te aroaro o Ihowā. Kei rite ki a Koraha rātou ko tāna hui; ko tā Ihowā tēnei i kōrerotia e Mohi ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 16:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 16:41" />Otiia, i te aonga ake ka amuamu te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, ka mea, “Nā kōrua i mate ai te iwi a Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 16:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 16:42" />Ā, i te huihuinga o te whakaminenga katoa ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i tō rātou tahuritanga ake ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, e! Kua taupokina e te kapua, ā, ka kitea te korōria o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 16:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 16:43" />Nā, ka haere a Mohi rāua ko Ārona ki mua i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 16:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 16:44" />Ā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 16:45" />“Whakatika atu kōrua i roto i tēnei whakaminenga, e kore e aha ka pau rātou i ahau.” Nā, ka tāpapa iho rāua.<verse eid="NUM 16:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 16:46" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a Ārona, “E mau ki te tahu kakara, meatia iho hoki he ahi i te āta, ka hoatu ai i te whakakakara ki runga, ā, kia hohoro te haere ki te whakaminenga, te whakamārie mō rātou; kua puta he riri i te aroaro o Ihowā; kua tīmata te whiu.”<verse eid="NUM 16:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 16:47" />Nā, tīkina ana e Ārona, pērātia ana me tā Mohi i kī ai, ā, rere ana ia ki waenganui o te whakaminenga; nā, kua tīmata tēnā te whiu i roto i te iwi. Nā, ka makā iho e ia he whakakakara, ā, ka whakamārie mō te iwi. <verse eid="NUM 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 16:48" />Nā, tū ana ia i waenganui o te hunga mate, o te hunga ora; ā, ka mutu te whiu. <verse eid="NUM 16:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 16:49" />Nā, ko ngā tāngata i mate i te whiu, kotahi tekau mā whā mano e whitu rau, hāunga ērā i mate i tō Koraha rā. <verse eid="NUM 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 16:50" />Nā, hoki ana a Ārona ki a Mohi, ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ā mutu iho te whiu.<verse eid="NUM 16:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="NUM 17" />
  <para style="s">Kua Pihi te Tokotoko a Ārona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 17:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 17:2" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, tangohia mai anō he tokotoko i tēnei, i tēnei, o rātou, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, i ngā ariki katoa o ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, kia kotahi tekau mā rua ngā tokotoko. Me tuhituhi te ingoa o tēnei, o tēnei, ki tāna tokotoko. <verse eid="NUM 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 17:3" />Me tuhituhi anō hoki te ingoa o Ārona ki te tokotoko a Rīwai. Ā, kia kotahi te tokotoko mā ia upoko o te whare o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="NUM 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 17:4" />Ā, me whakatakoto e koe ki roto ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga ki mua o te whakaaturanga, ki te wāhi e tūtaki ai ahau ki a koutou. <verse eid="NUM 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 17:5" />Nā, ko te tangata e whiriwhiri ai ahau, ka pihi tāna tokotoko, ā, ka pēhia atu e ahau te amuamu a ngā tama a Īharaira, e amuamu nei ki a kōrua.”<verse eid="NUM 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 17:6" />Nā, ka kōrero a Mohi ki ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, hōmai ana e ō rātou ariki katoa ki a ia, he tokotoko e tēnei ariki, he tokotoko e tēnei ariki, e ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, kotahi tekau mā rua ngā tokotoko; i roto anō i ā rātou tokotoko te tokotoko a Ārona. <verse eid="NUM 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 17:7" />Ā, whakatakotoria ana ngā tokotoko e Mohi ki te aroaro o Ihowā ki te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga.<verse eid="NUM 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 17:8" />Ā, i te aonga ake, nā, ka haere a Mohi ki te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga, e! Kua pihi te tokotoko a Ārona, tā te whare o Rīwai, kua wana, kua rāpupuku, kua kohera hoki he puāwai, kua hua he aramona. <verse eid="NUM 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 17:9" />Nā, kawea ana e Mohi ngā tokotoko katoa i te aroaro o Ihowā ki ngā tama katoa a Īharaira; ā, tirohia iho ana e rātou, tangohia ana hoki e rātou tāna tokotoko, tāna tokotoko.<verse eid="NUM 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 17:10" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Whakahokia mai te tokotoko a Ārona ki mua i te Whakaaturanga, kia tiakina, hei tohu ki te hunga tutū; ā, ka kore i a koe ā rātou amuamu e rongo nei ahau, kei mate rātou.” <verse eid="NUM 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 17:11" />Ā, pērātia ana e Mohi, rite tonu ki tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a ia tāna i mea ai.<verse eid="NUM 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 17:12" />Nā, ka mea ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Mohi, “Nanā, ka mate mātou, ka ngaro mātou, ngaro katoa. <verse eid="NUM 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 17:13" />Ko te tangata e whakatata ana ki te tapenākara o Ihowā, ka mate. Kia poto rānei mātou katoa ki te mate?”<verse eid="NUM 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="NUM 18" />
  <para style="s">Te Mahi a ngā Tohunga rātou ko ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 18:1" />I mea anō a Ihowā ki a Ārona, “Māu, mā āu tama, mā koutou ko te whare o tōu pāpā e waha te kino o te wāhi tapu; ā, mā koutou ko āu tama e waha te kino o tā koutou mahi tohunga. <verse eid="NUM 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 18:2" />Ā, ko ōu tēina hoki, o te iwi o Rīwai, o te iwi o tōu pāpā, me whakatata tahi me koe, kia tāpiritia ai rātou ki a koe, hei minita ki a koe; ko koutou tahi ia ko āu tama hei te tapenākara o te whakaaturanga. <verse eid="NUM 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 18:3" />Ā, mā rātou tāu mahi e tiaki, me te mahi tiaki o te tapenākara katoa. Otiia, kaua e whakatata ki ngā oko o te wāhi tapu, ki te āta rānei, kei mate ko rātou, ko koutou rānei. <verse eid="NUM 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 18:4" />Ā, ka tāpiritia rātou ki a koe, hei tiaki i ngā mea o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, mō ngā mahi katoa o te tapenākara; kaua hoki te tangata kē e tata ki a koutou.<verse eid="NUM 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 18:5" />“Mā koutou hoki e tiaki ngā mea o te wāhi tapu, me ngā mea o te āta; kei puta he riri ki ngā tama a Īharaira ā muri ake nei. <verse eid="NUM 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 18:6" />Me ahau hoki, nanā, kua tango ahau i ō koutou tēina, i ngā Rīwaiti i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira; he mea hoatu ki a koutou mā Ihowā, hei mahi i ngā mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 18:7" />Ko koutou ia ko āu tama, kia mau ki tā koutou mahi tohunga ki ngā mea katoa o te āta, o roto atu anō hoki i te ārai, hei mahi mā koutou. He mea hoatu noa atu tā koutou mahi tohunga e hoatu nei e ahau; ā, ka whakamatea te tangata kē e whakatata mai ana.”<verse eid="NUM 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Wāhi a ngā Tohunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 18:8" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Ārona: “Nā, kua tukua atu nei e ahau ki a koe te tiaki o āku whakahere hapahapai, o ngā mea tapu katoa a ngā tama a Īharaira; he mea hoatu nāku ki a koutou ko āu tama, he whakaaro hoki ki te whakawahinga, he tikanga pūmau. <verse eid="NUM 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 18:9" />Ko ngā mea tēnei māu o ngā mea tino tapu e kore nei e tukua ki te ahi; ko ā rātou whakahere katoa, ko ā rātou whakahere totokore katoa, me ā rātou whakahere hara katoa, me ā rātou whakahere katoa mō te hē, e tāpaea ki ahau; ka tino tapu mā koutou ko āu tama. <verse eid="NUM 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 18:10" />Hei te wāhi tino tapu kai ai, mā ngā tāne katoa e kai; he tapu tēnā māu.<verse eid="NUM 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 18:11" />“Māu anō tēnei: ko ngā whakahere hapahapai e hōmai ana e rātou me ngā whakahere poipoi katoa a ngā tama a Īharaira; kua hoatu aua mea e ahau ki a koe, ki a koutou ko āu tama, ko āu tamāhine, he tikanga pūmau; e kainga tēnā e ngā mea pokekore katoa o tōu whare.<verse eid="NUM 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 18:12" />“Ko ngā wāhi papai katoa o te hinu, me ngā wāhi papai katoa o te wāina, o te wīti hoki, ko ngā tūāpora o aua mea e hōmai ana ki a Ihowā, kua hoatu ēnā e ahau ki a koe. <verse eid="NUM 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 18:13" />Māu ngā hua mataati o ngā mea katoa o te whenua, e kawea mai ana ki a Ihowā; me kai e ngā mea pokekore katoa o tōu whare.<verse eid="NUM 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 18:14" />“Māu ngā mea katoa i oti rawa i roto i a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 18:15" />Ko ngā mea katoa e oroko puta mai ana i te kōpū o ngā kikokiko katoa, ko ngā mea hoki e whakaherea ana mā Ihowā, o te tangata, o te kararehe, māu ēnā. Otiia, me tino whakahoki atu e koe ki te utu ngā mātāmua a te tangata, me tango utu anō mō ngā mātāmua a te kararehe poke. <verse eid="NUM 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 18:16" />Ā, ko ngā mea e utua ana e whakahokia ana, ka kotahi marama o tōna whānautanga, me tango ōna utu; kia rite ki tāu e whakarite ai, kia rima hekere ngā moni; hei ngā hekere wāhi tapu, (e rua tekau nei ngā kera).<verse eid="NUM 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 18:17" />“Ko te mātāmua ia a te kau, me te mātāmua a te hipi, me te mātāmua a te koati, kaua e whakahokia atu e koe; he tapu ēnā. Me tāuhi e koe ō rātou toto ki te āta, me tahu anō ō rātou ngako hei whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 18:18" />Ā, māu ō rātou kikokiko, ka pērā me te uma poipoi, me te hūhā matau, nāu hoki ēnā. <verse eid="NUM 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 18:19" />Ko ngā whakahere hapahapai katoa o roto o ngā mea tapu e tāpaea ana e ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Ihowā, kua hoatu e ahau ki a koutou ko āu tama, ko āu tamāhine; hei tikanga pūmau. Hei kawenata tote i te aroaro o Ihowā ake ake, ki a koutou tahi ko ōu uri.”<verse eid="NUM 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 18:20" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Ārona, “Kāhore he kāinga tupu mōu i tō rātou whenua, kāhore anō hoki he wāhi mōu i roto i a rātou; ko ahau te wāhi mōu, tōu kāinga tupu i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 18:21" />“Kua hoatu nei hoki e ahau ki ngā tama a Rīwai ngā whakatekau katoa i roto i a Īharaira hei taonga tupu, hei utu mō tā rātou mahi e mahi ai rātou, mō te mahinga i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 18:22" />Kaua anō hoki ngā tama a Īharaira e whakatata ā muri ake nei ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, kei whai hara, kei mate. <verse eid="NUM 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 18:23" />Mā ngā Rīwaiti ia e mahi ngā mahi o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, me waha anō hoki e rātou tō rātou kino; hei tikanga pūmau ia mā ō koutou whakatupuranga, kia kāhore he kāinga tupu mō rātou i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 18:24" />Ko ngā whakatekau hoki a ngā tama a Īharaira, e tāpaea nei hei whakahere hapahapai ki a Ihowā, kua hoatu e ahau hei wāhi tupu ki ngā Rīwaiti. Koia ahau i mea ai ki a rātou, e kore rātou e whai kāinga tupu i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 18:25" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 18:26" />“Kōrero anō ki ngā Rīwaiti, mea atu ki a rātou: ‘Ka tangohia e koutou ngā whakatekau a ngā tama a Īharaira e hoatu nei e ahau ki a koutou i roto i ā rātou mea hei wāhi tupu mō koutou, me tāpae he whakahere hapahapai ki a Ihowā i roto i taua mea, he wāhi whakatekau o aua whakatekau. <verse eid="NUM 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 18:27" />Ā, ka kīia tēnei whakahere hapahapai he mea nā koutou, he pērā me te wīti o te patunga wīti, me te pūrenatanga hoki o te poka wāina. <verse eid="NUM 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 18:28" />Nā, me tāpae anō hoki e koutou he whakahere hapahapai ki a Ihowā i roto i ā koutou whakatekau katoa e tangohia ana e koutou i ngā tama a Īharaira; me hōmai te whakahere hapahapai a Ihowā i roto i taua mea ki te tohunga, ki a Ārona. <verse eid="NUM 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 18:29" />Me tāpae ngā whakahere hapahapai katoa mā Ihowā i roto i ngā mea katoa e hōmai ana ki a koutou, i roto i ngā mea papai katoa o ēnā, arā te wāhi tapu o roto.’<verse eid="NUM 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 18:30" />“Me kī atu ki a rātou: ‘Ka hapahapai koutou i te wāhi tino pai o taua mea, me kī tēnā he mea nā ngā Rīwaiti, he pērā me te hua o te patunga wīti, me te pūrenatanga hoki o te poka wāina. <verse eid="NUM 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 18:31" />Ā, me kai tēnā e koutou ko ō koutou whare ki ngā wāhi katoa; ko tō koutou utu hoki ia mō tā koutou mahi i te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 18:32" />Ā, e kore e waha e koutou he hara i reira, ina hapahapainga tōna wāhi pai; kaua anō e whakapokea ngā mea tapu a ngā tama a Īharaira, kei mate koutou.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="NUM 19" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Pungarehu o te Kūao Kau Uha Whero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 19:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 19:2" />“Ko te tikanga tēnei o te ture i whakahaua e Ihowā, i mea ia: Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira kia tīkina he kūao kau uha, he mea whero māu, hei te mea kāhore he nawe, kāhore he koha, ā, kāhore anō hoki i utaina ki te ioka. <verse eid="NUM 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 19:3" />Me hoatu e koutou ki a Ereātara, tohunga, māna ia e kawe ki waho o te puni, me patu hoki e tētahi ki tōna aroaro. <verse eid="NUM 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 19:4" />Nā, ka tango a Ereātara, tohunga, i tētahi wāhi o ōna toto ki tōna maihao, kia whitu ana tāuhiuhinga i ōna toto ki te roro tonu o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 19:5" />Nā, mā tētahi e tahu te kau i tāna tirohanga atu; ko tōna hiako, me ōna kiko, me ōna toto, me tahu tahi me tōna paru. <verse eid="NUM 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 19:6" />Nā, ka mau te tohunga ki te rākau hīta, ki te hihopa, ki te mea ngangana, ā, ka makā e ia ki waenganui o te tahunga o te kau. <verse eid="NUM 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 19:7" />Kātahi ka horoi te tohunga i ōna kākahu, ka horoi anō hoki i tōna kiri ki te wai, ā muri iho ka haere ki te puni, ka poke hoki te tohunga ā ahiahi noa. <verse eid="NUM 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 19:8" />Me te kaitahu anō, me horoi ōna kākahu ki te wai, me horoi anō tōna kiri ki te wai, ka poke hoki ia ā ahiahi noa.<verse eid="NUM 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 19:9" />“Ā, me āmene ngā pungarehu o te kau e tētahi tangata pokekore, ā, ka waiho i waho o te puni, i te wāhi pokekore, ka tiaki ai mō te whakaminenga o ngā tama a Īharaira hei wai wehenga; hei horohoro tēnā mō te hara. <verse eid="NUM 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 19:10" />Me horoi anō hoki ōna kākahu e te kaiāmene i ngā pungarehu o te kau, ka poke hoki ia ā ahiahi noa. Me waiho anō tēnā hei tikanga tūturu mā ngā tama a Īharaira, mā te manene hoki e noho manene ana i roto i a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hei Pure i te Poke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 19:11" />“Ki te pā tētahi ki te tinana mate o tētahi tangata, ka poke ia, e whitu ngā rā. <verse eid="NUM 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 19:12" />Me pure ia e ia ki taua wai i te toru o ngā rā, ā, i te whitu o ngā rā ka kore ōna poke. Otiia ki te kore ia e pure i a ia i te toru o ngā rā, e kore ia e pokekore i te whitu o ngā rā. <verse eid="NUM 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 19:13" />Ki te pā tētahi ki te tinana mate o tētahi tangata kua mate, ā, kāhore e pure i a ia, e whakapokea ana e ia te tapenākara o Ihowā. Ka hātepea taua wairua i roto i a Īharaira; nō te mea kīhai i tāuhiuhia ki a ia te wai wehenga, ka poke anō ia; e mau ana anō ki a ia tōna poke.<verse eid="NUM 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 19:14" />“Ko te ture tēnei ina mate te tangata i roto i te tēneti. Ko ngā tāngata katoa e tomo ana ki te tēneti, me ngā tāngata katoa i roto i te tēneti, ka poke kia whitu ngā rā. <verse eid="NUM 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 19:15" />Ko ngā oko katoa anō e puare kau ana, kāhore nei i herea te taupoki, ka poke.<verse eid="NUM 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 19:16" />“Ki te pā hoki tētahi ki te tangata i patua ki te hoari ki waenga pārae, ki te tūpāpaku rānei, ki te wheua tangata rānei, ki te urupā rānei, ka poke ia kia whitu ngā rā.<verse eid="NUM 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 19:17" />“Nā, mō te tangata poke, me tiki e rātou ētahi o ngā pungarehu o te kau i tahuna hei horohoronga mō ngā hara, ka riringi ai ki te wai ora, ki roto anō ki te oko. <verse eid="NUM 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 19:18" />Nā, ka mau tētahi tangata pokekore ki te hihopa, ka tuku ki te wai, nā, ka tāuhiuhi i te tēneti me ngā oko katoa, i ngā tāngata anō hoki o reira, me te tangata i pā atu nei ki te wheua ki te tangata rānei i patua, ki te tūpāpaku rānei, ki te urupā rānei. <verse eid="NUM 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 19:19" />Me tāuhiuhi anō hoki e te tangata pokekore te tangata poke i te toru o ngā rā, i te whitu hoki o ngā rā; ā, me pure ia e ia anō i te whitu o ngā rā ka horoi ai i ōna kākahu, ka horoi anō hoki i a ia ki te wai, ā, i te ahiahi ka kore te poke.<verse eid="NUM 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 19:20" />“Ā, ki te poke tētahi tangata, ā, kāhore e pure i a ia, ka hātepea atu taua wairua i roto i te huihui, mōna i whakapoke i te wāhi tapu o Ihowā. Kīhai te wai o te wehenga i tāuhiuhia ki a ia; he poke. <verse eid="NUM 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 19:21" />Ā, hei tikanga tūturu tēnei mā rātou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 19:21">“Me horoi ōna kākahu e te kaitāuhiuhi o te wai wehenga; ka poke anō ā ahiahi noa te tangata e pā ana ki te wai wehenga. <verse eid="NUM 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 19:22" />Ka poke anō ngā mea katoa e pā ai te tangata poke; ka poke anō ā ahiahi noa te wairua e pā ana.”<verse eid="NUM 19:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="NUM 20" />
  <para style="s">He Wai i roto i he Kāmaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 17:1-7">Ekoruhe 17.1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 20:1" />Nā, ka tae ngā tama a Īharaira, arā te whakaminenga katoa, ki te koraha o Hini i te marama tuatahi; ā, ka noho te iwi ki Karehe. Nā, ka mate a Miriama ki reira, ā, tanumia ana ki reira.<verse eid="NUM 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 20:2" />Ā, kāhore he wai mō te whakaminenga; ā, ka huihui ki te ngangare ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona. <verse eid="NUM 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 20:3" />Nā, ka ngangau te iwi ki a Mohi, ka kōrero, ka mea, “Auē, me i mate mātou i te matenga o ō mātou tuākana i te aroaro o Ihowā! <verse eid="NUM 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 20:4" />He aha hoki i kawea mai ai e kōrua te whakaminenga a Ihowā ki tēnei koraha, kia mate tahi mātou me ā mātou kararehe ki konei? <verse eid="NUM 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 20:5" />He aha hoki mātou i meinga ai e kōrua kia haere mai i Īhipa, kia kawea mai mātou ki tēnei wāhi kino? Ehara nei i te wāhi purapura, i te wāhi piki, wāina, pamekaranete; kāhore anō hoki he wai hei inu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 20:6" />Nā, ka haere a Mohi rāua ko Ārona i te aroaro o te whakaminenga ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ā, ka kūpapa iho ō rāua mata. Nā, ko te putanga mai o te korōria o Ihowā ki a rāua. <verse eid="NUM 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 20:7" />Ā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 20:8" />“Maua atu te tokotoko, huihuia mai anō te whakaminenga e kōrua ko tōu tuakana, ko Ārona, ka kōrero ai kōrua ki te kāmaka i mua i ō rātou kanohi, kia tukua mai tōna wai; ā, ka whakaputaina mai e koe he wai mō rātou i roto i te kāmaka; ā, ka meinga e koe te whakaminenga me ā rātou kararehe kia inu.”<verse eid="NUM 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 20:9" />Nā, ka maua e Mohi te tokotoko i te aroaro o Ihowā, pērā ana ia me tāna i whakahau ai. <verse eid="NUM 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 20:10" />I huihuia hoki te whakaminenga e Mohi rāua ko Ārona ki mua o te kāmaka, ā, ka mea ia ki a rātou, “Whakarongo mai, e te hunga tutū; me whakaputa mai rānei e maua he wai mō koutou i roto i tēnei kāmaka?” <verse eid="NUM 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 20:11" />Nā, ka ara te ringa o Mohi, ā, e rua āna patunga i te kāmaka ki tāna tokotoko; ko te tino putanga mai o te wai, tōna nui, ā, inu ana te iwi me ā rātou kararehe.<verse eid="NUM 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 20:12" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona, “Kāhore nei kōrua i whakapono ki ahau, kia whakatapu i ahau i te tirohanga a ngā tama a Īharaira, mō reira e kore kōrua e kawe i tēnei whakaminenga ki te whenua e hoatu nei e ahau ki a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 20:13" />Ko te wai tēnā o Meripa; i ngangau hoki ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Ihowā ki reira, ā, meinga ana rātou hei whakatapu mōna.<verse eid="NUM 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Whakakāhoretia te Haerenga i a Eroma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 20:14" />Nā, ka unga tāngata a Mohi i Karehe ki te kīngi o Ēroma:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="NUM 20:14">“Ko te kupu tēnei a tōu teina, a Īharaira: E mōhio ana koe ki ngā hē katoa i pono mai ki a mātou: <verse eid="NUM 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 20:15" />ki te hekenga o ō mātou mātua ki Īhipa, ki tō mātou nohoanga hoki i Īhipa, ā, maha noa ngā rā; ā, ka tūkino ngā Īhipiana i a mātou ko ō mātou mātua; <verse eid="NUM 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 20:16" />ā, i tā mātou karangatanga atu ki a Ihowā, nā, ka rongo ia ki tō mātou reo, ā, ungā ana e ia he anahera hei whakaputa mai i a mātou i Īhipa.</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="NUM 20:16">“Nā, kei Karehe tēnei mātou, kei te pā whakamutunga o tōu rohe. <verse eid="NUM 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 20:17" />Tēnā, tukua atu mātou mā tōu whenua; e kore mātou e haere nā ngā māra, nā ngā māra wāina rānei, e kore anō mātou e inu i te wai o ngā puna. Ka haere mātou i te huanui o te kīngi, e kore mātou, e peka ki matau, ki mauī, kia pahemo rā anō i a mātou ōu rohe.”<verse eid="NUM 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 20:18" />Nā, ka mea a Ēroma ki a ia, “E kore koe e tika nā tōku wāhi, kei haere ahau me te hoari ki te tū i a koe.”<verse eid="NUM 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 20:19" />Nā, ka mea ngā tama a Īharaira ki a ia, “Ka haere mātou nā te huanui; ā, ki te inu ahau me āku kāhui i tōu wai, me utu e ahau. Heoi rawa tāku e mea ai, ko te haere kau o ōku waewae nā konā.”<verse eid="NUM 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 20:20" />Nā, ka mea ia, “E kore koe e haere rā konei.” Ā, ka puta a Ēroma me te ope nui, me te ringa kaha, ki te tū i a ia. <verse eid="NUM 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 20:21" />Heoi, kīhai a Ēroma i pai ki te tuku i a Īharaira kia haere nā tōna rohe; nā, peka kē ana a Īharaira i a ia.<verse eid="NUM 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Mate a Ārona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 20:22" />Nā, ka tūria atu e rātou i Karehe; ā, ka tae ngā tama a Īharaira, arā te whakaminenga katoa ki Maunga Horo. <verse eid="NUM 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 20:23" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona i Maunga Horo, i te rohe o te whenua o Ēroma, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 20:24" />“Ka kohia atu a Ārona ki tōna iwi; e kore hoki ia e tae ki te whenua ka hoatu nei e ahau ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mō kōrua i whakatoi ki tāku kupu i te wai o Meripa. <verse eid="NUM 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 20:25" />Tangohia a Ārona rāua ko Ereātara, ko tāna tama, kawea hoki rāua ki runga ki Maunga Horo. <verse eid="NUM 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 20:26" />Unuhia hoki ngā kākahu o Ārona, ka whakakākahu ai ki tāna tama, ki a Ereātara; ā, ka kohia atu a Ārona ki tōna iwi, ka mate hoki ki reira.”<verse eid="NUM 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 20:27" />Nā, ka pērā a Mohi me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai, ā, haere ana rātou ki runga ki Maunga Horo i te tirohanga a te whakaminenga katoa. <verse eid="NUM 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 20:28" />Nā, ka unuhia e Mohi ngā kākahu o Ārona, ā, whakakākahuria ana e ia ki tāna tama, ki a Ereātara; ā, ka mate a Ārona ki reira, ki te tihi o te maunga. Ā, ka heke iho a Mohi rāua ko Ereātara i runga i te maunga. <verse eid="NUM 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 20:29" />Ā, nō te kitenga o te whakaminenga katoa kua mate a Ārona, e toru tekau ngā rā i tangihia ai a Ārona e rātou, e te whare katoa o Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="NUM 21" />
  <para style="s">Te Nākahi Parāhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 21:1" />Ā, ka rongo a Kīngi Arara, te Kanaani, i noho nei ki te taha ki te tonga, e haere ana a Īharaira nā te ara o Atarimi; nā, ka tatau ia ki a Īharaira, ā, whakaraua ana ētahi o rātou e ia. <verse eid="NUM 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 21:2" />Nā, ka puta te kī taurangi a Īharaira ki a Ihowā, ka mea, “Ki te tukua mai e koe tēnei iwi ki tōku ringa ka tino whakangaromia e ahau ō rātou pā.” <verse eid="NUM 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 21:3" />Ā, i whakarongo a Ihowā ki te reo o Īharaira, ā, hōmai ana e ia ngā Kanaani; ā, tino whakangaromia ana rātou me ō rātou pā e rātou; ā, huaina iho te ingoa o taua wāhi ko Horema.<verse eid="NUM 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 21:4" />Nā, ka tūria atu e rātou i Maunga Horo nā te ara o te Moana Whero ki te taiāwhio i te whenua o Ēroma; ā pōuri noa iho te wairua o te iwi i te ara. <verse eid="NUM 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 21:5" />Ā, ka whakahē te iwi i te Atua, i a Mohi hoki, “He aha i kawea mai ai mātou ki runga nei i Īhipa kia mate ki te koraha? Kāhore nei hoki he taro, kāhore he wai; ā, e whakarihariha ana tō mātou wairua ki tēnei taro māmā.”<verse eid="NUM 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 21:6" />Nā, ka tukua mai e Ihowā he nākahi tū ā-ahi ki te iwi, ā, ka ngaua te iwi; ā, he tokomaha o Īharaira i mate. <verse eid="NUM 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 21:7" />Nā, ka haere te iwi ki a Mohi, ka mea, “Kua hara mātou i a mātou i whakahē i a Ihowā, i a koe hoki; īnoi ki a Ihowā kia tangohia atu e ia ngā nākahi i a mātou.” Nā, ka īnoi a Mohi mō te iwi.<verse eid="NUM 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 21:8" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Hangā tētahi nākahi tū ā-ahi māu, ka whakanoho ki te pou; nā, mehemea kua ngaua tētahi, ā, ka titiro atu ia ki reira, ka ora.” <verse eid="NUM 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 21:9" />Nā, hangā ana e Mohi te nākahi ki te parāhi, ā, whakanohoia ana ki te pou; nā, mehemea kua ngaua tētahi e te nākahi, ka titiro ia ki te nākahi parāhi, kua ora.<verse eid="NUM 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Haerenga ki Moapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 21:10" />Nā, ka tūria atu e ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, noho ana i Opoto. <verse eid="NUM 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 21:11" />Ā, ka tūria atu i Opoto, ā, noho ana i Iteaparimi, i te koraha i te ritenga atu o Moapa, whaka te rāwhiti. <verse eid="NUM 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 21:12" />Ā, ka haere atu rātou i reira, ā, noho ana i te raorao i Terete. <verse eid="NUM 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 21:13" />Nā, ka tūria atu i reira, ā, noho ana i tērā taha o Aranona, o tērā i te koraha e puta mai ana i ngā wāhi o ngā Amori; ko Aranona hoki te rohe ki a Moapa, kei waenganui o Moapa, o ngā Amori. <verse eid="NUM 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 21:14" />Koia i kōrerotia ai i te Pukapuka o ngā Whawhai a Ihowā,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:14">“Ko tāna i mea ai ki te Moana Whero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:14">ki ngā awa hoki o Aranona,<verse eid="NUM 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 21:15" />ki ngā hurihanga wai anō hoki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:15">e anga ana ki te nohoanga i Ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:15">e piri nei ki te rohe o Moapa.”<verse eid="NUM 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 21:16" />Ā, i haere atu rātou i reira ki Pēre; ko te puna ia i kōrero ai a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Huihuia te iwi, ā, māku e hoatu he wai ki a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 21:17" />Nā, ka waiatatia tēnei waiata e Īharaira:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:17">“Pupuke ake, e te puna! Waiatatia!<verse eid="NUM 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 21:18" />Te puna i keria e ngā rangatira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">i keria e ngā ariki o te iwi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:18">ki te hēpeta, ā, ki ā rātou tokotoko.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="NUM 21:18">Nā, ka tūria atu e rātou i te koraha ki Matana, <verse eid="NUM 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 21:19" />i Matana hoki ki Nahariere; ā, i Nahariere ki Pamoto, <verse eid="NUM 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 21:20" />ā, i Pamoto ki te raorao i te whenua o Moapa, ki te tihi o Pihika, e titiro iho ana ki te koraha.<verse eid="NUM 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Patua iho o Kīngi Hihona rāua ko Kīngi Oka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 2:26-3:11">Tiuteronomi 2.26–3.11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 21:21" />Nā, ka unga tāngata a Īharaira ki a Hihona kīngi o ngā Amori, hei mea:<verse eid="NUM 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 21:22" />“Tukua atu ahau nā tōu whenua; e kore mātou e peka ki ngā māra, ki ngā māra wāina rānei; e kore mātou e inu i te wai o ngā puna. Ka haere mātou nā te huanui o te kīngi, kia pahemo rā anō ōu rohe i a mātou.”<verse eid="NUM 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 21:23" />Otiia kīhai a Hihona i tuku i a Īharaira kia tika nā tōna wāhi; nā, huihuia ana e Hihona tōna iwi katoa, ā, puta mai ana ki te tū i a Īharaira ki te koraha, nā, ka haere ia ki Iahata; ā, ka tatau ia i a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 21:24" />Ā, patua iho ia e Īharaira ki te mata o te hoari, tangohia ana e rātou tōna whenua, o Aranona atu ā tae noa ki Iapoko, ki ngā tama rā anō a Āmona; he rohe hoki e kore e taea tō ngā tama a Āmona. <verse eid="NUM 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 21:25" />Ā, riro ana i a Īharaira ēnei pā katoa; ā, nohoia ana e Īharaira ngā pā katoa o ngā Amori, a Hehepona, me ōna pā ririki. <verse eid="NUM 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 21:26" />He pā hoki a Hehepona nō Hihona kīngi o ngā Amori; i whawhai hoki ia ki tō mua kīngi o Moapa, ā, tangohia ana ia tōna whenua katoa i tōna ringa ā tae noa ki Aranona.<verse eid="NUM 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 21:27" />Koia te hunga kōrero whakatauki ka mea ai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:27">“Haere mai ki Hehepona, kia hangā;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:27">kia whakaūngia te pā o Hihona.<verse eid="NUM 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 21:28" />“Kua puta atu hoki he ahi i Hehepona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">he mura i te pā o Hihona.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:28">Ā, pau ake a Ara o Moapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:28">me ngā ariki o ngā wāhi tiketike o Aranona.<verse eid="NUM 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 21:29" />Auē te mate mōu, e Moapa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">Ka ngaro koe, e te iwi o Kemoho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 21:29">Kua hoatu e ia āna tama i rere mōrehu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">me āna tamāhine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">hei pononga mā Hihona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:29">mā te kīngi o ngā Amori.<verse eid="NUM 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 21:30" />“I kōpere atu mātou ki a rātou</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">kua ngaro a Hehepona, tae noa ki Ripono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 21:30">kua hunā e mātou tae noa ki Nopa e totoro atu nei ki Merepa.”<verse eid="NUM 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 21:31" />Nā, ka noho a Īharaira ki te whenua o ngā Amori.<verse eid="NUM 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 21:32" />Ā, ka tono tāngata a Mohi ki te tūtei i Iatere, ā, ka riro i a rātou ngā pā o reira, i panā hoki ngā Amori e noho ana i reira.<verse eid="NUM 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 21:33" />Nā, ka tahuri rātou, ā, ka haere ki runga nā te ara o Pahana; nā, ko te putanga mai o Oka kīngi o Pahana, ki te whakatūtaki i a rātou, a ia, me tōna iwi katoa ki te whawhai ki Eterei. <verse eid="NUM 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 21:34" />Ā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Kei wehi i a ia; kua hoatu hoki ia e ahau ki tōu ringa, me tōna iwi katoa, me tōna whenua; ā, ka rite tāu e mea ai ki a ia ki tāu i mea ai ki a Hihona kīngi o ngā Amori i noho rā i Hehepona.”<verse eid="NUM 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 21:35" />Nā, patua iho ia e rātou, me āna tama, me tōna iwi katoa, ā, kore noa e toe tētahi mōrehu ōna; ā, tangohia ana e rātou tōna whenua.<verse eid="NUM 21:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="NUM 22" />
  <para style="s">Ka Tono te Kīngi o Moapa ki a Paraama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 22:1" />Nā, ka tūria atu e ngā tama a Īharaira, ā, ka noho ki ngā mānia o Moapa, ki tēnei taha o Horano ki te ritenga atu o Heriko.<verse eid="NUM 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 22:2" />Ā, i kite a Pāraka tama a Tiporo i ngā mea katoa i mea ai a Īharaira ki ngā Amori. <verse eid="NUM 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 22:3" />Nā, nui atu te wehi o Moapa ki te iwi, nō te mea he tokomaha; ā, tuatea noa iho a Moapa i ngā tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 22:4" />Nā, ka mea a Moapa ki ngā kaumātua o Miriana, “Ākuanei tēnei hui horomiti ai i ngā tāngata katoa i ngā taha katoa o tātou, pērā ai me te kau e horomiti nei i te tarutaru o te māra.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:4">Ā, ko Pāraka tama a Tiporo te kīngi o Moapa i taua wā. <verse eid="NUM 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 22:5" />Nā, ka tukua e ia he karere ki a Paraama tama a Peoro ki Petoro, i te taha o te awa, ki te whenua o ngā tama o tōna iwi, ki te tiki i a ia, hei mea:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="NUM 22:5">“He iwi tēnei kua puta mai i Īhipa, nā, kapi ana i a rātou te mata o te whenua; e noho nei anō rātou i tōku aroaro. <verse eid="NUM 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 22:6" />Nā, tēnā, haere mai hei kaikanga māku i te iwi nei; he kaha kē hoki rātou i ahau; tērā pea ka toa ahau, ka patua rātou e mātou, ā, ka peia atu rātou i te whenua; e mōhio ana hoki ahau ko tāu e manaaki ai ka manaakitia, ko tāu hoki e kanga ai ka kangā.”<verse eid="NUM 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 22:7" />Ā, ka haere ngā kaumātua o Moapa rātou ko ngā kaumātua o Miriana me ngā utu mākutu i ō rātou ringa; ā, ka tae ki a Paraama, ā, kōrerotia ana e rātou ngā kupu a Pāraka.<verse eid="NUM 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 22:8" />Nā, ka mea ia ki a rātou, “E noho ki konei i tēnei pō, ā, māku e whakahoki he kōrero ki a koutou, ko tā Ihowā hoki e kōrero ai ki ahau.” Nā, ka noho ngā rangatira o Moapa ki a Paraama.<verse eid="NUM 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 22:9" />Nā, ka haere te Atua ki a Paraama, ka mea, “Ko wai ēnā tāngata i a koe nā?”<verse eid="NUM 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 22:10" />Ā, ka mea a Paraama ki te Atua, “Kua unga tāngata mai a Pāraka tama a Tiporo, kīngi o Moapa, ki ahau, hei kī mai: <verse eid="NUM 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 22:11" />‘He iwi tēnei kua puta mai i Īhipa, ā, kapi ana i a rātou te mata o te whenua; tēnā, haere mai hei kaikanga māku i a rātou; tērā pea e taea e ahau te whawhai ki a rātou, te pei hoki i a rātou.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 22:12" />Nā, ka mea te Atua ki a Paraama, “Kaua e haere i a rātou; kaua e kangā tēnā iwi; kua oti hoki rātou te manaaki.”<verse eid="NUM 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 22:13" />Nā, ka maranga a Paraama i te ata, ka mea ki ngā rangatira a Pāraka, “Haere ki tō koutou whenua; e kore hoki a Ihowā e pai ki te tuku i ahau kia haere i a koutou.”<verse eid="NUM 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 22:14" />Nā, ka whakatika ngā rangatira o Moapa, ka haere ki a Pāraka, ka mea, “Kīhai a Paraama i pai ki te haere tahi mai i a mātou.”<verse eid="NUM 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 22:15" />Nā, ka tonoa e Pāraka ētahi atu rangatira, he tokomaha atu, he nunui atu i ērā. <verse eid="NUM 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 22:16" />Ā, ka tae rātou ki a Paraama, ka mea ki a ia:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="NUM 22:16">“Ko te kupu tēnei a Pāraka tama a Tiporo: ‘Kei puritia atu koe e tētahi mea, haere mai ki ahau. <verse eid="NUM 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 22:17" />Ka whakanuia rawatia hoki koe e ahau, ka meatia anō e ahau ngā mea katoa e mea mai ai koe ki ahau; haere mai rā hei kaikanga māku i tēnei iwi.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 22:18" />Nā, ka utu Paraama, ka mea ki ngā tāngata a Pāraka, “Ahakoa i kī tōna whare i te hiriwa, i te kōura, e hōmai e Pāraka ki ahau, e kore e āhei i ahau te whakawhiti ki kō atu i te kupu a Ihowā, a tōku Atua, te mea i te mea iti iho, i te mea nui ake rānei. <verse eid="NUM 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 22:19" />Nā, e noho ki konei i tēnei pō, kia mōhio ahau ki tā Ihowā e mea mai ai anō ki ahau.”<verse eid="NUM 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 22:20" />Ā, i puta mai te Atua ki a Paraama i te pō, ā, ka mea ki a ia, “Ki te haere mai aua tāngata ki te karanga i a koe, whakatika, haere i a rātou; ko te kupu ia e kōrero ai ahau ki a koe, ko tēnā tāu e mea ai.” <verse eid="NUM 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 22:21" />Nā, ka maranga a Paraama i te ata, ā, whakanohoia ana e ia tana kāihe, ā, haere ana i ngā rangatira o Moapa.<verse eid="NUM 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko Paraama me tāna Kāihe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 22:22" />Nā, ka mura te riri o te Atua mōna i haere, ā, ka tū te anahera a Ihowā ki te ara hei hoariri mōna. Ā, i runga ia i tōna kāihe e noho ana, ko āna tāngata tokorua hoki ōna hoa. <verse eid="NUM 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 22:23" />Ā, ka kite te kāihe i te anahera a Ihowā e tū ana i te ara, me tāna hoari i tōna ringa, unu rawa, ka peka atu te kāihe i te ara, ā, ka haere ki te pārae. Nā, ka whiua e Paraama te kāihe kia anga ki te ara.<verse eid="NUM 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 22:24" />Kātahi ka tū te anahera a Ihowā ki tētahi huarahi whāwhārua o ngā māra wāina, he taiepa kei tēnei taha, he taiepa hoki kei tērā taha. <verse eid="NUM 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 22:25" />Ā, nō te kitenga o te kāihe i te anahera a Ihowā, ka whakapiri ki te taiepa, ā, karapitia ana te waewae o Paraama ki te taiepa; nō, ka whiua anō e ia.<verse eid="NUM 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 22:26" />Nā, ka neke anō te anahera a Ihowā, ā, ka tū ki te wāhi kūiti, kāhore nei he ara hei pekanga ki matau, ki mauī. <verse eid="NUM 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 22:27" />Ā, nō te kitenga o te kāihe i te anahera a Ihowā, ka takoto ki raro i a Paraama; ā, ka mura te riri o Paraama, ka patua e ia te kāihe ki tāna rākau. <verse eid="NUM 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 22:28" />Nā, ka whakahamumutia e Ihowā te waha o te kāihe, ā, ka kōrero ki a Paraama, “I aha ahau ki a koe, i toru ai ēnei patunga āu i ahau?”<verse eid="NUM 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 22:29" />Ā, ka mea a Paraama ki te kāihe, “Mō tāu māminga rā ki ahau. Me he hoari i tōku ringa, inā, kua whakamatea koe e ahau ināianei.”<verse eid="NUM 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 22:30" />Nā, ka mea ake te kāihe ki a Paraama, “Ehara ianei ahau i tāu kāihe, i ekengia nei e koe o tōku rironga mai rā anō i a koe, ā tae noa mai ki tēnei rā? He pēnei rānei tāku hanga ki a koe i mua?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 22:30">Ā, ka mea ia, “Kāhore.”<verse eid="NUM 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 22:31" />Kātahi ka whakatirohia e Ihowā ngā kanohi o Paraama, ā, ka kite ia i te anahera a Ihowā e tū ana i te ara, me tāna hoari i tōna ringa, unu rawa; nā, ka tuohu ia, ka piko iho tōna mata.<verse eid="NUM 22:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 22:32" />Nā, ka mea te anahera a Ihowā ki a ia, “Nā te aha ēnei patunga e toru āu i tāu kāihe? Nanā, i puta atu ahau hei hoariri mōu, nō te mea e peau kē ana tōu ara i tōku aroaro. <verse eid="NUM 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 22:33" />Ā, i kite te kāihe i ahau, ā, e toru ōna pekanga ki tahaki i tōku aroaro. Me i kāhore ia te peka atu ki tahaki i tōku aroaro, inā, kua patua tēnei koe e ahau, ā, ko ia kua whakaorangia.”<verse eid="NUM 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 22:34" />Nā, ka mea a Paraama ki te anahera a Ihowā, “Kua hara ahau; nōku kīhai i mōhio ko koe te tū mai ana i te ara ki te whakatūtaki i ahau; nā, ki te hē tēnei ki tāu titiro, me hoki ahau.”<verse eid="NUM 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 22:35" />Nā, ka mea te anahera a Ihowā ki a Paraama, “Haere i aua tāngata; ko te kupu ia e kōrero ai ahau ki a koe, ko tēnā anake tāu e kōrero ai.” Nā, ka haere a Paraama i ngā rangatira a Pāraka.<verse eid="NUM 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 22:36" />Ā, ka rongo a Pāraka e tae mai ana a Paraama, ka haere ia ki te whakatau i a ia ki tētahi pā o Moapa i te rohe o Aranona, i te rohe whakamutunga. <verse eid="NUM 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 22:37" />Ā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a Paraama, “Kāhore ianei ahau i āta unga ki a koe, ki te karanga i a koe? He aha koe tē haere mai ai ki ahau? He pono rānei e kore e āhei i ahau te whakanui i a koe?”<verse eid="NUM 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 22:38" />Nā, ka mea a Paraama ki a Pāraka, “Nā, kua tae mai nei ahau ki a koe. E taea rānei e ahau te kōrero tētahi mea, ahakoa iti? Ko te kupu e hōmai e te Atua ki tōku māngai, ko tēnā tāku e kōrero ai.”<verse eid="NUM 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 22:39" />Nā, ka haere a Paraama i a Pāraka, ā, ka tae rāua ki Kiriata Hutoto. <verse eid="NUM 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 22:40" />Nā, ka patua he kau, he hipi, e Pāraka, ā, ka unga tāngata ki a Paraama rātou ko ōna hoa, ko ngā rangatira.<verse eid="NUM 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 22:41" />Ā, i te ata ka mau a Pāraka ki a Paraama, ā, kawea ana e ia ki runga ki ngā wāhi teitei o Paara, ā, ka kite atu ia i reira i te hiku o te iwi.<verse eid="NUM 22:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="NUM 23" />
  <para style="s">Te Poropiti Tuatahi a Paraama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 23:1" />Nā, ka mea a Paraama ki a Pāraka, “Hangā ētahi āta māku kia whitu, kia rite mai hoki māku he pūru kia whitu, he hipi toa hoki kia whitu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 23:2" />Nā, rite tonu tā Pāraka i mea ai ki ngā mea i kōrerotia e Paraama; ā, whakaekea ana e Pāraka rāua ko Paraama he pūru, he hipi, ki tētahi āta, ki tētahi āta.<verse eid="NUM 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 23:3" />Nā, ka mea a Paraama ki a Pāraka, “E tū ki te taha o tāu tahunga tinana, ā, ka haere ahau; tērā pea a Ihowā e tūpono mai ki ahau. Ā, me kōrero atu e ahau ki a koe te kupu e whakakitea mai e ia ki ahau.” Nā, ka haere ia ki tētahi puke hamore.<verse eid="NUM 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 23:4" />Nā, ka tūpono a Ihowā ki a Paraama; ā, ka mea ia ki a ia, “Kua oti i ahau ngā āta e whitu, kua whakaekea anō hoki he pūru, he hipi, ki tēnei āta, ki tēnei āta.”<verse eid="NUM 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 23:5" />Nā, ka hōmai e Ihowā he kupu ki te waha o Paraama, ka mea, “Hoki atu ki a Pāraka, ā, kia pēnei tāu kī atu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 23:6" />Ā, ka hoki atu ia ki a ia, nā, i te taha ia o tāna tahunga tinana e tū ana, rātou ko ngā rangatira katoa o Moapa. <verse eid="NUM 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 23:7" />Nā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">“Nā, Pāraka kīngi o Moapa ahau i ārahi mai i Arame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">i ngā maunga o te rāwhiti, i mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:7">‘Haere mai hei kaikanga māku mō Hākopa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:7">haere mai hoki hei whakatara ki a Īharaira.’<verse eid="NUM 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 23:8" />Me aha e kanga ai ahau i tā te Atua i kore ai e kanga?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:8">Me aha hoki e whakatara ai ahau ki tā Ihowā kīhai i whakatara?<verse eid="NUM 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 23:9" />Tēnei hoki ahau kei te tihi o ngā kāmaka e titiro atu ana ki a ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">e kite atu ana i a ia i runga i ngā pukepuke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:9">Nanā, he iwi noho ko ia anake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:9">e kore anō hoki e tāua i roto i ngā tauiwi.<verse eid="NUM 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 23:10" />Mā wai e tatau te puehu o Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">e titiro rānei te maha o te whakawhā o Īharaira?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:10">Hei te mate o te hunga tika he matenga mōku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:10">kia rite hoki tōku whakamutunga ki tōna!”<verse eid="NUM 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 23:11" />Nā, ka mea a Pāraka, ki a Paraama, “He aha tāu e mea nei ki ahau? I tīkina atu koe e ahau hei kanga i ōku hoariri, nā, kua manaakitia rawatia rātou e koe.”<verse eid="NUM 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 23:12" />Nā, ka whakautua e ia, ka mea, “Kaua rānei ahau e mahara ki te whakapuaki i te kupu e hōmai e Ihowā ki tōku waha?”<verse eid="NUM 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Poropiti Tuarua a Paraama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 23:13" />Nā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a ia, “Tēnā, haere mai tāua ki tētahi wāhi kē atu, e kite ai koe i a rātou. Ko tō rātou pito tāu e kite ai; e kore hoki koe e kite i a rātou katoa; ā, hei reira puaki ai i a koe tāku kanga mō rātou.” <verse eid="NUM 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 23:14" />Nā, ka kawea ia e ia ki te māra o Topimi, ki te tihi o Pihika, ā, hangā ana e ia e whitu ngā āta, whakaekea atu ana hoki e ia he pūru, he hipi, ki tēnei āta, ki tēnei āta.<verse eid="NUM 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 23:15" />Nā, ka mea ia ki a Pāraka, “E tū ki konei ki te taha o tāu tahunga tinana, ka whakatau ahau ki kō, ki a Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 23:16" />Nā, ka tūpono a Ihowā ki a Paraama, ka hōmai e ia he kupu ki tōna waha, ka mea, “Hoki atu ki a Pāraka, kia pēnei hoki tāu kī atu.”<verse eid="NUM 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 23:17" />Ā, ka haere atu ia ki a ia, nā, e tū ana ia i te taha o tāna tahunga tinana, rātou ko ngā rangatira o Moapa. Ā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a ia, “I pēhea mai te kupu a Ihowā?”<verse eid="NUM 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 23:18" />Nā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:18">“Whakatika, e Pāraka, whakarongo mai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:18">kia whai taringa mai ki ahau, e te tama a Tiporo.<verse eid="NUM 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 23:19" />Ehara te Atua i te tangata e teka ai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">i te tama rānei a te tangata e puta kē ai ōna whakaaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:19">Tērā rānei ia e kōrero, ā, kore ake e mahi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:19">E puaki rānei tāna kupu, ā, kāhore e mana?<verse eid="NUM 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 23:20" />Nanā, kua riro mai i ahau te kupu manaaki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">kua oti hoki i a ia te kupu manaaki;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:20">ā, e kore e taea e ahau te whakaputa kē.<verse eid="NUM 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 23:21" />“Kāhore i tirohia e ia he kino i a Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">kāhore anō hoki i kitea he tutū i a Īharaira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:21">Kei a ia a Ihowā, tōna Atua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:21">kei roto hoki i a rātou te hāmama a te kīngi.<verse eid="NUM 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 23:22" />Nā, Ihowā rātou i whakaputa mai i Īhipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:22">kei tō te unikanga tōna kaha.<verse eid="NUM 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 23:23" />He pono kāhore he mākutu mō Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">kāhore anō hoki he whaiwhaiā mō Īharaira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:23">Hei tēnei wā anō ka kōrerotia a Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:23">āe rā, a Īharaira, ‘Anō te mahi a te Atua!’<verse eid="NUM 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 23:24" />Nanā, ka whakatika te iwi ānō he raiona kātua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">ka ara ake anō hoki ānō he raiona;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 23:24">e kore e takoto, kia kainga rā anō te tūpāpaku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 23:24">kia inumia hoki ngā toto o te parekura.”<verse eid="NUM 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 23:25" />Nā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a Paraama, “Kaua rawa e kanga i a rātou, kaua rawa rānei e manaaki i a rātou.”<verse eid="NUM 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 23:26" />Nā, ka whakautua e Paraama, ka mea ki a Pāraka, “Kāhore ianei ahau i kōrero ki a koe, i mea, ‘Ko ngā mea katoa e kōrero mai ai a Ihowā, ko tēnā tāku e mea ai’?”<verse eid="NUM 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 23:27" />Nā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a Paraama, “Tēnā, me kawe koe e ahau ki tētahi atu wāhi; tērā pea e pai te Atua kia whakapuakina e koe i reira tāku kanga mō rātou.” <verse eid="NUM 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 23:28" />Kātahi ka kawea a Paraama e Pāraka ki te tihi o Peoro, e titiro iho ana ki te koraha.<verse eid="NUM 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 23:29" />Ā, ka mea a Paraama ki a Pāraka, “Hangā he āta māku ki konei kia whitu, kia rite hoki māku ki konei he pūru kia whitu, he hipi toa kia whitu.” <verse eid="NUM 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 23:30" />Ā, rite tonu tā Pāraka i mea ai ki ngā mea i kōrerotia e Paraama, ā, whakaekea ana e ia he pūru, he hipi, ki runga ki tēnei āta, ki tēnei āta.<verse eid="NUM 23:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="NUM 24" />
  <para style="s">Te Poropiti Tuatoru a Paraama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 24:1" />Ā, nō te kitenga o Paraama ko tā Ihowā i pai ai he manaaki i a Īharaira, kīhai ia i haere me mua rā ki te whai i te mea mākutu; engari i anga tōna mata ki te koraha. <verse eid="NUM 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 24:2" />Nā, ka maranga ngā kanohi o Paraama, ā, ka kite i a Īharaira e noho ana i ō rātou iwi. Nā, ko te putanga mai o te Wairua o te Atua ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 24:3" />Nā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:3">“He kī tēnei nā Paraama, tama a Peoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:3">he kī hoki nā te tangata i kopi rā tōna kanohi,<verse eid="NUM 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 24:4" />he kī nā te tangata e rongo ana i ngā kupu a te Atua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">e kite ana i te whakakitenga a te Kaha Rawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:4">e taka iho ana, me te titiro anō ōna kanohi.<verse eid="NUM 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 24:5" />“Anō te pai o ōu tēneti, e Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:5">o ōu nohoanga, e Īharaira!<verse eid="NUM 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 24:6" />“Ānō ko ngā awaawa e takoto atu ana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">rite tahi ānō ki ngā kāri i te taha o te awa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:6">ki ngā aroe i whakatōkia e Ihowā,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:6">ki ngā hīta i te taha o ngā wai.<verse eid="NUM 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 24:7" />Ka maringi iho he wai i āna pere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">ā, hei roto āna purapura i ngā wai maha.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:7">“Ka nui ake hoki tōna kīngi i a Akaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:7">ā, ka kake tōna kīngitanga.<verse eid="NUM 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 24:8" />“Nā te Atua ia i whakaputa mai i Īhipa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ko tōna kaha, rite pū ki tō te unikanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:8">ka pau ngā iwi, ōna hoariri, i a ia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ka whatiwhatiia e ia ō rātou wheua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:8">ka werohia hoki rātou ki āna pere.<verse eid="NUM 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 24:9" />I tāpapa ia, i takoto, ānō he raiona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">ānō he raiona kātua; mā wai ia e whakaoho?</para>
  <para style="b" vid="NUM 24:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:9">“Ka manaakitia te tangata e manaaki ana i a koe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:9">ka kangā hoki te tangata e kanga ana i a koe.”<verse eid="NUM 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 24:10" />Nā, ka mura te riri o Pāraka ki a Paraama, ka papaki ōna ringa. Nā, ka mea a Pāraka ki a Paraama, “He kanga i ōku hoariri i karanga ai ahau i a koe, nā, ka toru nei āu manaakitanga i a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 24:11" />Nā, rere atu āianei ki tōu wāhi; i mea ahau kia whakanuia rawatia koe; heoi, kua puritia nei koe e Ihowā kei whai korōria.”<verse eid="NUM 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 24:12" />Nā, ka mea atu a Paraama ki a Pāraka, “Kāhore ianei ahau i kōrero, i mea ki āu karere i ungā ake rā e koe ki ahau, <verse eid="NUM 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 24:13" />‘Ahakoa i kī tōna whare i te hiriwa, i te kōura, e hōmai e Pāraka ki ahau, e kore e āhei i ahau te whakawhiti kē i te kupu a Ihowā, te mea i te pai, i te kino rānei, i tā tōku ngākau ake; ko tā Ihowā e kōrero ai, ko tēnā tāku e kōrero ai?’ <verse eid="NUM 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 24:14" />Nā, ka haere tēnei ahau ki tōku iwi; haere mai, māku e whakaatu ki a koe tā tēnei iwi e mea ai ki tōu iwi i ngā rā whakamutunga.”<verse eid="NUM 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Poropiti Tuawhā a Paraama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 24:15" />Nā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:15">“He kī tēnei nā Paraama, nā te tama a Peoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:15">he kī hoki nā te tangata i kopi rā tōna kanohi,<verse eid="NUM 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 24:16" />he kī nā te tangata, e rongo ana i ngā kupu a te Atua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">e mōhio ana ki ngā mea a te Runga Rawa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:16">e kite nei i te whakakitenga mai a te Kaha Rawa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:16">e taka iho ana, me te titiro anō ōna kanohi.<verse eid="NUM 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 24:17" />“E kite anō ahau i a ia, otiia kāhore āianei;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">e titiro atu ahau ki a ia, otiia e kore e tata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">Tērā e puta he whetū i roto i a Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">ka ara ake anō hoki he Hēpeta i roto i a Īharaira,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:17">ā, ka patua e ia ngā pito o Moapa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:17">ka hunā anō hoki e ia ngā tama katoa a Hete.<verse eid="NUM 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 24:18" />Ā, ka riro a Ēroma, ka riro anō a Heira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">ko ōna hoariri nei ērā;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:18">ā, ka māia te mahi a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 24:19" />Ā, ka whai rangatiratanga tētahi e puta mai i roto i a Hākopa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:19">ā, ka hunā e ia ngā mōrehu o te pā.”<verse eid="NUM 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 24:20" />Nā, ka titiro ia ki a Amareke, ā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:20">“Ko Amareke te tīmatanga o ngā iwi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:20">ko tōna whakamutunga ia he whakangaromanga.”<verse eid="NUM 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 24:21" />Nā, ka titiro ia ki te Keni, ā, ka ara tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:21">“He kaha tōu nohoanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:21">kua hangā anō hoki tōu ōhanga ki te kāmaka.<verse eid="NUM 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 24:22" />He ahakoa rā ka pau te Keni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:22">ā, whakaraua noatia koe e Ahiria.”<verse eid="NUM 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 24:23" />Nā, ka ara anō tāna kī pepeha, ka mea:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:23">“Auē, ko wai e ora, ina meatia tēnei e te Atua?<verse eid="NUM 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 24:24" />Ā, ka ū mai he kaipuke i te taha o Kitimi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="NUM 24:24">ā, ka tūkinotia e rātou a Ahiria, ka tūkinotia anō a Ēpere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="NUM 24:24">ko ia anō hoki ka whakangaromia.”<verse eid="NUM 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 24:25" />Kātahi ka whakatika a Paraama, ā, haere ana, hoki ana ki tōna wāhi; me Pāraka anō hoki i haere i tōna ara.<verse eid="NUM 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="NUM 25" />
  <para style="s">Te Iwi o Īharaira Koropiko ki a Paarapeoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 25:1" />Nā, ka noho a Īharaira ki Hitimi, ā, ka anga te iwi ka moepuku ki ngā tamāhine a Moapa. <verse eid="NUM 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 25:2" />Nā rātou hoki i karanga te iwi ki ngā patunga tapu mā ō rātou atua; nā, kai ana te iwi, ā, koropiko ana ki ō rātou atua. <verse eid="NUM 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 25:3" />Nā, ka whakaūkia a Īharaira ki a Paara-Peoro, ā, ka mura te riri o Ihowā ki a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 25:4" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Tangohia ngā ariki katoa o te iwi, tāronatia hoki ki te aroaro o Ihowā, i te ritenga atu o te rā, kia tahuri atu ai i a Īharaira te riri o Ihowā e mura nei.”<verse eid="NUM 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 25:5" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki ngā kaiwhakawā o Īharaira, “Patua e tēnei, e tēnei o koutou ōna tāngata i whakaūkia ki a Paara-Peoro.”<verse eid="NUM 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 25:6" />Nā, ka puta tētahi o ngā tama a Īharaira, e mau ana mai i tētahi wahine Miriani ki ōna tēina i te tirohanga atu a Mohi, i te tirohanga atu anō hoki a te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, i a rātou e tangi ana i te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 25:7" />Ā, nō te kitenga o Pinehaha, tama a Ereātara, tama a Ārona tohunga, ka whakatika i te whakaminenga. Ka hopu i te tao ki tōna ringa; <verse eid="NUM 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 25:8" />nā, ka haere i muri i te tangata o Īharaira ki te tēneti, ā, werohia ana rāua tokorua, te tangata o Īharaira, me te wahine hoki i tōna tia. Ā mutu iho te whiu o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 25:9" />Ā, ko te hunga i mate i te whiu e rua tekau mā whā mano.<verse eid="NUM 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 25:10" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 25:11" />“Nā Pinehaha, tama a Ereātara, tama a Ārona tohunga, tōku riri i anga kē atu ai i ngā tama a Īharaira, i tōna ngākau hae pēnei i tōku i roto i a rātou, i kore ai ngā tama a Īharaira e poto i ahau, i ahau e hae ana. <verse eid="NUM 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 25:12" />Mō reira me kī atu e koe, ‘Nanā, ka hoatu e ahau ki a ia tāku kawenata mō te rangimārie; <verse eid="NUM 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 25:13" />ā, ka mau ki a ia, ki ōna uri hoki i muri i a ia, hei kawenata kia mau tonu te mahi tohunga; mōna i hae, he whakaaro ki tōna Atua, i mea whakamārietanga anō hoki mō ngā tama a Īharaira.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 25:14" />Ā, ko te ingoa o te tangata o Īharaira i patua, i patua tahitia rā me te wahine Miriani, ko Tīmiri tama a Hāru, he rangatira nō tētahi whare kaumātua i roto i ngā Himioni. <verse eid="NUM 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 25:15" />Ko te ingoa hoki o te wahine Miriani i patua nei ko Kohopi, he tamāhine nā Turu; he rangatira ia nō tētahi iwi, nō tētahi whare kaumātua o Miriana.<verse eid="NUM 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 25:16" />Nā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 25:17" />“Whakataria he pakanga ki ngā Miriani, patua hoki; <verse eid="NUM 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 25:18" />e whakatari ana hoki rātou i a koutou ki ā rātou mahi tinihanga, i tinihangatia rā koutou e rātou i te mea mō Peoro, i te mea hoki mō Kohopi, tamāhine a te rangatira o Miriana, he tuahine nō rātou, i patua rā i te rā o te whiunga mō Peoro.”<verse eid="NUM 25:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="NUM 26" />
  <para style="s">Te Tauanga Tuarua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 26:1" />Ā, i muri iho i te whiu ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi rāua ko Ereātara, tama a Ārona tohunga, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 26:2" />“Taua ngā tāngata o te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira, ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, i ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, ngā mea katoa e kaha ana i roto i a Īharaira ki te haere ki te whawhai.” <verse eid="NUM 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 26:3" />Nā, ka kōrero a Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga ki a rātou i ngā mānia o Moapa, i te wāhi o Horano e tata ana ki Heriko, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 26:4" />“Taua ngā tāngata e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau,” kia rite ki tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi rātou ko ngā tama a Īharaira, i puta mai i te whenua o Īhipa:<verse eid="NUM 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 26:5" />ko Reupena mātāmua o Īharaira. Ko ngā tama a Reupena: ko Hanoka, nāna te hapū o ngā Hanoki; nā Paru, ko te hapū o ngā Parui; <verse eid="NUM 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 26:6" />nā Heterono, ko te hapū o ngā Heteroni; nā Karami, ko te hapū o ngā Karami. <verse eid="NUM 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 26:7" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Reupeni; taua ake o rātou e whā tekau mā toru mano e whitu rau e toru tekau.<verse eid="NUM 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 26:8" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Paru; ko Eriapa. <verse eid="NUM 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 26:9" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Eriapa; ko Nemuere, ko Ratana, ko Āpirama. Ko taua Ratana rāua ko Āpirama tēnei i whai ingoa nei i roto i te whakaminenga, i whawhai nei ki a Mohi rāua ko Ārona i roto i te hui a Koraha, i tā rātou whawhaitanga ki a Ihowā, <verse eid="NUM 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 26:10" />ā, ko te hāmamatanga o te māngai o te whenua, horomia ana rātou ko Koraha, i te matenga o taua hui; i te wā i kainga ai e te ahi ngā tāngata e rua rau e rima tekau; nā waiho ana rātou hei tohu. <verse eid="NUM 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 26:11" />Kīhai ia i mate ngā tama a Koraha.<verse eid="NUM 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 26:12" />Ko ngā tama a Himiona, i ō rātou hapū: nā Nemuere, ko te hapū o ngā Nemueri; nā Iamini, ko te hapū o ngā Iamini; nā Iakini, ko te hapū o ngā Iakini; <verse eid="NUM 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 26:13" />nā Tera, ko te hapū o ngā Terahi; nā Hauru, ko te hapū o ngā Hauri. <verse eid="NUM 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 26:14" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Himioni, e rua tekau mā rua mano e rua rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 26:15" />Ko ngā tama a Kara, i ō rātou hapū: nā Tepono, ko te hapū o ngā Teponi; nā Haki, ko te hapū o ngā Haki; nā Huni, ko te hapū o ngā Huni; <verse eid="NUM 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 26:16" />nā Otoni, ko te hapū o ngā Otoni; nā Eri, ko te hapū o ngā Eri; <verse eid="NUM 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 26:17" />nā Āroro, ko te hapū o ngā Arori; nā Areri, ko te hapū o ngā Areri. <verse eid="NUM 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 26:18" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā tama a Kara, o ngā mea o rātou i taua, e whā tekau mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 26:19" />Ko ngā tama a Hūrā: ko Ere rāua ko Onana; i mate hoki a Ere rāua ko Onana ki te whenua o Kanaana. <verse eid="NUM 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 26:20" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Hūrā, i ō rātou hapū: nā Heraha, ko te hapū o ngā Herani; nā Parete, ko te hapū o ngā Pareti; nā Tera, ko te hapū o ngā Terahi. <verse eid="NUM 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 26:21" />Ā, ko ngā tama ēnei a Parete; nā Heterono, ko te hapū o ngā Heteroni; nā Hāmuru, ko te hapū o ngā Hāmuri. <verse eid="NUM 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 26:22" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o Hūrā: ko ngā mea o rātou i taua; e whitu tekau mā ono mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 26:23" />Ko ngā tama a Ihākara, i ō rātou hapū: nā Tora, ko te hapū o ngā Torai; nā Pua, ko te hapū o ngā Puni; <verse eid="NUM 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 26:24" />nā Iahupu, ko te hapū o ngā Iahupi; nā Himirono, ko te hapū o ngā Himironi. <verse eid="NUM 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 26:25" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o Ihākara, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e ono tekau mā whā mano e toru rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 26:26" />Ko ngā tama a Hepurona i ō rātou hapū: nā Herete, ko te hapū o ngā Hereti; nā Erono, ko te hapū o ngā Eroni; nā Iahareere, ko te hapū o ngā Iahareeri. <verse eid="NUM 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 26:27" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Hepuroni, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua; e ono tekau mano e rima rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 26:28" />Ko ngā tama a Hōhepa, i ō rātou hapū: ko Mānahi rāua ko Ēparaima: <verse eid="NUM 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 26:29" />Ko ngā tama a Mānahi: nā Makiri, ko te hapū o ngā Makiri; (ā, whānau ake tā Makiri ko Kireara); nā Kireara, ko te hapū o ngā Kireari. <verse eid="NUM 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 26:30" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Kireara; nā Iētere, ko te hapū o ngā Iēteri; nā Hereke, ko te hapū o ngā Hereki; <verse eid="NUM 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 26:31" />nā Ahariere, ko te hapū o ngā Aharieri; nā Hekeme hoki, ko te hapū o ngā Hekemi; <verse eid="NUM 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 26:32" />nā Hemira, ko te hapū o ngā Hemiri: nā Hewhere, ko te hapū o ngā Hewheri. <verse eid="NUM 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 26:33" />Ā, kāhore he tama a Teropēhara tama a Hewhere, engari he tamāhine: ā, ko ngā ingoa ēnei o ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara, ko Mahara, ko Noa, ko Hokora, ko Mirika, ko Tirita. <verse eid="NUM 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 26:34" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o Mānahi, ko ngā mea hoki o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā rua mano e whitu rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 26:35" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Ēparaima, i ō rātou hapū: nā Hutera, ko te hapū o ngā Huteri; nā Pekere, ko te hapū o ngā Pekeri; nā Tahana, ko te hapū o ngā Tahani. <verse eid="NUM 26:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 26:36" />Ko ngā tama anō hoki ēnei a Hutera: nā Erana, ko te hapū o ngā Erani. <verse eid="NUM 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 26:37" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā tama a Ēparaima, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e toru tekau mā rua mano e rima rau. Ko ngā tama ēnei a Hōhepa i ō rātou hapū.<verse eid="NUM 26:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 26:38" />Ko ngā tama a Pineamine, i ō rātou hapū: nā Pera, ko te hapū o ngā Perai: nā Ahapere, ko te hapū o ngā Ahaperi; nā Ahirama, ko te hapū o ngā Ahirami; <verse eid="NUM 26:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 26:39" />nā Hupama, ko te hapū o ngā Hupami; nā Huwhama, ko te hapū o ngā Huwhami. <verse eid="NUM 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 26:40" />Ā, ko ngā tama a Pera ko Arare rāua ko Naamana: nā Arare, ko te hapū o ngā Arari; nā Naamana, ko te hapū o ngā Naami. <verse eid="NUM 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 26:41" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Pineamine, i ō rātou hapū; ā, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua e whā tekau mā rima mano e ono rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 26:42" />Ko ngā tama ēnei a Rāna, i ō rātou hapū: nā Hūhama, ko te hapū o ngā Hūhami. Ko ngā hapū ēnei o Rāna, tēnei hapū, tēnei hapū, o rātou. <verse eid="NUM 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 26:43" />Ko ngā hapū katoa o ngā Hūhami: ko ngā mea hoki o rātou i taua, e ono tekau mā whā mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 26:44" />Ko ngā tama a Āhera, i ō rātou hapū: nā Imina, ko te hapū o ngā Imini; nā Ihui, ko te hapū o ngā Ihui; nā Peria, ko te hapū o ngā Perii. <verse eid="NUM 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 26:45" />Ko ngā tama a Peria: nā Hēpere, ko te hapū o ngā Heperi; nā Marakiere, ko te hapū o ngā Marakieri. <verse eid="NUM 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 26:46" />Ā, ko te ingoa o te tamāhine a Āhera ko Hera. <verse eid="NUM 26:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 26:47" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā tama a Āhera: ko ngā mea o rātou i taua, e rima tekau mā toru mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 26:48" />Ko ngā tama a Napatari, i ō rātou hapū: nā Iahateere, ko te hapū o ngā Iahateeri; nā Kuni, ko te hapū o ngā Kuni; <verse eid="NUM 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 26:49" />nā Iētere, ko te hapū o ngā Iēteri: nā Hireme, ko te hapū o ngā Hiremi. <verse eid="NUM 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 26:50" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o Napatari, i ō rātou hapū: ā, ko ngā mea o rātou i taua e whā tekau mā rima mano e whā rau.<verse eid="NUM 26:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 26:51" />Ko ngā mea ēnei i taua o ngā tama a Īharaira: e ono rau kotahi mano, e whitu rau e toru tekau.<verse eid="NUM 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 26:52" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 26:53" />Me tuwha te whenua mō ēnei, hei kāinga tupu; kia rite ki te maha o ngā ingoa. <verse eid="NUM 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 26:54" />He tokomaha, kia nui te wāhi mō rātou, he tokotorutoru, kia iti hoki te wāhi mō rātou; kia rite ki tōna tokomaha te wāhi e hoatu ki tēnei, ki tēnei. <verse eid="NUM 26:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 26:55" />Otiia, me rota te tuwha o te whenua kia rite ki ngā ingoa o ngā iwi o ō rātou mātua tō rātou nohoanga iho. <verse eid="NUM 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 26:56" />Kia rite ki tā te rota te tūwhanga o ngā kāinga o reira mō te tokomaha, mō te tokotorutoru.<verse eid="NUM 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="NUM 26:57" />Ā, o ngā Rīwaiti, ko ēnei i taua, i ō rātou hapū: nā Kerehona, ko te hapū o ngā Kerehoni; nā Kohata, ko te hapū o ngā Kohati; nā Merari, ko te hapū o ngā Merari. <verse eid="NUM 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="NUM 26:58" />Ko ngā hapū ēnei o ngā Rīwaiti: ko te hapū o ngā Ripini, ko te hapū o ngā Heperoni, ko te hapū o ngā Māhari, ko te hapū o ngā Muhi, ko te hapū o ngā Korati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 26:58">Ā, whānau ake tā Kohata ko Āmarama. <verse eid="NUM 26:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="NUM 26:59" />Ā, ko te ingoa o tā Āmarama wahine ko Iokepete, he tamāhine nā Rīwai, i whānau nei mā Rīwai ki Īhipa; ā, whānau ake a rāua ko Āmarama, ko Ārona, ko Mohi, ko tō rāua tuahine hoki, ko Miriama. <verse eid="NUM 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="NUM 26:60" />Ā, whānau ake a Ārona, ko Nātapa, ko Apihu, ko Ereātara, ko Itamara. <verse eid="NUM 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="NUM 26:61" />Ā, i mate a Nātapa rāua ko Apihu i tā rāua tāpaenga i te ahi kē ki te aroaro o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 26:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="NUM 26:62" />Ā, taua ake o rātou, e rua tekau mā toru mano, ngā tāne katoa, kotahi nei te marama, maha ake rānei. Kīhai hoki rātou i taua i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira; nō te mea kīhai tētahi kāinga tupu i hōmai ki a rātou i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 26:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="NUM 26:63" />Ko ngā mea ēnei i taua e Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga, i tā rāua tauanga i ngā tama a Īharaira ki ngā mānia o Moapa, ki te wāhi o Horano e tata ana ki Heriko. <verse eid="NUM 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="NUM 26:64" />Kāhore anō i roto i ēnei tētahi o te hunga i taua e Mohi rāua ko Ārona tohunga, i tā rāua tauanga i ngā tama a Īharaira ki te koraha o Hinai. <verse eid="NUM 26:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="NUM 26:65" />I kīia hoki rātou e Ihowā, “Ka mate rawa ki te koraha.” Ā, kāhore tētahi o rātou i toe, ko Karepe anake tama a Iepune, rāua ko Hohua tama a Nunu.<verse eid="NUM 26:65" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="NUM 27" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Tamāhine a Teropēhara.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 27:1" />Nā, ka haere mai ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara, tama a Hewhere, he tama hoki ia nā Kireara, tama a Makiri, tama a Mānahi; nō ngā hapū o Mānahi, tama a Hōhepa. Ā, ko ngā ingoa ēnei o āna tamāhine: ko Mahara, ko Noa, ko Hokora, ko Mirika, ko Tirita. <verse eid="NUM 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 27:2" />Ā, ka tū rātou ki te aroaro o Mohi, ki te aroaro hoki o Ereātara tohunga, ki te aroaro anō o ngā rangatira, o te whakaminenga katoa hoki, ki te whatitoka o te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, ā, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 27:3" />“I mate tō mātou pāpā ki te koraha, kāhore hoki ia i roto i te hui o te hunga i huihui ki te whawhai ki a Ihowā i roto i te hui a Koraha, engari, i mate ia i runga i tōna hara ake, kāhore anō hoki āna tama. <verse eid="NUM 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 27:4" />He aha i whakakorea ai te ingoa o tō mātou pāpā i roto i tōna hapū, i a ia kāhore nei i whai tama? Hōmai he wāhi ki a mātou i roto i ngā tēina o tō mātou pāpā.”<verse eid="NUM 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 27:5" />Nā, ka kawea tā rātou kōrero e Mohi ki te aroaro o Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 27:6" />Ā, ka kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 27:7" />“He tika ngā kōrero a ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara, me hoatu tētahi wāhi ki a rātou hei kāinga tupu i roto i ngā tēina o tō rātou pāpā; me whakariro ki a rātou te kāinga tupu o tō rātou pāpā.<verse eid="NUM 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 27:8" />“Me kōrero anō hoki e koe ki ngā tama a Īharaira, me kī atu, ‘Ki te mate te tangata, ā, kāhore āna tama, nā, me whakariro tōna kāinga tupu ki tāna tamāhine. <verse eid="NUM 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 27:9" />Ā, ki te kāhore āna tamāhine, nā, me hoatu tōna kāinga tupu ki ōna tuākana, tēina rānei. <verse eid="NUM 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 27:10" />Ā, ki te kāhore ōna tuākana, tēina rānei, nā, me hoatu tōna kāinga tupu ki te tuākana, tēina rānei o tōna pāpā. <verse eid="NUM 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 27:11" />Ā, ki te kāhore he tuākana, tēina rānei o tōna pāpā, nā, me hoatu tōna kāinga tupu ki tōna whanaunga o tōna hapū e tata ana ki a ia, ā, ka riro a reira i a ia. Me waiho hoki tēnā hei tikanga whakaritenga mā ngā tama a Īharaira; ko tā Ihowā hoki i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.’ ”<verse eid="NUM 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ka Whiriwhiria a Hohua hei Whakakapi i a Mohi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 31:1-8">Tiuteronomi 31.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 27:12" />I mea anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “E piki koe ki tēnei maunga, ki Aparimi, ka titiro atu ki te whenua ka hoatu nei e ahau ki ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 27:13" />Ā, ka kitea e koe, nā, ka kohia atu hoki koe ki tōu iwi, ka pērātia me tōu tuakana, me Ārona i kohia atu nei, <verse eid="NUM 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 27:14" />mō kōrua i whakatoi ki tāku kupu i te koraha o Hini, i te ngangautanga a te whakaminenga, ā, kīhai i whakatapu i ahau i tō rātou aroaro, i te wai.” (Ko te wai o Meripa tēnā i Karehe, i te koraha o Hini.)<verse eid="NUM 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 27:15" />Ā, i kōrero a Mohi ki a Ihowā, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 27:16" />“Kia whakaritea e Ihowā, e te Atua o ngā wairua o ngā kikokiko katoa, tētahi tangata mō te whakaminenga, <verse eid="NUM 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 27:17" />hei haere atu i tō rātou aroaro, hei haere mai hoki i tō rātou aroaro, hei ārahi atu hoki i a rātou, hei ārahi mai anō i a rātou; kei rite hoki te whakaminenga a Ihowā ki ngā hipi kāhore nei ō rātou hēpara.”<verse eid="NUM 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 27:18" />Nā, ka mea a Ihowā ki a Mohi, “Tangohia mai ki a koe a Hohua tama a Nunu, he tangata kei a ia nei te wairua, ka popoki ai ōu ringa ki runga ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 27:19" />Ka whakatū ai hoki i a ia ki te aroaro o Ereātara tohunga, ki te aroaro anō hoki o te whakaminenga katoa, ka whakahau ai i a ia i tā rātou tirohanga. <verse eid="NUM 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 27:20" />Me hoatu anō e koe tētahi wāhi o tōu korōria ki runga ki a ia, kia rongo ai te whakaminenga katoa o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 27:21" />Ā, ka tū ia ki te aroaro o Ereātara tohunga, ko tērā anō hei kaitono whakaaro māna, i tā te Urimi e whakarite ai i te aroaro o Ihowā. Mā tāna kupu e haere atu ai, mā tāna kupu e haere mai ai rātou, a ia, me ngā tama katoa a Īharaira, arā te whakaminenga katoa.”<verse eid="NUM 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 27:22" />Nā, pēnā ana a Mohi me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a ia; ā, tangohia mai ana e ia a Hohua, whakatūria ana ki te aroaro o Ereātara tohunga, ki te aroaro anō o te whakaminenga katoa. <verse eid="NUM 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 27:23" />Ā, pōkia iho e ia ōna ringa ki runga ki a ia, me te whakahau anō ki a ia i tā Ihowā i kōrerotia e Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="NUM 28" />
  <para style="s">Te Whakahere o ia Rā</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 29:38-46">Ekoruhe 29.38-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 28:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 28:2" />“Whakahaua ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: Kia mau ki tāku whakahere, ki tāku taro mō āku whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki ahau, kia tāpaea mai ki ahau i tōna wā anō. <verse eid="NUM 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 28:3" />Me kī atu hoki e koe ki a rātou, Ko te whakahere ahi tēnei e tāpaea e koutou ki a Ihowā; kia rua ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore, hei tahunga tinana tūturu mō ia rā. <verse eid="NUM 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 28:4" />Ko tētahi reme me tuku i te ata, ko te rua o ngā reme me tuku i te ahiahi; <verse eid="NUM 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 28:5" />me te whakatekau o te epa parāoa, hei whakahere totokore, he mea kōnatunatu ki te whakawhā o te hine hinu, o te mea i patua. <verse eid="NUM 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 28:6" />Ka tūturu tēnei hei tahunga tinana, he mea i whakaritea ki Maunga Hinai hei kakara reka, hei whakahere ahi ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 28:7" />Ā, hei te whakawhā o te hine he ringihanga mō te reme kotahi; kia ringihia te wāina kaha ki te wāhi tapu hei ringihanga ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 28:8" />Me tuku tētahi o ngā reme i te ahiahi; kia rite ki tō te whakahere totokore o te ata, ki tō tōna ringihanga hoki, tāu tukunga i tēnā hei whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whakahere o te Hāpati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 28:9" />“Ā, i te rā hāpati; kia rua ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore, kia rua hoki ngā whakatekau o te epa parāoa pai, hei whakahere totokore, hei te mea i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, me tōna ringihanga anō. <verse eid="NUM 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 28:10" />Ko te tahunga tinana tēnei mō ngā hāpati katoa; tērā anō hoki te tahunga tinana, te mea tūturu, me tōna ringihanga.”<verse eid="NUM 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whakahere o ia Marama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 28:11" />“Ā, i ngā tīmatanga anō o ō koutou marama me tāpae e koutou he tahunga tinana ki a Ihowā: kia rua ngā pūru, hei te kūao, kia kotahi te hipi toa, kia whitu ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 28:12" />kia toru whakatekau o te epa parāoa pai hei whakahere totokore, hei te mea i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, mō te pūru kotahi. Kia rua whakatekau parāoa pai, hei whakahere totokore, hei te mea i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, mō te hipi toa kotahi; <verse eid="NUM 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 28:13" />me te whakatekau parāoa pai mō tēnei reme, mō tēnei reme, hei whakahere totokore, hei te mea i kōnatunatua ki te hinu; hei tahunga tinana he reka nei te kakara, hei whakahere ahi ki a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 28:14" />Ā, ko ngā ringihanga o aua mea kia kotahi hāwhe hine wāina mō te pūru kotahi, ko te whakatoru o te hine mō te hipi toa, me te whakawhā o te hine mō te reme: ko te tahunga tinana tēnei o tēnei marama, o tēnei marama, o ngā marama o te tau. <verse eid="NUM 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 28:15" />Kia kotahi kūao koati toa anō hoki e tukua hei whakahere hara ki a Ihowā: tērā anō hoki te tahunga tinana, te mea tūturu, me tōna ringihanga anō.”<verse eid="NUM 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Hākari o te Kapenga me te Taro Rēwenakore</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:5-14">Rewitikuha 23.5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 28:16" />“Kei te marama tuatahi, kei te kotahi tekau mā whā o ngā rā o te marama, te Kapenga a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 28:17" />Hei te tekau mā rima o ngā rā o tēnei marama tētahi hākari; e whitu ngā rā e kainga ai te taro rēwenakore.<verse eid="NUM 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 28:18" />“Hei te rā tuatahi te huihuinga tapu; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia. <verse eid="NUM 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 28:19" />Engari me tāpae he whakahere ahi hei tahunga tinana ki a Ihowā: kia rua ngā pūru, hei te kūao, kia kotahi hipi toa, kia whitu hoki ngā reme toa tau tahi; hei te mea kohakore ngā mea mā koutou. <verse eid="NUM 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 28:20" />Ā, hei te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu he whakahere totokore mō ēnā: kia toru whakatekau e tukua mō te pūru, kia rua ngā whakatekau mō te hipi toa; <verse eid="NUM 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 28:21" />me tuku e koe he whakatekau mō te reme, mō ngā reme e whitu. <verse eid="NUM 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 28:22" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara, hei whakamārie mō koutou. <verse eid="NUM 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 28:23" />Hei tāpiri ēnei e tukua nei e koutou mō te tahunga tinana o te ata; hei tahunga tinana tūturu hoki tēnā. <verse eid="NUM 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 28:24" />Kia pēnei tonu i te rā, i ngā rā e whitu, tā koutou tukunga i te kai o te whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā. Hei tāpiri mō te tahunga tinana tūturu te tukunga o tēnā mea me tōna ringihanga. <verse eid="NUM 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 28:25" />Ā, kei te rā whitu he huihuinga tapu mō koutou; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia.”<verse eid="NUM 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whakahere i te Rā o te Tūāpora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:15-22">Rewitikuha 23.15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 28:26" />“Ā, i te Rā o te Tūāpora, ina tāpaea he whakahere totokore hou e koutou ki a Ihowā i roto i tā koutou Hākari o ngā Wiki, me mea huihuinga tapu mō koutou; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia. <verse eid="NUM 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 28:27" />Engari, me tāpae te tahunga tinana hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā: kia rua ngā pūru, hei te kūao, kia kotahi hipi toa, kia whitu ngā reme toa tau tahi; <verse eid="NUM 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 28:28" />me tō rātou whakahere totokore he parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu, kia toru whakatekau mō te pūru kotahi, kia rua whakatekau mō te hipi toa kotahi, <verse eid="NUM 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 28:29" />hei te whakatekau mō te reme, o ngā reme e whitu; <verse eid="NUM 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 28:30" />kia kotahi koati toa hei whakamārie mō koutou. <verse eid="NUM 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 28:31" />Ko ēnei ā koutou e mahi me te tahunga tinana tūturu me tōna whakahere totokore, hei te mea kohakore ngā mea mā koutou, me ngā ringihanga anō.”<verse eid="NUM 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="NUM 29" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Whakahere i te Rā Whakatangi Tētere</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:23-25">Rewitikuha 23.23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 29:1" />“Hei te whitu o ngā marama, hei te rā tuatahi o te marama he huihuinga tapu mō koutou; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia. Hei rā whakatangi tētere tēnā mā koutou. <verse eid="NUM 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 29:2" />Me tuku anō he tahunga tinana hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā; kia kotahi pūru, hei te kūao, kia kotahi hipi toa, kia whitu ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore. <verse eid="NUM 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 29:3" />Ā, hei te parāoa pai i kōnatunatua ki te hinu te whakahere totokore, kia toru ngā whakatekau mō te pūru, kia rua hoki ngā whakatekau mō te hipi toa, <verse eid="NUM 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 29:4" />me te whakatekau mō te reme kotahi, o ngā reme e whitu. <verse eid="NUM 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 29:5" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara, hei whakamārie mō koutou. <verse eid="NUM 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 29:6" />Ko te tahunga tinana anō o te marama, me tōna whakahere totokore, ko te tahunga tinana tūturu, me tōna whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga o ērā, kia rite ki ngā ritenga o te pērā, hei kakara reka, hei whakahere ahi ki a Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Whakahere kei te Rā Whakamārie</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:26-32">Rewitikuha 23.26-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 29:7" />“Ā, i te tekau o ngā rā o tēnei marama, o te whitu, he huihuinga tapu mō koutou; me whakapōuri ō koutou wairua; kaua tētahi mahi e mahia. <verse eid="NUM 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 29:8" />Engari, me tāpae he tahunga tinana ki a Ihowā hei kakara reka; kia kotahi pūru, hei te kūao, kia kotahi hipi toa, kia whitu ngā reme toa tau tahi; hei ngā mea kohakore ngā mea mā koutou. <verse eid="NUM 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 29:9" />Hei te parāoa pai anō hoki i kōnatunatua ki te hinu te whakahere totokore mō ērā, kia toru ngā whakatekau mō te pūru, kia rua hoki ngā whakatekau mō te hipi toa kotahi, <verse eid="NUM 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 29:10" />hei te whakatekau mō te reme, puta noa i ngā reme e whitu. <verse eid="NUM 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 29:11" />Kia kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; me te whakahere hara hei whakamārie, te tahunga tinana tūturu, me tōna whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga.”<verse eid="NUM 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Whakahere o te Hākari Whare Wharau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LEV 23:33-44">Rewitikuha 23.33-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 29:12" />“Ā, hei te tahi tekau mā rima o ngā rā o te whitu o ngā marama he huihuinga tapu mō koutou; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia, ā, kia whitu ngā rā e mea hākari ai koutou ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 29:13" />“Me tāpae anō he tahunga tinana, he whakahere ahi, hei kakara reka ki a Ihowā. Kia kotahi tekau mā toru ngā pūru, hei te kūao, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia kotahi tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, hei ngā mea kohakore. <verse eid="NUM 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 29:14" />Hei te parāoa pai anō i kōnatunatua ki te hinu te whakahere totokore; kia toru ngā whakatekau ki te pūru, o ngā pūru kotahi tekau mā toru, kia rua ngā whakatekau ki te hipi toa, arā o ngā hipi toa e rua, <verse eid="NUM 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 29:15" />me te whakatekau ki te reme, o ngā reme kotahi tekau mā whā; <verse eid="NUM 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 29:16" />me tētahi koati toa, hei whakahere hara; me te tahunga tinana tūturu anō, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 29:17" />“Me tuku hoki i te rua o ngā rā ngā pūru kotahi tekau mā rua, hei te kūao, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 29:18" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore o aua mea, me ngā ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi, o ngā reme, kia rite ki te maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 29:19" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hei whakahere hara; tērā atu anō te tahunga tinana tūturu me tōna whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 29:20" />“Ā, hei te toru o ngā rā, kia kotahi tekau mā tahi ngā pūru, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 29:21" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 29:22" />Kia kotahi koati toa hei whakahere hara; me te whakahere hara tūturu anō, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 29:23" />“Ā, i te whā o ngā rā kia kotahi tekau ngā pūru, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore. <verse eid="NUM 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 29:24" />Nā, ko ngā whakahere totokore me ngā ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga; <verse eid="NUM 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 29:25" />kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara; me te tahunga tinana tūturu anō, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 29:26" />“Ā, i te rima o ngā rā kia iwa ngā pūru, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 29:27" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 29:28" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara; tērā anō te tahunga tinana tūturu, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 29:29" />“Ā, i te ono o ngā rā kia waru ngā pūru, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 29:30" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore, me ngā ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 29:31" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara; tērā anō te tahunga tinana tūturu, tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 29:32" />“Ā, i te whitu o ngā rā, kia whitu ngā pūru, kia rua ngā hipi toa, kia tekau mā whā ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 29:33" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore, me ō rātou ringihanga, arā o ngā pūru, o ngā hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 29:34" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara; tērā anō te tahunga tinana tūturu, tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 29:35" />“Hei te waru o ngā rā he huihuinga nui mā koutou; kaua tētahi mahi a te kaimahi e mahia. <verse eid="NUM 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 29:36" />Engari, me tāpae he tahunga tinana, he whakahere ahi, he kakara reka ki a Ihowā: kia kotahi pūru, kia kotahi hipi toa, kia whitu ngā reme toa tau tahi, he mea kohakore; <verse eid="NUM 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 29:37" />ā, ko ngā whakahere totokore, me ō rātou ringihanga, arā o te pūru, o te hipi toa, o ngā reme, kia rite ki tō rātou maha, kia rite ki te ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 29:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 29:38" />Kia kotahi koati toa anō hoki hei whakahere hara; tēnā anō te tahunga tinana tūturu, me tōna whakahere totokore, me tōna ringihanga.<verse eid="NUM 29:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 29:39" />“Ko ēnei ā koutou e mea ai ki a Ihowā i ā koutou hākari nunui, hāunga ā koutou kī taurangi, me ā koutou whakahere tuku noa, ko ā koutou tahunga tinana, me ā koutou whakahere totokore, ā koutou ringihanga, me ā koutou whakahere mō te pai.”<verse eid="NUM 29:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 29:40" />Nā, ka kōrerotia e Mohi ki ngā tama a Īharaira ngā mea katoa i whakahau ai a Ihowā ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 29:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="NUM 30" />
  <para style="s">He Oati tā te Wahine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 30:1" />Nā, ka kōrero a Mohi ki ngā ariki o ngā iwi o ngā tama a Īharaira, ka mea: “Ko te mea tēnei i whakahaua e Ihowā: <verse eid="NUM 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 30:2" />Ki te puaki i tētahi te kupu taurangi ki a Ihowā, ki te oati rānei i te oati e mau ai tōna wairua te here; kei whakatakā e ia tāna kupu, kia rite tāna e mea ai ki ngā mea katoa i puta mai i tōna māngai.<verse eid="NUM 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 30:3" />“Ā, mehemea he kī taurangi tā te wahine ki a Ihowā, ā, ka mau tāna here ki a ia, i a ia anō i te whare o tōna pāpā i tōna tamarikitanga; <verse eid="NUM 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 30:4" />ā, ka rongo tōna pāpā ki tāna kī taurangi, ki tāna here hoki i herea ai tōna wairua, ā, ka whakarongo kau tōna pāpā ki a ia; nā, ka mau āna kī taurangi katoa, ka mau anō hoki ngā here katoa i herea ai e ia tōna wairua. <verse eid="NUM 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 30:5" />Tēnā ia, ki te whakakāhoretia e tōna pāpā i te rā i rongo ai ia; e kore tētahi o āna kī taurangi, o āna here hoki e herea ai e ia tōna wairua e ū; ā, ka whakarērea noatia e Ihowā ki a ia, nō te mea kua whakakāhoretia tāna e tōna pāpā.<verse eid="NUM 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 30:6" />“Ā, ki te mea he tahu tāna, ā, ka puaki tāna kī taurangi, ka puta hohoro mai rānei i ōna ngutu te mea e herea ai e ia tōna wairua; <verse eid="NUM 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 30:7" />ā, ka rongo tāna tahu, ā, ka whakarongo puku ki a ia i te rā i rongo ai; nā, ka ū āna kī taurangi, ka mau anō hoki ngā here i herea ai e ia tōna wairua. <verse eid="NUM 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 30:8" />Tēnā ia, ki te whakakāhoretia tāna e tāna tahu i te rā i rongo ai ia; nā, ka taka tāna kī taurangi i puaki i a ia, me te mea i puta hohoro mai i ōna ngutu, i herea ai e ia tōna wairua. Ā, ka whakarērea noatia e Ihowā ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 30:9" />“Ko te kī taurangi ia a te pouaru, a te wahine rānei i whakarērea, arā ko ngā mea katoa i herea ai e ia tōna wairua, ka ū ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 30:10" />“Ki te mea ia nō te whare mai anō o tāna tahu tāna kī taurangi, tāna herenga rānei i te here, arā i te oati, ki tōna wairua, <verse eid="NUM 30:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 30:11" />ā, i rongo anō tāna tahu, i whakarongo puku hoki ki a ia, ā, kīhai i whakakāhore i tāna; nā, ka mau āna kī taurangi katoa, ka mau anō hoki ngā here katoa i herea ai e ia tōna wairua. <verse eid="NUM 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 30:12" />Tēnā ia, mehemea i whakatakā rawatia aua mea e tāna tahu i te rā i rongo ai ia; e kore e ū tētahi mea i puta mai i ōna ngutu mō āna kī taurangi, mō te mea e herea ai tōna wairua. Kua whakatakā e tāna tahu; ā, ka whakarērea noatia e Ihowā ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 30:13" />Ko ngā kī taurangi katoa, ko ngā oati here katoa hei pēhi i te wairua, mā tāna tahu e whakaū, mā tāna tahu hoki e whakataka. <verse eid="NUM 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 30:14" />Ki te whakarongo puku tonu ia tāna tahu i tēnā rā, i tēnā rā; nā, e whakaū ana ia i āna kī taurangi katoa, arā i āna here katoa i mau ai ia. Kua whakaūngia e ia, nō te mea i whakarongo puku ia ki a ia i te rā i rangona ai. <verse eid="NUM 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 30:15" />Ki te whakatakā rawatia ia e ia aua mea i muri iho i tōna rongonga; nā, māna e waha te kino o te wahine.”<verse eid="NUM 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 30:16" />Ko ngā tikanga ēnei i whakahaua e Ihowā ki a Mohi mā te tangata rāua ko tāna wahine, mā te pāpā rāua ko tāna tamāhine i te mea he taitamāhine ia, i te whare o tōna pāpā.<verse eid="NUM 30:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="NUM 31" />
  <para style="s">Te Whawhai ki a Miriana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 31:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 31:2" />“Rapua he utu mō ngā tama a Īharaira i ngā Miriani; hei muri iho ka kohia koe ki tōu iwi.”<verse eid="NUM 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 31:3" />Nā, ka kōrero a Mohi ki te iwi, ka mea, “Whītiki ētahi o koutou mō te whawhai, ka haere ai ki te tū i a Miriana, ki te tohe i tā Ihowā utu i a Miriana. <verse eid="NUM 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 31:4" />Kia kotahi te mano o tēnei iwi, o tēnei iwi, o ngā iwi katoa o Īharaira, e ungā ki te whawhai.”<verse eid="NUM 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 31:5" />Nā, ka wehea e rātou i roto i ngā mano o Īharaira, he mano nō ia iwi, tekau mā rua mano, rite tonu i te patu mō te whawhai. <verse eid="NUM 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 31:6" />Nā, ka ungā rātou e Mohi ki te whawhai, he mano nō tēnei iwi, nō tēnei iwi, me Pinehaha tama a Ereātara tohunga, ki te whawhai, me ngā mea tapu anō, me ngā tētere i tōna ringa hei whakaoho.<verse eid="NUM 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 31:7" />Nā, ka whawhai rātou ki a Miriana, ka pērā me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi; ā, patua iho e rātou ngā tāne katoa. <verse eid="NUM 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 31:8" />I patua anō e rātou ngā kīngi o Miriana, i roto i te parekura: a Ēwi rātou ko Rekeme, ko Turu, ko Huru, ko Repa, ngā kīngi tokorima o Miriana; i patua anō e rātou a Paraama, te tama a Peoro ki te hoari. <verse eid="NUM 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 31:9" />Ā, whakaraua ana e ngā tama a Īharaira ngā wāhine o Miriana, me ā rātou kōhungahunga; i tangohia anō ā rātou kararehe katoa, hei taonga pārau, me ā rātou kāhui katoa, me ō rātou taonga katoa. <verse eid="NUM 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 31:10" />Tahuna ake hoki e rātou ki te ahi ō rātou pā katoa i noho ai rātou, me ō rātou whare rangatira katoa.<verse eid="NUM 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 31:11" />Ā, tangohia ana e rātou ngā taonga katoa, me ngā mea pārau katoa, te tangata me te kararehe. <verse eid="NUM 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 31:12" />Ā, kawea ana e rātou ki a Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga, ki te whakaminenga anō hoki o ngā tama a Īharaira, ngā whakarau, me ērā mea pārau, me ngā taonga, ki te puni ki ngā mānia o Moapa, ki te wāhi o Horano e tata ana ki Heriko.<verse eid="NUM 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Whakatau i te Ope</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 31:13" />Ā, ka puta a Mohi rātou ko Ereātara tohunga, ko ngā ariki katoa o te whakaminenga ki te whakatau i a rātou ki waho o te puni. <verse eid="NUM 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 31:14" />Nā, ka riri a Mohi ki ngā rangatira o te ope, ki ngā rangatira o ngā mano, ki ngā rangatira anō hoki o ngā rau, i haere mai nei i te whawhai.<verse eid="NUM 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 31:15" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a rātou, “Kua whakaorangia e koutou ngā wāhine katoa? <verse eid="NUM 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 31:16" />Nanā, ko ngā mea ēnei nāna i tutū ai ngā tama a Īharaira ki a Ihowā i tō Peoro rā, he mea tohutohu nā Paraama, i pā ai te whiu ki te whakaminenga a Ihowā. <verse eid="NUM 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 31:17" />Nā reira patua āianei ngā tāne katoa i roto i ngā kōhungahunga, patua hoki ngā wāhine katoa kua mōhio, kua takoto ki te tāne. <verse eid="NUM 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 31:18" />Ko ngā kōhungahunga wāhine katoa ia, kāhore nei i mōhio, i takoto ki te tāne, whakaorangia mā koutou.<verse eid="NUM 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 31:19" />“Ko koutou hoki, me noho ki waho o te puni, kia whitu ngā rā; ko ngā tāngata katoa i patu i te tangata, me ngā mea katoa hoki i pā ki te tangata i patua, me pure koutou i a koutou, me ā koutou whakarau i te toru o ngā rā, i te whitu hoki o ngā rā. <verse eid="NUM 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 31:20" />Me pure anō hoki ngā kākahu katoa, me ngā oko hiako, me ngā mea katoa i hangā ki te huruhuru koati, me ngā oko rākau katoa.”<verse eid="NUM 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 31:21" />I mea anō a Ereātara tohunga ki ngā tāngata whawhai, i haere ki te riri, “Ko te tikanga tēnei o te ture i whakahaua e Ihowā ki a Mohi: <verse eid="NUM 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 31:22" />ko te kōura anake, me te hiriwa, ko te parāhi, ko te rino, ko te tine, me te matā – <verse eid="NUM 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 31:23" />ko ngā mea katoa e puta i te ahi, me tuku nā roto i te ahi, ā, ka kore te poke. Otiia, me pure anō ki te wai o te wehenga; ā, ko ngā mea katoa e kore e puta i te ahi, me tuku nā roto i te wai. <verse eid="NUM 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 31:24" />Ā, me horoi ō koutou kākahu i te whitu o ngā rā, ā, ka kore ō koutou poke, ā, hei muri iho ka tomo ki te puni.”<verse eid="NUM 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Te Wehenga o ngā Taonga Pārau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 31:25" />Ā, i kōrero a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 31:26" />“Tirohia te maha o te taonga pārau i riro mai, o te tangata, o te kararehe, e kōrua ko Ereātara tohunga, e ngā mātua ariki anō hoki o ngā whare o te whakaminenga. <verse eid="NUM 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 31:27" />Wehea hoki ngā taonga pārau kia rua ngā wāhi; mā te hunga i hāpai i te pakanga, i haere atu ki te whawhai, mā te whakaminenga katoa anō.<verse eid="NUM 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 31:28" />“Tangohia anō hoki he takoha mā Ihowā i ngā tāngata i whawhai, i haere atu nā ki te riri. Kia kotahi wairua i roto i ngā rau e rima, o te tangata, rātou tahi ko te kau, ko te kāihe, ko ngā hipi hoki. <verse eid="NUM 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 31:29" />Me tango i roto i tā rātou hāwhe, ka hoatu ai ki a Ereātara, ki te tohunga, hei whakahere hapahapai ki a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 31:30" />“Me tango anō e koe i roto i te hāwhe a ngā tama a Īharaira, kia kotahi wāhi i roto i te rima tekau, o te tangata, o te kau, o te kāihe, o te hipi, arā o ngā kararehe katoa, ka hoatu ai mā ngā Rīwaiti, mā ngā kaitiaki o ngā mea o te tapenākara o Ihowā.” <verse eid="NUM 31:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 31:31" />Nā, pērātia ana e Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 31:32" />Ā, ko te taonga, ko te toenga iho o ngā mea i riro pārau i ngā tāngata i whawhai, e ono rau e whitu tekau mā rima mano hipi, <verse eid="NUM 31:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 31:33" />e whitu tekau mā rua mano hoki ngā kau, <verse eid="NUM 31:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 31:34" />e ono tekau mā tahi mano ngā kāihe, <verse eid="NUM 31:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 31:35" />e toru tekau mā rua mano ngā tāngata, arā ngā wāhine kāhore anō i mōhio noa, i takoto noa, ki te tāne.<verse eid="NUM 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 31:36" />Ā, ko tērā hāwhe, ko te wāhi a te hunga i haere ki te whawhai: e toru rau e toru tekau mā whitu mano e rima rau te maha o ngā hipi; <verse eid="NUM 31:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 31:37" />ā, ko te takoha mā Ihowā o ngā hipi e ono rau e whitu tekau mā rima. <verse eid="NUM 31:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 31:38" />E toru tekau mā ono mano ngā kau; ā, ko te takoha mā Ihowā e whitu tekau mā rua. <verse eid="NUM 31:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 31:39" />E toru tekau mano e rima rau ngā kāihe; ā, ko te takoha mā Ihowā e ono tekau mā tahi. <verse eid="NUM 31:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 31:40" />Ā, ko ngā tāngata tekau mā ono mano; ā, ko te takoha mā Ihowā, e toru tekau mā rua tāngata.<verse eid="NUM 31:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 31:41" />Nā, ka hoatu e Mohi te takoha, te whakahere hapahapai mā Ihowā, ki a Ereātara tohunga, ka pērātia me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 31:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 31:42" />Nā, nō roto i te hāwhe a ngā tama a Īharaira i wehea nei e Mohi i roto i tā te hunga i whawhai, <verse eid="NUM 31:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 31:43" />ko te hāwhe hoki a te whakaminenga, e toru rau e toru tekau mā whitu mano e rima rau hipi, <verse eid="NUM 31:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 31:44" />e toru tekau mā ono mano ngā kau, <verse eid="NUM 31:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 31:45" />e toru tekau mano e rima rau ngā kāihe, <verse eid="NUM 31:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 31:46" />kotahi tekau mā ono mano ngā tāngata; <verse eid="NUM 31:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 31:47" />i tangohia e Mohi i roto i te hāwhe a ngā tama a Īharaira, kotahi wāhi i roto i te rima tekau, o te tangata, o te kararehe; ā, hoatu ana ki ngā Rīwaiti i tiaki nei i ngā mea o te tapenākara o Ihowā; i pērātia anō me tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi.<verse eid="NUM 31:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 31:48" />Nā, ka haere mai ki a Mohi ngā rangatira mano o te ope, ngā rangatira mano rātou ko ngā rangatira rau, <verse eid="NUM 31:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 31:49" />ā, ka mea ki a Mohi, “Kua tirohia e āu pononga te tokomaha o ngā tāngata i whawhai nei i raro i ō mātou ringa, ā, kāhore i ngaro tētahi o mātou. <verse eid="NUM 31:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 31:50" />Koia i kawea mai ai e mātou he whakahere mā Ihowā, e ia tangata, e ia tangata, tāna i whiwhi ai, ētahi mea kōura, ētahi mekameka, poroporo, mōwhiti, whakakai, heitiki hoki, hei whakamārie mō ō mātou wairua ki te aroaro o Ihowā.”<verse eid="NUM 31:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 31:51" />Nā, ka tangohia e Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga te kōura i a rātou, he mea mahi katoa. <verse eid="NUM 31:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 31:52" />Ā, kotahi tekau mā ono mano e whitu rau e rima tekau hekere o te kōura katoa o te whakahere i tāpaea e rātou ki a Ihowā, o tā ngā rangatira mano rātou ko ngā rangatira rau. <verse eid="NUM 31:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 31:53" />I pāhuatia hoki e ngā tāngata i whawhai ētahi taonga, tēnā mōna ake, tēnā mōna ake. <verse eid="NUM 31:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 31:54" />Nā, tangohia ana e Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga te kōura a ngā rangatira o ngā mano, o ngā rau, ā, kawea ana e rāua ki roto ki te tapenākara o te whakaminenga, hei whakamahara mō ngā tama a Īharaira ki te aroaro o Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 31:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="NUM 32" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Iwi ki te Rāwhiti o Horano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 3:12-22">Tiuteronomi 3.12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 32:1" />Nā, he tini rawa ngā kāhui a ngā tama a Reupena, rātou ko ngā tama a Kara; ā, ka kite rātou i te whenua o Iatere, i te whenua hoki o Kireara, nā, he wāhi pai tēnā wāhi mō ngā kāhui. <verse eid="NUM 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 32:2" />Nā, ka haere ngā tama a Kara rātou ko ngā tama a Reupena, ka kōrero ki a Mohi rāua ko Ereātara tohunga, ki ngā rangatira anō o te whakaminenga, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 32:3" />“Ko Ataroto, ko Ripono, ko Iatere, ko Nimira, ko Hehepona, ko Ereare, ko Hepama, ko Nepo, ko Peono – <verse eid="NUM 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 32:4" />ko te whenua katoa i patua nā e Ihowā i te aroaro o te whakaminenga o Īharaira – he whenua pai tēnā mō ngā kāhui, he kāhui anō hoki a āu pononga.” <verse eid="NUM 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 32:5" />I mea anō rātou, “Mehemea e manakohia ana mātou i tōu aroaro, me hōmai tēnei whenua hei kāinga mō āu pononga; kaua mātou e meatia kia whiti i Horano.”<verse eid="NUM 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 32:6" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki ngā tama a Kara rātou ko ngā tama a Reupena: “Ko ō koutou tēina koia kia haere ki te whawhai, ā, ko koutou kia noho ki konei? <verse eid="NUM 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 32:7" />He aha koutou i pēhi ai i te ngākau o ngā tama a Īharaira kia kaua e whiti ki te whenua i hōmai e Ihowā ki a rātou? <verse eid="NUM 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 32:8" />I pēnā anō ō koutou mātua i tāku tononga atu i a rātou i Karehepārenea kia kite i te whenua. <verse eid="NUM 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 32:9" />I tō rātou haerenga hoki ki runga ki te awaawa o Ehekora, ā, ka kite rātou i te whenua, nā, pēhia ana e rātou ngā ngākau o ngā tama a Īharaira, kia kaua e haere ki te whenua i hōmai nei e Ihowā ki a rātou. <verse eid="NUM 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 32:10" />Nā, ko te muranga o tō Ihowā riri i taua rā, ā, ka oati ia, ka mea, <verse eid="NUM 32:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 32:11" />‘E kore rawa ngā tāngata i haere mai nei i Īhipa, ngā mea e rua tekau, he maha atu rānei ō rātou tau, e kite i te whenua i oati ai ahau ki a Āperahama, ki a Īhaka, ki a Hākopa; mō rātou kīhai i tino whai i ahau – <verse eid="NUM 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 32:12" />heoi anō ko Karepe, ko te tama a Iepune Keniti, rāua ko Hohua, te tama a Nunu; mō rāua i tino whai i a Ihowā.’ <verse eid="NUM 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 32:13" />Nā, ko te muranga o te riri o Ihowā ki a Īharaira, ā, meinga ana rātou kia kōpikopiko i te koraha, e whā tekau ngā tau, ā poto noa taua whakapaparanga i mahi nā i te kino i te tirohanga a Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 32:14" />“Nā, kua ara ake nā koutou hei whakakapi mō ō koutou mātua, he huanga tāngata hara, hei whakanui atu i te mura o tō Ihowā riri ki a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 32:15" />Nō te mea ki te tahuri kē koutou, ā, kāhore e whai i a ia, ka waiho anō rātou e ia i te koraha; ā, mā koutou ka ngaro ai tēnei iwi katoa.”<verse eid="NUM 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 32:16" />Nā, ka whakatata rātou ki a ia, ka mea: “Ka hangā e mātou he taiepa hipi ki konei mō ā mātou kararehe, me ētahi pā mō ā mātou tamariki. <verse eid="NUM 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 32:17" />Ko mātou ia ka haere me ā mātou patu i mua i ngā tama a Īharaira, kia kawea rā anō rātou e mātou ki te wāhi mō rātou; ā, me noho ā mātou tamariki ki ngā pā e whai taiepa ana, he wehi hoki i ngā tāngata o tēnei whenua. <verse eid="NUM 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 32:18" />E kore mātou e hoki ki ō mātou whare, kia riro rā anō tōna kāinga i tēnei, i tēnei o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 32:19" />E kore hoki mātou e tū tahi me rātou i te kāinga i tāwāhi o Horano, i tua atu rānei; nō te mea ka riro mai he kāinga mō mātou i tēnei taha o Horano, i te taha ki te rāwhiti.”<verse eid="NUM 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 32:20" />Nā, ka mea a Mohi ki a rātou: “Ki te meatia tēnei mea e koutou – ki te haere koutou me ā koutou patu i te aroaro o Ihowā ki te whawhai, <verse eid="NUM 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 32:21" />ki te whiti katoa hoki koutou i Horano me ā koutou patu i te aroaro o Ihowā, kia peia rā anō e ia ōna hoariri i mua i a ia, <verse eid="NUM 32:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 32:22" />ā, ka taea te whenua i te aroaro o Ihowā – kātahi koutou ka hoki, ā, ka harakore ki te aroaro o Ihowā, ki te aroaro anō hoki o Īharaira; ā, mō koutou tēnei whenua hei nohoanga i te aroaro o Ihowā.<verse eid="NUM 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 32:23" />“Tēnā ia, ka kore koutou e pēnā, nanā, kua hara koutou ki a Ihowā; ā, kia mōhio koutou, e hopukia anō koutou e tō koutou hara. <verse eid="NUM 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 32:24" />Hangā ngā pā mō ā koutou tamariki, me ngā taiepa mō ā koutou hipi; meatia anō hoki te mea i puta mai i ō koutou māngai.”<verse eid="NUM 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 32:25" />Nā, ka kōrero ngā tama a Kara rātou ko ngā tama a Reupena ki a Mohi, ka mea, “Ka pēnā āu pononga me tā tōku ariki i whakahau ai. <verse eid="NUM 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 32:26" />Ko reira ā mātou tamariki, ā mātou wāhine, ā mātou kāhui, me ā mātou kararehe katoa, ko ngā pā o Kireara. <verse eid="NUM 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 32:27" />Ko āu pononga ia me whiti katoa atu, rite rawa i te patu mō te pakanga, whawhai ai i te aroaro o Ihowā; me pērā me tā tōku ariki i kī ai.”<verse eid="NUM 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 32:28" />Nā, ka whakahaua te tikanga mō rātou e Mohi ki a Ereātara tohunga, rātou ko Hohua tama a Nunu, ko ngā ariki hoki o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā iwi o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 32:29" />Ā, ka mea a Mohi ki a rātou, “Ki te whiti katoa atu i roto i a koutou ngā tama a Kara i Horano, rātou ko ngā tama a Reupena, me ā rātou patu anō, whawhai ai i te aroaro o Ihowā, ā, ka taea te whenua i tō koutou aroaro; nā, me hoatu e koutou te whenua o Kireara kia puritia e rātou; <verse eid="NUM 32:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 32:30" />ki te kāhore ia rātou e whiti tahi i a koutou, me ā rātou patu, nā, tēnā he wāhi hei puritanga mā rātou i roto i a koutou i te whenua o Kanaana.”<verse eid="NUM 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 32:31" />Nā, ka whakautua e ngā tama a Kara rātou ko ngā tama a Reupena, ka mea, “Ka rite tonu tā mātou e mea ai ki tā Ihowā i kōrero mai ai ki āu pononga. <verse eid="NUM 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 32:32" />Me whiti mātou me ā mātou patu i te aroaro o Ihowā ki te whenua o Kanaana, ā, hei puritanga mā mātou tō mātou kāinga i tēnei taha o Horano.”<verse eid="NUM 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 32:33" />Nā, ka hōmai e Mohi ki a rātou, ki ngā tama a Kara, ki ngā tama a Reupena rātou ko tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi tama a Hōhepa te kīngitanga o Hihona kīngi o ngā Amori, me te kīngitanga o Oka kīngi o Pahana, te whenua me ōna pā i roto i ō rātou rohe, arā ngā pā o te whenua ā tawhio noa.<verse eid="NUM 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 32:34" />Nā, ka hangā e ngā tama a Kara a Ripono, a Ataroto, a Aroere, <verse eid="NUM 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 32:35" />me Ateroto Hopana, me Iatere, me Iokopeha, <verse eid="NUM 32:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 32:36" />me Petenimira, me Peteharana; he pā taiepa, me ngā taiepa mō ngā hipi. <verse eid="NUM 32:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 32:37" />Ā, nā ngā tama a Reupena i hanga a Hehepona, a Ereare, a Kiriataima, <verse eid="NUM 32:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 32:38" />a Nepo, a Paara-Meono, (i whakaputaia kētia hoki ngā ingoa) me Hipima. I huaina anō hoki e rātou he ingoa kē ki ngā pā i hangā e rātou.<verse eid="NUM 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 32:39" />Ā, i haere atu ngā tama a Makiri tama a Mānahi ki Kireara, ā, tangohia ana e ia, peia ana hoki te Amori i reira. <verse eid="NUM 32:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 32:40" />Ā, i hoatu e Mohi a Kireara ki a Makiri tama a Mānahi; ā, noho ana ia i reira. <verse eid="NUM 32:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 32:41" />Ā, i haere a Haira tama a Mānahi, ā, tangohia ana e ia ngā pā o reira, ā, huaina iho e ia, ko Hawotohaira. <verse eid="NUM 32:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 32:42" />Ā, i haere a Nopaha, ā, tangohia ana e ia a Kenata, me ōna pā ririki, ā, huaina iho ki tōna ingoa, ki a Nopaha.<verse eid="NUM 32:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="NUM 33" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Haerenga i Īhipa ki ngā Mānia o Moapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 33:1" />Ko ngā haerenga ēnei o ngā tama a Īharaira i tō rātou putanga mai i te whenua o Īhipa i ō rātou rōpū i raro i te ringa o Mohi rāua ko Ārona. <verse eid="NUM 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 33:2" />I tuhituhia hoki e Mohi ō rātou haerenga atu, ō rātou whakatikanga atu, he mea ki mai nā Ihowā; ā, ko ō rātou whakatikanga atu ēnei, me ō rātou haerenga.<verse eid="NUM 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 33:3" />I tūria atu i Ramehehe i te marama tuatahi, i te kotahi tekau mā rima o ngā rā o te marama tuatahi; nō te aonga ake o te Kapenga i puta mai ai ngā tama a Īharaira, i runga tonu anō te ringa i te tirohanga a ngā Īhipiana katoa; <verse eid="NUM 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 33:4" />i ngā Īhipiana e tanu ana i ā rātou mātāmua katoa, i patua nei e Ihowā i roto i a rātou; ā, mahi whakawā ana a Ihowā ki ō rātou atua.<verse eid="NUM 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 33:5" />Nā, tūria ana e ngā tama a Īharaira i Ramehehe, ā, noho ana i Hukota.<verse eid="NUM 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 33:6" />I tūria i Hukota, ā, noho ana i Ētama, i te pito o te koraha.<verse eid="NUM 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 33:7" />I tūria i Ētama, ā, tahuri ana whaka Pihahirota ki te ritenga atu o Paara-Hepona; ā, noho ana i te ritenga atu o Mikitoro.<verse eid="NUM 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 33:8" />I tūria i te ritenga atu o Pihahirota, ā, tika ana nā waenganui o te moana ki te koraha; ā, haere ana, e toru ngā rā ki te ara, i te koraha o Ētama, ā, noho ana i Mara.<verse eid="NUM 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 33:9" />I tūria i Mara, ā, haere ana ki Erimi; kotahi tekau mā rua hoki ngā puna wai i Erimi, e whitu tekau hoki ngā nīkau; ā, noho ana rātou i reira.<verse eid="NUM 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 33:10" />I tūria i Erimi, ā, noho ana i te taha o te Moana Whero.<verse eid="NUM 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 33:11" />I tūria i te Moana Whero, ā, noho ana i te koraha o Hini.<verse eid="NUM 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 33:12" />I tūria i te koraha o Hini, ā, noho ana i Ropoka.<verse eid="NUM 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 33:13" />I tūria i Ropoka, ā, noho ana i Aruhu.<verse eid="NUM 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 33:14" />I tūria i Aruhu, ā, noho ana i Repirimi, i te wāhi kāhore nei he wai hei inu mā te iwi.<verse eid="NUM 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 33:15" />I tūria i Repirimi, ā, noho ana i te koraha o Hinai.<verse eid="NUM 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 33:16" />I tūria i te koraha o Hinai, ā, noho ana i Kipiroto Hataawa.<verse eid="NUM 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 33:17" />I tūria i Kipiroto Hataawa, ā, noho ana i Hateroto.<verse eid="NUM 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 33:18" />I tūria i Hateroto, ā, noho ana i Ritima.<verse eid="NUM 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 33:19" />I tūria i Ritima, ā, noho ana i Rimono Parehe.<verse eid="NUM 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 33:20" />I tūria i Rimono Parehe, ā, noho ana i Rīpina.<verse eid="NUM 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 33:21" />I tūria i Rīpina, ā, noho ana i Ritaha.<verse eid="NUM 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 33:22" />I tūria i Ritaha, ā, noho ana i Keherataha.<verse eid="NUM 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 33:23" />I tūria i Keherataha, ā, noho ana i Maunga Hapere.<verse eid="NUM 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 33:24" />I tūria i Maunga Hapere, ā, noho ana i Harataha.<verse eid="NUM 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 33:25" />I tūria i Harataha, ā, noho ana i Makaheroto.<verse eid="NUM 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 33:26" />I tūria i Makaheroto, ā, noho ana i Tahata.<verse eid="NUM 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 33:27" />I tūria i Tahata, ā, noho ana i Taraha.<verse eid="NUM 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 33:28" />I tūria i Taraha, ā, noho ana i Mitika.<verse eid="NUM 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 33:29" />I tūria i Mitika, ā, noho ana i Hahamona.<verse eid="NUM 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 33:30" />I tūria i Hahamona, ā, noho ana i Moheroto.<verse eid="NUM 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 33:31" />I tūria i Moheroto, ā, noho ana i Pene Iaakana.<verse eid="NUM 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 33:32" />I tūria i Pene Iaakana, ā, noho ana i Horo Hakirikara.<verse eid="NUM 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 33:33" />I tūria i Horo Hakirikara, ā, noho ana i Iotopata.<verse eid="NUM 33:33" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 33:34" />I tūria i Iotopata, ā, noho ana i Eperona.<verse eid="NUM 33:34" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="NUM 33:35" />I tūria i Eperona, ā, noho ana i Ehiono Kēpere.<verse eid="NUM 33:35" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="NUM 33:36" />I tūria i Ehiono Kēpere, ā, noho ana i te koraha o Hini, arā o Karehe.<verse eid="NUM 33:36" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="NUM 33:37" />I tūria i Karehe, ā, noho ana i Maunga Horo, i te pito o te whenua o Ēroma. <verse eid="NUM 33:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="NUM 33:38" />Ā, i kake a Ārona tohunga ki Maunga Horo, he mea kī mai nā Ihowā, ā, mate iho ki reira, i te whā tekau o ngā tau o te putanga mai o ngā tama a Īharaira i te whenua o Īhipa, i te rā tuatahi o te rima o ngā marama. <verse eid="NUM 33:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="NUM 33:39" />Ā, kotahi rau e rua tekau mā toru ngā tau o Ārona i tōna matenga ki Maunga Horo.<verse eid="NUM 33:39" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="NUM 33:40" />Ā, i rongo te kīngi o Arara, te Kanaani, i noho nei i te whenua o Kanaana, i te taha ki te tonga, ki te taenga mai o ngā tama a Īharaira.<verse eid="NUM 33:40" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="NUM 33:41" />Ā, i tūria e rātou i Maunga Horo, ā, noho ana i Taramona.<verse eid="NUM 33:41" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="NUM 33:42" />I tūria i Taramona, ā, noho ana i Punono.<verse eid="NUM 33:42" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="NUM 33:43" />I tūria i Punono, ā, noho ana i Opoto.<verse eid="NUM 33:43" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="NUM 33:44" />I tūria i Opoto, ā, noho ana i Iteaparimi, i ngā rohe o Moapa.<verse eid="NUM 33:44" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="NUM 33:45" />I tūria i Īmi, ā, noho ana i Riponokara.<verse eid="NUM 33:45" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="NUM 33:46" />I tūria i Riponokara, ā, noho ana i Aramono Ripirataima.<verse eid="NUM 33:46" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="NUM 33:47" />I tūria i Aramono Ripirataima, ā, noho ana i ngā maunga o Aparimi, i te ritenga atu o Nepo.<verse eid="NUM 33:47" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="NUM 33:48" />I tūria i ngā maunga o Aparimi, ā, noho ana i ngā mānia o Moapa, i te wāhi o Horano e tata ana ki Heriko. <verse eid="NUM 33:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="NUM 33:49" />Nā, ka noho rātou ki te taha o Horano ki Peteiehimoto, tae noa ki Āperehitimi, ki ngā mānia o Moapa.<verse eid="NUM 33:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Whakaakoranga i mua i te Whakawhiti i Horano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="NUM 33:50" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi i ngā mānia o Moapa, i te wāhi o Horano e tata ana ki Heriko, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 33:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="NUM 33:51" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: E whiti koutou i Horano ki te whenua o Kanaana; <verse eid="NUM 33:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="NUM 33:52" />nā, me pei ngā tāngata whenua katoa i tō koutou aroaro, me whakamōtī ā rātou āhua kōhatu, me whakamōtī katoa anō hoki ā rātou whakapakoko whakarewa, ka whakakāhore anō hoki i ā rātou wāhi teitei katoa. <verse eid="NUM 33:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="NUM 33:53" />Ā, ka tangohia te whenua e koutou, ka nohoia hoki; kua hoatu nei hoki e ahau te whenua kia nohoia e koutou.<verse eid="NUM 33:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="NUM 33:54" />“Me rota tā koutou tuwha i te whenua hei kāinga mō ō koutou hapū; he nui, kia nui tōna wāhi, he iti, kia iti tōna wāhi; hei te wāhi i tika ai tōna rota te wāhi mō tēnei, mō tēnei; kia rite ki ngā iwi o ō koutou mātua te tūwhanga o ō koutou wāhi.<verse eid="NUM 33:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="NUM 33:55" />“Ko tēnei, ki te kāhore e peia e koutou ngā tāngata whenua i tō koutou aroaro; nā, hei koikoi i roto i ō koutou kanohi ngā mea o rātou e whakatoea e koutou, hei tūmatakuru anō i ō koutou kaokao, ā, ka whakatoi rātou i a koutou ki te whenua e noho ai koutou. <verse eid="NUM 33:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="NUM 33:56" />Nā, ko ngā mea i whakaaro ahau hei meatanga ki a rātou, ka meatia e ahau ki a koutou.”<verse eid="NUM 33:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="NUM 34" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Rohe o te Whenua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 34:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 34:2" />“Whakahaua ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou: E tae koutou ki te whenua o Kanaana (ko te whenua tēnei e riro i a koutou hei kāinga tupu, arā te whenua o Kanaana, me ōna rohe), <verse eid="NUM 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 34:3" />nā, kei te koraha o Hini te taha ki a koutou whaka te tonga, haere tonu i te rohe o Ēroma. Ā, hei rohe ki a koutou ki te tonga te pito rawa o te Moana Tote, whaka te rāwhiti. <verse eid="NUM 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 34:4" />Nā, ka piko tō koutou rohe i te tonga ki te pikitanga o Akarapimi, ā, whiti tonu ki Hini. Nā, ka rere i te tonga, a Karehepārenea, haere, a Hatarārara, whiti tonu atu ki Atamono. <verse eid="NUM 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 34:5" />Nā, ka piko te rohe i Atamono, ā te awa o Īhipa, ā, marere atu ki te moana.<verse eid="NUM 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 34:6" />“Nā, ko te rohe ki te hauāuru, ko te Moana Nui me tōna rohe; ko tō koutou rohe ki te hauāuru tēnei.<verse eid="NUM 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 34:7" />“Ā, ko tēnei tō koutou rohe ki te raki: me whakatakoto e koutou i te Moana Nui ki Maunga Horo; <verse eid="NUM 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 34:8" />me whakatakoto anō hoki i Maunga Horo ki te haerenga atu ki Hāmata; ā, kei Terara ngā putanga atu o te rohe; <verse eid="NUM 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 34:9" />ā, ka tae te rohe ki Tipirono, ā, kei Hataraenana ōna putanga atu; ko te rohe tēnei ki a koutou whaka te raki.<verse eid="NUM 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 34:10" />“Me whakatakoto anō tō koutou rohe ki te rāwhiti i Hataraenana ki Hepama; <verse eid="NUM 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 34:11" />ā, ka haere te rohe ki raro i Hepama ki Ripira, ki te taha ki te rāwhiti o Aina; ā, ka haere tonu te rohe ki raro, ā, ka tae ki te taha o te Moana o Kinereta whaka te rāwhiti; <verse eid="NUM 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 34:12" />ā, ka haere te rohe ki Horano, ā, kei te Moana Tote ōna putanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:12">“Ko te whenua tēnei mō koutou, me ōna rohe ā tawhio noa.<verse eid="NUM 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 34:13" />“Nā, ka whakahau a Mohi i ngā tama a Īharaira, ka mea: Ko te whenua tēnei e rotarotatia hei kāinga pūmau mō koutou, ko tā Ihowā i whakahau ai kia hoatu ki ngā iwi e iwa, ki tētahi tānga hoki o tētahi iwi; <verse eid="NUM 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 34:14" />kua whiwhi hoki te iwi o ngā tama a Reupena, ngā whare o ō rātou mātua, me te iwi o ngā tama a Kara, ngā whare o ō rātou mātua; kua whiwhi anō tētahi tānga o te iwi o Mānahi ki tō rātou wāhi. <verse eid="NUM 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 34:15" />Kua whiwhi ngā iwi e rua me tētahi tānga o tētahi iwi ki tō rātou wāhi i tēnei taha o Horano, e anga ana ki Heriko whaka te rāwhiti, ki te putanga mai o te rā.”<verse eid="NUM 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Kaituwha i te Whenua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 34:16" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 34:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 34:17" />Ko ngā ingoa ēnei o ngā kaituwha i te whenua mō koutou: ko Ereātara tohunga rāua ko Hohua tama a Nunu. <verse eid="NUM 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 34:18" />Me tango anō tētahi rangatira o tēnei iwi, o tēnei iwi, hei tuwha mō te whenua. <verse eid="NUM 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 34:19" />Ā, ko ngā ingoa o aua tāngata:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="NUM 34:19">“Karepe tama a Iepune o te iwi o Hūrā, <verse eid="NUM 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 34:20" />Ā, ko tō te iwi o ngā tama a Himiona, Hemuera tama a Amihuru. <verse eid="NUM 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 34:21" />Ko tō te iwi o Pineamine, ko Erirara tama a Kihirono. <verse eid="NUM 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 34:22" />Ko te rangatira hoki o te iwi o ngā tama a Rāna, ko Puki tama a Iokiri. <verse eid="NUM 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 34:23" />Ko te rangatira o ngā tama a Hōhepa, arā o te iwi o ngā tama a Mānahi, ko Haniere tama a Epora. <verse eid="NUM 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 34:24" />Ko te rangatira o te iwi o ngā tama a Ēparaima, ko Kemuere tama a Hipitana. <verse eid="NUM 34:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 34:25" />Ko te rangatira o te iwi o ngā tama a Hepurona, ko Eritapana, tama a Paranaka. <verse eid="NUM 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 34:26" />Ko te rangatira o te iwi o ngā tama a Ihākara, ko Paratiere tama a Atana. <verse eid="NUM 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 34:27" />Ko te rangatira o te iwi o ngā tama a Āhera, ko Ahihuru tama a Heromi. <verse eid="NUM 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 34:28" />Ko te rangatira o te iwi o ngā tama a Napatari, ko Perahere tama a Amihuru.”<verse eid="NUM 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 34:29" />Ko ēnei a Ihowā i whakahau ai hei tuwha i te kāinga mō ngā tama a Īharaira i te whenua o Kanaana.<verse eid="NUM 34:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="NUM 35" />
  <para style="s">Ngā Pā mā ngā Rīwaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 35:1" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi i ngā mānia o Moapa, i te wāhi o Horano, ki Heriko, i mea, <verse eid="NUM 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 35:2" />“Whakahaua ngā tama a Īharaira kia hōmai ki ngā Rīwaiti ētahi pā o ō rātou kāinga ka riro nei i a rātou hei nohoanga; me hoatu anō ki ngā Rīwaiti ngā wāhi o waho o aua pā ā tawhio noa. <verse eid="NUM 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 35:3" />Ā, ko ngā pā hei nohoanga mō rātou; ko ngā wāhi hoki o waho ake mō ā rātou kararehe, mō ō rātou taonga, mō ā rātou kīrehe katoa.<verse eid="NUM 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 35:4" />“Ā, ko ngā wāhi o waho o ngā pā, e hoatu e koutou ki ngā Rīwaiti, kia kotahi mano ngā whatīanga i te taiepa atu anō o te pā, ā, haere whakawaho ā tawhio noa. <verse eid="NUM 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 35:5" />Me rūri anō e koutou i waho o te pā, i te taha ki te rāwhiti kia rua mano whatīanga, i te taha ki te tonga kia rua mano whatīanga, i te taha ki te hauāuru kia rua mano whatīanga, i te taha hoki ki te raki kia rua mano whatīanga, ā, hei waenganui te pā. Ko ngā wāhi tēnei mō rātou o waho i ngā pā.<verse eid="NUM 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 35:6" />“Ā, kia ono ngā pā whakaora i roto i ngā pā e hoatu e koutou ki ngā Rīwaiti; me hoatu hei rerenga atu mō te kaiwhakamate. Kia whā tekau mā rua hoki ngā pā e tāpiritia e koutou ki ēnā. <verse eid="NUM 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 35:7" />Ko ngā pā katoa e hoatu e koutou ki ngā Rīwaiti, kia whā tekau mā waru; ērā, me ngā wāhi o waho ake. <verse eid="NUM 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 35:8" />Ā, hei roto i te wāhi tūturu o ngā tama a Īharaira ngā pā e hoatu e koutou; kia maha i roto i ngā mea maha, kia ouou hoki i roto i ngā mea ouou, kia rite ki tōna kāinga e riro i a ia ōna pā e hoatu e tērā, e tērā, ki ngā Rīwaiti.”<verse eid="NUM 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngā Pā Whakaora</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 19:1-13">Tiuteronomi 19.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 20:1-9">Hohua 20.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 35:9" />I kōrero anō a Ihowā ki a Mohi, i mea: <verse eid="NUM 35:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 35:10" />“Kōrero ki ngā tama a Īharaira, mea atu ki a rātou, E whiti koutou i Horano ki te whenua o Kanaana; <verse eid="NUM 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 35:11" />nā, ka whakarite i ētahi pā mō koutou hei pā whakaora, hei rerenga atu mō te tangata whakamate, i whakamate nei i te tangata, otiia ehara i te mea āta whakaaro. <verse eid="NUM 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 35:12" />Ā, ka waiho e koutou hei pā whakaora kei mate i te kaitakitaki; kei mate te tangata whakamate, kia tū rā anō ia ki te aroaro o te whakaminenga, kia whakawākia.<verse eid="NUM 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 35:13" />“Ā, kia ono ngā pā e waiho hei whakaora, o ngā pā e hoatu nei e koutou. <verse eid="NUM 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="NUM 35:14" />Kia toru ngā pā e hoatu e koutou i tēnei taha o Horano, kia toru hoki ngā pā e hoatu e koutou i te whenua o Kanaana; me waiho hei pā whakaora. <verse eid="NUM 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="NUM 35:15" />Hei whakaora ēnei pā e ono mō ngā tama a Īharaira, mō te manene, mō te nohonoa i roto i a koutou; hei rerenga atu mō ngā tāngata i mate ai tētahi, otiia ehara i te mea āta whakaaro.”<verse eid="NUM 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">He Ture ki te Kōhuru, te Mate Pokerehū</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="NUM 35:16" />“Otiia, ki te patu ia i a ia ki te mea rino, ā, ka mate, he kaikōhuru ia; kia mate rawa te kaikōhuru. <verse eid="NUM 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="NUM 35:17" />Ki te patu anō hoki ia i a ia ki te kōhatu i whiua e ia kia mate rawa ai, ā, ka mate, he kaikōhuru ia; kia mate rawa te kaikōhuru. <verse eid="NUM 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="NUM 35:18" />Ki te patu rānei ia i a ia ki te mea rākau a te ringa kia mate ai, ā, ka mate, he kaikōhuru ia; kia mate rawa te kaikōhuru. <verse eid="NUM 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="NUM 35:19" />Mā te kaitakitaki toto ake anō e whakamate te kaikōhuru; e whakamate ia i a ia ina tūtaki ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="NUM 35:20" />“Ki te mea he ngākau kino tōna, ā, i ka wero ia i a ia; ki te whanga atu rānei ia, ā, ka epaina atu ia kia mate; <verse eid="NUM 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="NUM 35:21" />ki te mauāhara rānei ia, ā, ka patu i a ia ki tōna ringa e mate ai ia; kia mate rawa te kaipatu, he kaikōhuru ia. E whakamatea te kaikōhuru e te kaitakitaki toto, ina tūtaki ki a ia.<verse eid="NUM 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="NUM 35:22" />“Tēnā ia, mehemea he oho noa ake tāna wero i a ia, ā, ehara i te mea mauāhara; ki te epaina rānei ia ki tētahi mea, ā, kīhai i whanga atu; <verse eid="NUM 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="NUM 35:23" />ki te kōhatu rānei, ki te mea e mate ai, ā, kīhai i kitea atu, nā kua ū ki a ia, ā, ka mate, kāhore anō hoki ōna mauāhara ki a ia, kīhai anō hoki i rapu i te hē mōna; <verse eid="NUM 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="NUM 35:24" />kātahi ka whakarite te whakaminenga i tā te kaipatu, i tā te kaitakitaki toto; kia rite ki ēnei ritenga. <verse eid="NUM 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="NUM 35:25" />Ā, ka whakaorangia e te whakaminenga te kaiwhakamate i roto i te ringa o te kaitakitaki toto, me whakahoki anō ia e te whakaminenga ki tōna pā whakaora, i rere atu ai ia; ā, ka noho ia ki reira ā mate noa te tino tohunga i whakawahia ki te hinu tapu.<verse eid="NUM 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="NUM 35:26" />“Ki te puta kau atu te kaiwhakamate ki waho o te rohe o tōna pā whakaora i rere atu nei ia; <verse eid="NUM 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="NUM 35:27" />ā, ka pono ki a ia te kaitakitaki toto ki waho o te rohe o tōna pā whakaora, ā, ka patua te kaiwhakamate e te kaitakitaki toto, e kore e whakairia he toto ki a ia. <verse eid="NUM 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="NUM 35:28" />Me noho hoki ia i roto i tōna pā whakaora, kia mate rā anō te tino tohunga; ā muri iho i te matenga o te tino tohunga ka hoki te kaiwhakamate ki tōna whenua tupu.<verse eid="NUM 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="NUM 35:29" />“Nā, hei tikanga whakawā ēnei mā koutou, i ō koutou whakatupuranga, i ō koutou nohoanga katoa.<verse eid="NUM 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="NUM 35:30" />“Ki te patu tētahi i te tangata, mā te māngai o ngā kaiwhakaatu e whakamatea ai te kaikōhuru. Kaua anō te kaiwhakaatu kotahi e whakatau hē ki tētahi, e mate ai.<verse eid="NUM 35:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="NUM 35:31" />“Kaua anō hoki e tangohia he utu mō te kaikōhuru kia ora, ki te mea he hara tōna e mate ai. Engari, kia mate rawa ia.<verse eid="NUM 35:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="NUM 35:32" />“Kaua anō e tango utu mō te tangata i rere ki tōna pā whakaora, kia hoki ai ia ki te whenua noho ai; kia mate rā anō te tohunga.<verse eid="NUM 35:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="NUM 35:33" />“Kia kore ai e whakapokea e koutou te whenua kei reira nei koutou; mā ngā toto hoki e poke ai te whenua; heoi anō hoki te mea hei pure i ngā toto i whakahekea ki te whenua, ko ngā toto o te kaiwhakaheke. <verse eid="NUM 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="NUM 35:34" />Kaua e whakapokea te whenua e noho ai koutou, e noho ai ahau; nō te mea e noho ana ahau, a Ihowā, i waenganui i ngā tama a Īharaira.”<verse eid="NUM 35:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="NUM 36" />
  <para style="s">Te Kāinga Tupu o ngā Wāhine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="NUM 36:1" />Nā, ka whakatata ngā ariki o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā hapū o ngā tama a Kireara tama a Makiri, tama a Mānahi, nō ngā hapū o ngā tama a Hōhepa, ka kōrero ki te aroaro o Mohi, ki te aroaro anō o ngā rangatira, o ngā ariki o ngā whare o ngā mātua o ngā tama a Īharaira; <verse eid="NUM 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="NUM 36:2" />ka mea, “I whakahau a Ihowā i tōku ariki kia hoatu te whenua hei kāinga tupu mō ngā tama a Īharaira, he mea rota; i whakahaua anō tōku ariki e Ihowā kia hoatu te wāhi o Teropēhara, o tō mātou teina ki āna tamāhine. <verse eid="NUM 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="NUM 36:3" />Nā, ki te mārenatia rātou ki ētahi atu o ngā tama o ērā iwi o ngā tama a Īharaira, nā, ka tītorehia tō rātou wāhi i te wāhi o ō mātou mātua, ā, ka tāpiritia ki te wāhi o te iwi e riro atu ai rātou, ā, ka tītorehia i te wāhi i meatia hei kāinga tupu mō mātou. <verse eid="NUM 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="NUM 36:4" />Ā, i te takanga hoki o te Tiupiri a ngā tama a Īharaira, nā, ka tāpiritia atu tō rātou wāhi ki te wāhi o te iwi e riro atu ai rātou, ā, ka tītorehia tō rātou kāinga i te kāinga o te iwi o ō mātou mātua.”<verse eid="NUM 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="NUM 36:5" />Nā, ka whakahau a Mohi ki ngā tama a Īharaira, he mea kī mai nā Ihowā, ā, ka mea: “He tika ngā kupu a te iwi o ngā tama a Hōhepa. <verse eid="NUM 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="NUM 36:6" />Ko tā Ihowā tēnei i whakahau ai mō ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara; e mea ana: Me mārena rātou ki ā rātou e pai ai; otiia me mārena ki te hapū o te iwi o tō rātou pāpā. <verse eid="NUM 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="NUM 36:7" />Ā, e kore e riro kē te kāinga tupu o tētahi iwi i tētahi iwi atu i roto i ngā tama a Īharaira; ka whai hoki ngā tama a Īharaira, tērā, tērā, ki te kāinga o te iwi o ō rātou mātua. <verse eid="NUM 36:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="NUM 36:8" />Me mārena anō ngā tamāhine katoa, i a rātou nei tētahi kāinga o tētahi o ngā iwi o ngā tama a Īharaira, ki tētahi o te hapū o te iwi o ō rātou pāpā; kia mau ai te kāinga tupu o ōna mātua i tēnei, i tēnei, o ngā tama a Īharaira. <verse eid="NUM 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="NUM 36:9" />Kei riro kē hoki te kāinga tupu o tētahi iwi i tētahi atu iwi; engari me whai ngā iwi o ngā tama a Īharaira, ia tangata, ia tangata, ki ō rātou kāinga ake.”<verse eid="NUM 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="NUM 36:10" />Rite tonu ki tā Ihowā i whakahau ai ki a Mohi, i pērā tā ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara; <verse eid="NUM 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="NUM 36:11" />ka riro hoki a Mahara, a Tirita, a Hokora, a Mirika, a Noa, ngā tamāhine a Teropēhara, hei wahine mā ngā tama a ngā tēina o tō rātou pāpā. <verse eid="NUM 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="NUM 36:12" />I mārenatia hoki ki ngā hapū o ngā tama a Mānahi, tama a Hōhepa, ā, i mau tō rātou kāinga tupu ki te iwi o te hapū o tō rātou pāpā.<verse eid="NUM 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="NUM 36:13" />Ko ngā whakahau ēnei me ngā whakaritenga a Ihowā i whakahaua e Mohi ki ngā tama a Īharaira i ngā mānia o Moapa i te wāhi o Horano, ki Heriko.<verse eid="NUM 36:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="NUM 36" />
</usx>